window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 Are You Going to Bring That Jiang Xianrou?","paragraphs":["1501 Are You Going to Bring That Jiang Xianrou?","A few days ago, she had been overjoyed that she could become a member of the Pharmacy Association. She had been filled with anticipation, thinking that she could step on Qiao Nian and experience another world.","Now, Jiang Xianrou’s heart sank when she looked at Robert’s reply, calling her an ‘ordinary member’. She clenched her fingernails so tightly that they dug into her flesh.","It would be fine if Qiao Nian only knew Zhong Yiliu, but if she had other connections with the Pharmacist Association... Jiang Xianrou couldn’t accept it just thinking about it.","Qiao Nian probably just happened to know Dean Zhong by chance. It was impossible for her to be related to the Pharmacy Association, right?","!!","...","The following day.","Qiao Nian woke up early in the morning. She went downstairs to check out, then took a taxi to the airport to get her plane ticket.","Country M only had two flights a day to Beijing International Airport.","She bought the earliest flight.","Her flight would take off at ten in the morning and arrive in Beijing around seven in the afternoon.","The weather in Country M had changed a lot. It was quite cold today.","Qiao Nian put on a denim jacket over her sweater. She pulled up the hoodie, making it look quite warm. However, she went to buy a hot drink after arriving at the airport.","As there was still an hour before the plane took off, Qiao Nian was in no hurry to leave.","Zhong Yiliu called her just as she found a seat.","Qiao Nian plugged in her earphones and swiped her fair fingertips across the phone screen. She picked up the call and said in a hoarse voice, “Hello.”","“Your flight was this morning?” Zhong Yijian was still the same as before. He spoke quickly and urgently, doing everything in a hurry.","Qiao Nian looked up at the flight information above her head and then replied lazily, “Ah, ten in the morning.”","“Ten o’clock? Let me see what time it is.”","Zhong Yiliu had probably gone to check the time. After a while, he said, “Only an hour left? Why didn’t you tell me in advance? Wait for me. I’ll come over and send you off. Don’t enter the security checkpoint.”","The people on the plane could only stay at the airport. If Qiao Nian entered the security checkpoint, Zhong Yiliu wouldn’t be able to enter.","Actually, there was a way in.","With the Pharmacy Association’s status in Country M and his status as the dean, it would only take him minutes to find someone at the airport.","However, neither Zhong Yiliu nor Qiao Nian liked trouble. They preferred to solve problems in a simple way.","Qiao Nian leaned lazily against the lounge chair in the airport. Lowering her eyes, she whispered to him, “There’s no need to go through so much trouble. I’m leaving soon.”","Zhong Yiliu had just taken his coat. Hesitation flashed across his face. “You took the trouble to come, and I didn’t even send you off...”","Qiao Nian didn’t think much of it. “It’s too rushed this time. Maybe next time.”","Zhong Yiliu looked at the time. It was indeed a little rushed.","It would take at least half an hour to get to the airport. He might not even be able to reach the airport in time if he left now.","In addition, Qiao Nian had said that she was in a hurry, so he gave up on the idea of sending her off. Instead, he glanced at the things the other members of the Pharmacy Association had sent him on the computer. Then, he remembered something and said, “By the way, we have a few new members this time. One of them is from China.”","Recalling that Qiao Nian had been there yesterday, he said in a gentle tone, “It’s the one you saw yesterday. What’s her name again?”","Qiao Nian retracted the arrogance in her eyes. “Jiang Xianrou.”","“Ah, yes, that’s the name,” Zhong said. “She wants to learn Chinese medicine. Are you taking her?”"]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 Qiao Nian Is at Least a Senior Elder","paragraphs":["1502 Qiao Nian Is at Least a Senior Elder","Zhong Yiliu would definitely not have asked Qiao Nian if it were anyone else.","He asked Qiao Nian if she wanted to take on the new member mainly because this new member was from Country Z. Qiao Nian had always been quite good to Country Z.","The information that Jiang Xianrou had filled in said that she wanted to learn Chinese medicine. Only then did he think of Qiao Nian.","No one in the entire Pharmacy Association was more accomplished in this aspect than her.","!!","Although Qiao Nian had left the Pharmacy Association, to him she was still a member. As long as Qiao Nian was willing to come back, her level would not be lower than Robert’s.","She was at least one of the senior members of the Pharmacy Association.","A senior elder.","In Zhong Yiliu’s eyes, Qiao Nian was definitely above Jiang Xianrou.","“No.” Qiao Nian didn’t even consider rejecting him directly. A casual smile even appeared on her lips. “I can’t.”","Her tone was quite lazy, and a hint of amusement could be detected in her voice.","Seeing that she was unwilling to teach Jiang Xianrou, Zhong Yiliu also lost interest in her. He casually said, “Alright, I’ll arrange a teacher for her. An ordinary member like her is indeed not qualified for you to personally teach. If you’re willing, Robert will definitely be the first to sign up.”","Qiao Nian smiled noncommittally, her eyes narrowing. “I’m not free. I have to study. Let’s talk about it in the future.”","“?”","Zhong Yiliu didn’t understand what she meant by ‘study’. Apart from focusing on research, he rarely paid attention to the outside world. He didn’t know that Qiao Nian was so bored that she went to Qing University to study and even became the college entrance examination’s top scorer.","He didn’t ask any more questions. After chatting with Qiao Nian for a while more, he hung up.","Qiao Nian looked at her phone and opened WeChat after hanging up.","Ye Wangchuan did not reply to her messages for the entire day.","On the other hand, Qin Si was energetic and sent her a few game links.","Qiao Nian rubbed her fingers against her phone with a restrained expression. It was unknown what she was thinking.","She had asked someone to check on Ji Lin last night. She had found the name familiar. The investigation found out that the other party’s identity was quite surprising.","Someone from Bright Gate.","She had heard of Bright Gate before, but she didn’t expect that the person who gave her the phone number was from Bright Gate.","Ji Lin had told her yesterday that he worked for Ye Wangchuan.","In other words, Bright Gate...","The airport broadcast told the passengers flying to Country Z to check their tickets at security.","Qiao Nian finished half of her drink and threw the paper cup into the trash can. Then, she stood up handsomely and walked towards the security checkpoint.","She lowered her head and sent a message to Xu Jishen.","...","Ten hours later.","The plane landed at Beijing International Airport.","Qiao Nian was greeted by Beijing’s hot weather when she got off the plane. Even though it was already seven o’clock in the evening in Beijing, and the sun was setting, the weather was still unbearably hot.","She saw people walking around the airport in short-sleeved shorts as soon as she got off the plane.","Only she was wrapped up tightly. She even added a jacket over her sweater.","Qiao Nian could feel people looking at her as she walked.","She pulled her cap down irritably, revealing only her well-defined chin. Her skin was pale and prominent.","It was mainly because her aura was outstanding and eye-catching.","She turned her phone back on when she got off the plane.","Xu Jishen called her at this moment.","“Hello, Miss Qiao, are you off the plane? I’ll wait for you outside Terminal No. 6. Let me know when you come out. I’ll pick you up.”"]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 Sister Nian Arrived in Time","paragraphs":["1503 Sister Nian Arrived in Time","Qiao Nian said casually as she walked out, “No. 6, right? I’ll come out to look for you.”","“You got off the plane?”","Without thinking, Xu Jishen immediately said, “I’ll go in and pick you up, Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Nian had already walked out.","She walked out and immediately saw Xu Jishen standing by the car by the road. Someone familiar was standing beside him.","Qiao Nian’s voice was low and pleasant. “No need. I can see you.”","She finished speaking and hung up. Then, she raised her hand and waved in his direction.","Xu Jishen was originally looking around for her while speaking on the phone. Thus, he immediately walked over when he saw her walking out of the exit.","“Miss Qiao, why did you come out so quickly? I saw the flight information. The plane just landed.” Xu Jishen’s facial features were not as outstanding as Ye Wangchuan’s, but he had thick eyebrows and big eyes. He looked very energetic.","He was wearing a red and white striped polo shirt and casual pants today. He looked fresh and handsome. He wasn’t a hunk, but at least he was good-looking.","Qiao Nian was used to Ye Wangchuan and Qin Si’s looks. She didn’t think much of Xu Jishen’s appearance. It seemed that even Gu San was slightly better looking than him.","She did no more than glance at him as she slipped the phone back into her pocket. “I didn’t take my luggage,” she said, her eyes open and honest.","She didn’t need to go claim her baggage, so she came straight out.","Thus, it didn’t take long.","Only then did Xu Jishen notice that the girl’s hands were empty. She was only carrying a shoulder bag, looking very cool.","He was silent.","At this moment, Jiang Yao, who was walking behind him, saw the girl and greeted her with an awkward expression, “Nian Nian.”","At first, Qiao Nian didn’t notice him. Only when he called out to her did she raise her eyebrows and remember whose face this was.","Oh, the Jiang Family.","Jiang Xianrou’s brother.","Jiang Yao’s voice was soft and muffled, so she ignored him. As she walked, she said to Xu Jishen, “Don’t stand here. Let’s go back first.”","Xu Jishen didn’t notice Jiang Yao’s awkwardness. All he cared about was his grandfather. Thus, he hurriedly followed the girl, ignoring Jiang Yao, who had followed him here.","Jiang Yao saw that the two of them had completely ignored him and felt awkward. His face burned.","He hesitated a moment, then followed.","...","It took three hours to get from Beijing to Rao City.","It was almost ten in the evening when Qiao Nian arrived at Rao City Hospital.","Then, she immediately entered Su Huaiyuan’s ward and evaluated his various physical indicators with the attending doctor.","After confirming that Su Huaiyuan could use the medicine, Qiao Nian handed the medicine to the doctor.","It took another full hour to put the CD-3 to use.","The CD-3 that Qiao Nian had brought back was, after all, the latest targeted drug developed by the Pharmaceutical Association’s laboratory. After a shot of the drug, Su Huaiyuan’s terrible condition began to stabilize...","Half an hour later.","Qiao Nian and the attending doctor walked out of the ward.","“Doctor, how’s my dad?”","The Su family had long received the news that Qiao Nian had brought the medicine back. They all rushed to the hospital.","Su Hui had been staying at the hospital to take care of Su Huaiyuan for the past few days. She was the first to discover that Qiao Nian and the others had come out. She was also the first to hurriedly grab the attending doctor’s arm and ask about her father’s condition.","“Is my dad okay?”"]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 Unusual Relationship With the Pharmacy Association","paragraphs":["1504 Unusual Relationship With the Pharmacy Association","The rest of the Su family surrounded him. Xu Jishen had also waited outside for nearly two hours. His heart was in his mouth as he waited for the final result.","“Doctor, my grandfather...”","The CD-3 targeted medicine that Qiao Nian had brought back was Su Huaiyuan’s only hope. If this hope was destroyed, they could only prepare for the worst.","Even Jiang Yao came over with everyone else and waited nervously for the doctor to answer.","!!","The director of the oncology department of the city hospital took off his mask and folded it before putting it into the pocket of his white coat. He smiled at everyone and said, “Old Master Su is fine!","“CD-3 is indeed a targeted drug developed by the Pharmacy Association’s laboratory. Its effect is obvious. With one injection, Old Master Su’s condition immediately improved. As long as he continues to take the drug, I believe Old Master Su’s condition will become more and more stable...”","His words undoubtedly injected a shot of adrenaline into the Su family.","Tears welled up in Su Hui’s eyes. She covered her mouth with her hand and almost choked. “It’s good that he’s fine. It’s good that he’s fine.”","Su Huaiyuan was the pillar of the family.","He being fine was undoubtedly great news for the rest of the family!","Third Aunt grinned more widely than anyone else.","Turning to Qiao Nian, he said very kindly, “I knew that the doctor Jishen mentioned could do it! Indeed, you can’t judge a book by its cover. Although she’s young, it doesn’t affect her ability.”","The other relatives echoed her.","Xu Jishen pursed his lips and pretended not to remember that she was the one who had been suspicious of Qiao Nian when she first saw her. One moment, she said that Qiao Nian was young, and the next, she was afraid that Qiao Nian couldn’t treat his grandfather.","Now that Qiao Nian had brought the medicine and her grandfather’s various indicators had stabilized, they knew better than anyone else how to pretend to be innocent.","Ignoring his relatives, he turned his head and said to the girl worriedly, “Miss Qiao, that medicine...”","He was worried that Qiao Nian had not brought back enough medicine.","After all, the doctor had said that he would need to continue to use the medicine.","Qiao Nian seemed to know what he was going to say. She raised her black eyelashes slightly and said in a rather casual tone, “I brought back five doses. It’s only enough for five days.”","A second ago, the Su family was still happy that Su Huaiyuan’s condition had stabilized. A second later, they couldn’t smile anymore when they heard that she had only brought back five days’ worth of medicine.","“Then, what should we do?” Su Hui’s heart skipped a beat and her face turned pale again.","Xu Jishen also opened his mouth but didn’t know what to say.","He was happy for nothing?","Qiao Nian had been running around the entire day and was quite tired. She narrowed her eyes, unable to suppress the frustration in them.","She put one hand in her pocket and said unhurriedly, “I asked the people from the Pharmacy Association. They said that the medicine will lose its effect if it leaves the cold storage room for too long. It’s useless even if I bring it all back. I’ve spoken to them. They’ll send the medicine over every three days. Someone will contact you, then.”","Xu Jishen and Su Hui were naturally overjoyed. They were extremely grateful to Qiao Nian.","Jiang Yao stood at the side. Qiao Nian’s tone was confident when she mentioned the Pharmacy Association. Then, he thought about Jiang Xianrou, who had also gone there. He felt complicated and frustrated for a moment.","His mobile rang at this moment.","He was barely acknowledged in the hospital corridor.","Not to mention noticing his phone ring.","Jiang Yao walked away with a straight face to the corner of the stairs and took out his phone. He lowered his eyes to look—"]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 Jiang Yao Is Unwilling to Pick Her Up","paragraphs":["1505 Jiang Yao Is Unwilling to Pick Her Up","[Brother, I’ve arrived in Country M. Mom reported to the Pharmacy Association with me this morning. I’m already a member of the Association. I’ll come back with Mom when I’m done here. Can you pick me up at the airport in about a week?]","Jiang Xianrou’s words were light. From the looks of it, she hadn’t met Qiao Nian at the Pharmacy Association.","She didn’t mention her at all.","Jiang Yao’s eyes darkened. He did not reply to her message and put his phone back into his pocket.","...","On the other side, Country M.","Jiang Xianrou hadn’t eaten anything all night and did not have much of an appetite.","She sat in her room and sent a message to Jiang Yao. She thought that he would reply to her soon.","She waited and waited.","She waited for a full hour, but there was no response from him.","The WeChat message she sent to report the good news was like a stone sinking into the sea. There was no news.","Jiang Xianrou’s bad mood worsened. She pursed her lips and opened WeChat again to find Jiang Yao’s profile picture.","At first, it was all messages from him.","He asked her if she had arrived in Country M and if she had reported to the Pharmacy Association successfully...","Jiang Yao had sent her a lot of messages.","She never replied.","The latest message was the one she replied to Jiang Yao. What followed was a long wait...","Jiang Yao did not reply to her at all!","Jiang Xianrou’s eyes flickered as she sent him another message.","[Brother? Are you asleep?]","She couldn’t think of a reason why Jiang Yao would not reply to her message. Unless he was asleep and did not see the message!","She felt a little better at the thought.","Just as she was about to put down her phone and wash up, Jiang Xianrou saw Jiang Yao’s nickname on WeChat from the corner of her eye.","She immediately perked up again and waited for him to reply.","Jiang Yao’s reply was not slow. The message came back in less than a minute.","Jiang Xianrou was filled with anticipation as she looked over.","Jiang Yao: [I’m going to the illegal district the day after tomorrow. I might not be back in a week. Tell the driver in advance when you arrive at the airport and ask him to pick you up.]","Jiang Xianrou suspected that she had seen it wrong.","Jiang Yao had doted on her the most since she was young.","Compared to her, Jiang Li looked more like he had been picked up from outside.","But now...","Jiang Xianrou’s heart sank when she saw that Jiang Yao refused to pick her up.","She was too frustrated to reply to him.","Jiang Xianrou exited the chat room and saw that, other than Ruan Sisi asking if she had arrived at the Pharmacy Association, everyone else acted as if they were dead.","Jiang Xianrou felt even more stifled. After thinking about it, she still found Zhang Yang’s WeChat and sent him a message.","Jiang Xianrou: [I’ll be back in a week. Do you have time to come out to eat with me?]","...","On the other side, at Lan Pavilion.","Qin Si, Bo Jingxing, and the others were together.","Zhang Yang and Tang Ning were also there.","Most of the people were sitting around the table. The atmosphere was quite heavy. No one said anything.","At this moment, Zhang Yang’s phone vibrated. He silently picked it up and walked to the side to take a look. He saw Jiang Xianrou’s message when he opened WeChat.","He laughed involuntarily.","“Who is it?” Qin Si propped his leg up and looked at him irritably with an electronic cigarette between his teeth.","After all, with everyone so quiet, Zhang Yang was especially eye-catching.","Zhang Yang walked back with his phone.","“Miss Jiang.”"]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 Qin Si: Could She Have Fallen For You?","paragraphs":["1506 Qin Si: Could She Have Fallen For You?","Qin Si was confused.","Tang Ning was also wondering why Jiang Xianrou was looking for Zhang Yang. However, she was just a small fry here. Qin Si and the others did not ask, so she was not qualified to speak.","“Why is she looking for you?” As expected, Qin Si was the most impatient. He blew out a smoke ring impatiently and couldn’t even be bothered to mention Jiang Xianrou’s name.","Zhang Yang said, “Miss Jiang told me that she’ll be back in a week and asked me to eat with her.”","!!","Qin Si looked up at him and asked in a surprised tone, “Oh, she likes you?”","Zhang Yang’s face darkened at his words. He quickly waved his hand and explained, “Young Master Qin, don’t joke with me. Miss Jiang is arrogant. How can she take a fancy to me?","“I reckon Miss Jiang wants to ask you and Master Wang out through me...”","Unfortunately, Jiang Xianrou had offended Miss Qiao, so Young Master Qin and the others could no longer care about Jiang Xianrou.","That was what Zhang Yang thought. It was the way to survive in this circle if one did not expose some things!","He didn’t have to spell it out.","As expected.","Qin Si immediately revealed a disgusted expression and did not hide his disdain when he heard that Jiang Xianrou wanted to ask him out. “She’s dreaming.”","He thought for a moment and pursed his lips, then said coldly, “That’s true. She went to the Pharmacy Association and hooked up with the Qi family. She was very glorious in Beijing some time ago and gathered with Ruan Sisi and the others every day.”","The forces in Beijing were also divided.","The Ruan family had a good relationship with the Wei family. They had a... nodding relationship with the Ye family and their family.","Jiang Xianrou had fallen out with them, but it did not affect her playing with Ruan Sisi and the others.","He heard that some time ago, Jiang Xianrou was still very close to the Zhou family. Zhou Hengfeng was just short of forming a small group to fight with them.","Now, she came to Zhang Yang again... Qin Si couldn’t understand what was going on in her mind. Did she think that everyone else was stupid and that she was the only one who was so smart?","“Young Master Qin, don’t say that. The Pharmacy Association is very impressive. No one expected Miss Jiang to be able to enter it.”","Zhang Yang spoke nicely, but anyone with ears could hear the mockery in his words. He was mocking Jiang Xianrou for being so self-righteous.","“She’s a member of the Pharmacy Association now. Even if she’s just an ordinary member, plenty of people in Beijing want to curry favor with her.”","The Pharmacy Association was just a research organization that developed drugs. But in that case, anyone in this world who was related to birth, aging, illness, and death had a high status.","Everyone was afraid of death.","Even those at the top of the pyramid were equally afraid of death.","At such a time, the Pharmacy Association seemed precious.","How could the advanced potions being developed in the Pharmacy Association’s laboratory not be precious?","Jiang Xianrou was indeed powerful enough to enter the Pharmacy Association and come into contact with those top-notch big shots. No wonder she was so arrogant.","“That has nothing to do with me. If that day comes, I won’t beg her even if I have to lie flat on my back.”","Qin Si was very irritable when he mentioned Jiang Xianrou, even if they were in private.","“She’s an idiot.”","Qin Si was definitely talking about Jiang Xianrou.","After saying that, he didn’t care if Zhang Yang replied to Jiang Xianrou’s message.","He raised his chin and looked at Bo Jingxing worriedly. He asked anxiously, “How is it? Your uncle hasn’t been able to contact Master Wang yet?”"]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 They Couldn’t Contact Master Wang Either","paragraphs":["1507 They Couldn’t Contact Master Wang Either","“No.” Bo Jingxing sat by the window.","Zhang Yang did not say anything when he was chatting with Qin Si. He lowered his head and paid attention to his phone the entire time, afraid that he would miss Bo Zheng’s call.","Yet his phone had been on the table all day, but not a single call came.","Bo Zheng had not called. Even Luo Ming, who was with him, had not called...","“It’s been almost eight hours, why is there still no news!” Qin Si couldn’t hold it in anymore. He scratched his head so hard that it was about to burst.","Not in the mood to care about Jiang Xianrou sending a message to Zhang Yang, he threw the smoking stick on the table, stood up, and paced around.","He suddenly stopped and looked past Tang Ning and the others at Bo Jingxing and asked anxiously, “Do you think Uncle Bo forgot about us?”","Bo Jingxing sat by the window. The light shone on the buttons on his collar, and the metallic buttons glowed.","All eyes turned to him.","Bo Jingxing’s expression darkened and he broke his reverie without hesitation. “That’s impossible. I told my third uncle to contact me immediately if there’s any news of Wangchuan. He didn’t call me back, so there’s no news of Master Wang yet.”","Qin Si didn’t give up. He opened his mouth and wanted to ask him to make a call.","Bo Jingxing pushed his gold-rimmed glasses up the bridge of his nose and said, “Even if he forgets, Deputy Captain Luo will definitely remember. There’s no news from either of them now, which means that they haven’t contacted anyone yet...”","Qin Si’s eyes dimmed as he sat back down in frustration.","Zhang Yang and Tang Ning did not dare to speak.","They had also heard about what happened in Shuangjiang City. Master Wang and Young Master Bo went to get something. Later on, Young Master Bo returned first, and Master Wang temporarily stayed there to deal with the aftermath.","Who knew that it would suddenly rain heavily in Shuangjiang City yesterday?","Master Wang and the others happened to encounter a mudslide. Now, they had lost contact with the outside world.","Those outside couldn’t get in.","No one inside could get out, either.","Coupled with the continuous rainstorm, the signal base station had been washed out. There was no signal.","Now, the people outside couldn’t contact the inside, nor could they confirm the situation inside.","Bo Zheng was in charge of this rescue operation.","They could only wait here for Bo Zheng’s news.","Qin Si couldn’t contact anyone for the entire day. He tried to call Ye Wangchuan, but he couldn’t get through.","It was the same when he called Gu San.","It had been almost 24 hours since Master Wang lost contact...","Qin Si felt as if ten thousand ants were crawling in his heart. He was still restless even when he sat down. He was silent for less than ten minutes before he looked at Bo Jingxing and said, “Why don’t you contact your uncle again? Sister Qiao is coming back. I’m afraid I can’t hide it anymore.”","Before the news of the landslide in Shuangjiang City came out, he had sent Qiao Nian messages every day about forming a team. He wanted to pull her onto the team and win as few games.","Unable to contact Master Wang, Qin Si no longer dared to send Qiao Nian any messages.","He had been quiet as a mouse since morning.","Fortunately, Qiao Nian didn’t look for him.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t know how to tell her this news.","Bo Jingxing hesitated for a moment and then picked up his phone and walked out. He was probably going to contact his third uncle to ask about the situation.","...","The following day.","At ten in the morning.","Qiao Nian came out of the Beijing Airport. She hailed a taxi by the roadside and opened the door to get in.","“To Rhine Apartments.”"]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 Sister Nian: It’s Not Normal For Qin Si to Be as Quiet as a Chicken!","paragraphs":["1508 Sister Nian: It’s Not Normal For Qin Si to Be as Quiet as a Chicken!","The taxi driver heard the girl’s pleasant voice in the backseat. She was wearing a baseball cap. He stole a glance in the rearview mirror and couldn’t see her face clearly.","He pressed the meter, answered, turned the car around, and headed toward Qing University.","...","The taxi rolled smoothly down the road.","Qiao Nian opened the window to let the wind in.","She looked down as she took her phone from her pocket and turned it on.","A lot of information popped up.","She didn’t read a single one. She found WeChat and opened it.","Her first WeChat contact was still quiet. Until now, he had not replied to her messages.","Her mouth tightened and her eyes darkened. She logged out of WeChat and pulled up another contact.","Qiao Nian thought for a minute, then dialed the number.","“Beep...”","The other party did not pick up immediately.","Qiao Nian waited patiently, her arms by her side, her long legs propped up. She appeared unruly and a little nonchalant. However, her eyes were serious.","She was quite restrained.","“Beep...”","There was still no answer after seven or eight rings. It didn’t take long for the line to hang up automatically.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and took the phone away. She looked at it and called again.","She had already realized since yesterday that the people from Beijing were too quiet!","Usually, other than Qin Si looking for her, Zhang Yang would also send her messages from time to time.","However, the two of them had disappeared ever since she lost contact with Ye Wangchuan. They didn’t even appear on WeChat or the group anymore.","Not a word since yesterday.","Forget about Zhang Yang, Qin Si’s sudden silence was illogical.","However, since Qin Si and the others were avoiding her, Qiao Nian reckoned that even if she went to look for them, they wouldn’t tell her what had happened.","She had been busy with Su Huaiyuan until one in the morning last night. She had found a hotel nearby and basically did not sleep.","She even rushed back to Beijing early in the morning.","She was really not in a good mood.","The phone rang ten more times. Just when she thought no one would answer, the call finally went through.","Qiao Nian propped herself up on one elbow, a calming power in her eyes. Her voice was steady and strong. “Hey, Aunt Ye, where are you? I’ll go look for you.”","...","On the other side.","Qin Si and the others were already preparing to set off.","They had waited the entire night for Bo Zheng to return the call. Even someone as steady as Bo Jingxing couldn’t hold it in anymore. In the morning, they discussed and prepared to rush to Shuangjiang City to take a look. It was better than waiting in the capital.","Qin Si was about to drive off when Ye Lan called.","Qin Si picked up the phone and said in a hoarse voice, “Hello, Aunt Ye?”","Bo Jingxing and Zhang Yang wanted to go, too.","As for Tang Ning, she was a girl and had other things to do, so she couldn’t go.","Everyone took their places, ready to go.","The two of them looked over upon seeing that Qin Si had received Ye Lan’s call.","“Now?” Qin Si placed a hand on the steering wheel and rolled down the window. He looked at the iconic building on the side of the road and said, “I’m on Chang’an Street, next to the mall. We’re about to leave... Well, we haven’t left yet. Bo Jingxing has contacted his third uncle. He knows that we’re going over.”","It was unknown what Ye Lan said, but Qin Si’s expression was clearly unhappy. “I understand. When is she coming over?”","Zhang Yang wanted to ask who it was. However, he was too embarrassed to say anything upon seeing that Qin Si was still on the phone."]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509 Help Me See If That Person Is Sister Qiao","paragraphs":["1509 Help Me See If That Person Is Sister Qiao","“...Yes, I’ll wait.” Qin Si couldn’t help but say before hanging up, “Aunt Ye, tell that person to hurry up.”","The person on the other end seemed to hang up.","Qin Si slowly put down his phone under their gazes. He turned his head and said to the two of them with a burning gaze, “Aunt Ye said that someone wants to go to Shuangjiang City with us.”","“Who?” Bo Jingxing frowned and was very impatient. It was obvious that he was unwilling to bring another person over.","Qin Si was also unwilling, but since Ye Lan had spoken, he couldn’t refuse. “I didn’t ask. Aunt Ye was quite anxious, so I held back.”","He raised his watch and looked at the time. He placed his hand on the steering wheel again and said in a heavier tone, “Aunt Ye said that person might be able to help. I don’t know what she’s thinking.”","With Master Wang missing, even Bo Jingxing’s uncle could not be contacted. Who would be so capable as to help?","Aunt Lan was really desperate!","She was being fooled!","“Anyway, let’s wait for a while. Aunt Ye said that the other party is on the way here. It will probably take some time.”","Qin Si himself was distraught and clearly did not want to wait, but since Ye Lan had spoken, Bo Jingxing couldn’t say anything. He nodded and did not say another word. He lowered his head and sent a message to Luo Ming. He told him that they were bringing another person with them.","...","They waited for half an hour.","Qin Si almost exploded from waiting.","He wanted to tell Ye Lan that they were in a hurry and ask her to find another way to go over.","In the end, he forcefully suppressed his frustration after considering Ye Lan’s mood.","Until a taxi pulled up a hundred meters away from them and the door opened and a figure got out.","His gaze was drawn over, and he couldn’t help but take a few more glances.","He immediately recognized her.","He instinctively called out, “Sister Qiao?”","“Qiao Nian? Where is she?” Bo Jingxing rolled down the window and looked in the direction Qin Si was pointing.","“Do you think that person is Sister Qiao?” Qin Si wasn’t sure.","It was mainly because he had heard Gu San mention before that Qiao Nian wasn’t in Beijing. In addition, he invited her to play games for the past two days, but Qiao Nian ignored him. She seemed very busy.","At this moment, seeing a familiar person, Qin Si couldn’t think straight. “Am I seeing things? Is that person Sister Qiao?”","Qiao Nian’s aura was outstanding.","She was the type who would be recognized immediately if she was thrown into a crowd.","Although Qin Si couldn’t think straight, he was 80% sure that he wasn’t seeing things. The girl who got out of the taxi and was walking towards them was Qiao Nian.","He couldn’t help but blurt out, “Damn, it’s really Sister Qiao!”","Bo Jingxing rubbed his temples. “No wonder Aunt Ye called you and asked you to wait. It makes sense if it’s Qiao Nian.”","This time, Master Wang had an accident. No one dared to tell the old man, afraid that he wouldn’t be able to take the shock and would be hospitalized.","Therefore, Ye Lan was in charge the entire time.","Everyone in Beijing was keeping an eye on the Ye family’s movements, wanting to obtain firsthand information.","Ye Lan was exhausted from dealing with those people and hadn’t rested well for two days. Other than Qiao Nian, Ye Lan probably wouldn’t care about anyone else.","As they talked, the girl walked up to their car, raised her hand, and knocked on the glass. “Open up.”","She was f*cking cool!","Qin Si was stunned for a second as his mind blanked. He finally realized that he had locked the door and it couldn’t be open from the outside."]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510 This Isn’t a Zoo, Are They Coming to Visit?","paragraphs":["1510 This Isn’t a Zoo, Are They Coming to Visit?","“Ooooh!”","He hurriedly unlocked the door.","The girl pulled down her cap. Her eyes were quite dry, but she didn’t say anything. After opening the door, she quickly bent down and got in.","Only then did he turn to look at the person getting into the car. He stammered, “Qiao, Sister Qiao, why are you here?”","Qiao Nian sat in the front passenger seat and fastened her seatbelt. Hearing this, she glanced at him coldly.","“...” Qin Si touched the bridge of his nose in embarrassment and explained dryly, “I... I was afraid that you would be worried, so I didn’t dare to tell you. I didn’t mean to hide it from you.”","“Hmm.” The girl leaned back in the passenger seat and nodded. He didn’t know if she believed him, but her voice was slightly restrained and a little hoarse as she said, “Let’s go.”","It was still a few hours’ drive from Beijing to Shuangjiang City.","Qiao Nian didn’t waste her breath on Qin Si. She only greeted Bo Jingxing and Zhang Yang briefly before leaning back in her seat, not saying anything.","Qin Si felt guilty and found many topics to talk about along the way.","Unfortunately, Qiao Nian ignored him.","She closed her eyes to rest, causing Qin Si to shut his mouth and finally quiet down...","...","Shuangjiang City, Emergency Rescue Office.","Bo Zheng was communicating with the technicians. “How is it? Is there still no way to contact them?”","A computer was placed in front of the technician. He was typing out a series of codes quickly, but the situation was not optimistic.","“No. The base station was destroyed by a flash flood. There’s no way to send a signal unless someone inside fixes the signal station.”","There was some silence.","It was still raining heavily in Shuangjiang City. Even helicopters couldn’t get in this extreme weather. How could anyone fix the base station?","Bo Zheng rubbed his temples and urged the technicians to try sending a signal inside.","Even if he couldn’t send a signal in, he could at least find a way to search for the location of the people inside.","The technician’s expression was solemn. He couldn’t guarantee that he could locate them. He only said, “Captain Bo, I’ll try my best. But it’s difficult for us to pinpoint the exact location in this situation. Unless a top expert is holding down the fort and there’s such a possibility...”","They were already absolute experts on the subject.","However, experts were also divided into different levels. Their talent was limited, and they only had that much ability.","Bo Zheng couldn’t help but think of the girl he had seen in Beijing when he heard this. If that girl was there, she might be able to locate Gu San and the others...","He was thinking that when Luo Ming came in from outside with an ugly expression. “Captain Bo, Young Master Bo just sent me a message saying that they’re bringing another person... I didn’t want them to come in the first place. Aren’t they just going to cause trouble? It’s already troublesome that they’re coming, but they still have to bring another person! Why are they coming? This isn’t a zoo. Come and take a look!”","“He still wants to bring another person?” Bo Zheng didn’t expect his nephew to mess around. Feeling a headache, he asked, “When will they arrive?”","Luo Ming had always been impartial. Even if the person was Bo Jingxing, he did not have a good expression and said expressionlessly, “They’re almost here. I think he sent me a message two hours ago. They’ll be here soon if they set off at that time!”","Luo Ming emphasized his words, his expression clearly sour.","“I wonder who Young Master Bo is bringing!”"]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511 We Can Only Find the Red Alliance Now","paragraphs":["1511 We Can Only Find the Red Alliance Now","“His friend, I guess,” Bo Zheng said, but his brows were furrowed. His tone didn’t sound good.","Luo Ming couldn’t complain anymore upon seeing that he was also angered by Bo Jingxing wanting to bring another friend over.","So, he walked behind the technician and looked at the series of codes on the other man’s screen. “Well?” he asked in a low voice.","The technician had already taken his hands off the keyboard and repeated what he had said to Bo Zheng.","In the end, he still said, “With our current technology, there’s almost no possibility of accurate positioning. Even if we can, it will take at least two to three days...”","Luo Ming fell silent with a cold expression.","It would be too late by then!","At this moment, Bo Zheng walked over and stood behind the technician. He placed his hand on the back of the chair and whispered, “I heard that Zhou Hengfeng is nearby?”","“Him?”","Luo Ming looked up at him with a hesitant expression. “He can’t do it, right? Zhou Hengfeng is famous for his ability. We asked him to check on Eagle Eye previously, but he couldn’t find him either. It’s useless to ask him.”","He was talking about the last time.","“He’s the only hacker in the country who’s slightly capable.” Bo Zheng’s gaze landed on the technician’s screen; it was filled with green codes. Unfortunately, none of them were useful.","The Ye family had been urging him to locate them as soon as possible. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to hide it from Old Master Ye.","However, the extreme weather in Shuangjiang City had not improved. The helicopter couldn’t enter the city, and they didn’t have a precise location. It was almost impossible to find anyone.","This time, not only were Ye Wangchuan, Gu San, and the others trapped inside but also many other people...","Be it for business or personal reasons, Bo Zheng wanted to pinpoint the location as soon as possible and send reinforcements in.","His thoughts were voluptuous before, but now they were bony!","He was thinking about one thing, but the dilemma was another.","Bo Zheng rubbed his temples and looked at his deputy. “Should we look for the Red Alliance?”","Luo Ming was also a member of the criminal investigation team and was in charge of the international side. Of course, he knew about the illegal district and the Red Alliance.","He was surprised when he heard this. After a long time, he said vaguely, “But it’s not easy to find the Red Alliance. They usually don’t take on private jobs, and they haven’t taken on many external missions in the past two years. The last time was when they helped Young Master Qin. Many forces in the country were shocked. I didn’t expect the Red Alliance to take on domestic jobs.","“Besides, they’ve never taken on this kind of job before. Those people are famous for being arrogant. It’s probably even harder to get the Red Alliance to help!”","Of course, Bo Zheng knew that what Luo Ming said was a real problem. However, he had no choice now. He took a deep breath and said, “I’ll look for them personally and see if I can contact them.”","“But the Red Alliance might not care...” Luo Ming hesitated.","“We won’t know until we try.”","Bo Zheng interrupted him. “We don’t have any other choice now! That’s it, I’ll try. You should also contact Zhou Hengfeng and see if it’s convenient for him to come over.”","Zhou Hengfeng, the number one hacker in the country.","This title was a little fake, but a dead horse was a Hail Mary. What if!","Bo Zheng couldn’t think of any other way. He could only instruct Luo Ming to contact Zhou Hengfeng as soon as possible and ask him to come over.","In addition, perhaps he would also have to contact the Red Alliance through the underground black market’s network...","...","An hour later.","Qin Si’s Land Rover parked outside the emergency rescue office."]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512 Not Letting Sister Nian In","paragraphs":["1512 Not Letting Sister Nian In","He was familiar with everyone. After informing the guards, he rushed inside with Qiao Nian and the others.","Even Bo Jingxing was not as smooth as him. He knew many people.","However, they were stopped when they walked into the office where Bo Zheng and the technician were staying.","The other party sized them up and did not make things difficult for them. He said bluntly, “I’m sorry. Young Master Bo, Young Master Qin, you can go in. The rest of you, please wait outside.”","Qin Si frowned and almost lost his temper. He suppressed his anger and said angrily, “We came together. Why can’t they go in?”","He was referring to Qiao Nian and the others.","However, the other party did not give him any face. “Our technicians are inside. Some things are not convenient for outsiders to see, so only Young Master Bo and Young Master Qin can enter.”","“You!” Qin Si rolled up his sleeves and wanted to argue with him.","The girl behind him, who had always been rather lazy, pulled him back. Her voice was casual. “You guys go in first. I’ll wait for you outside.”","“Sister Qiao?” Qin Si turned around and saw that Qiao Nian’s expression was calm, as if she wasn’t angry. However, he felt aggrieved. He turned back to look at the people who had stopped Qiao Nian and the others outside and gritted his teeth.","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened before he could flare up. She said, “Go in and see what’s going on. I’m not in a hurry.”","Qin Si gritted his teeth and hesitated.","Bo Jingxing pushed his glasses up his nose bridge, knowing that this was not the time to quarrel.","“Sorry, my third uncle is stubborn. I’ll go in and tell him to let you in.” He looked at the girl apologetically and pulled Qin Si’s arm as he walked in.","“Qiao Nian is right. Let’s go in and ask about the situation first.”","Qin Si was dragged in.","Zhang Yang didn’t mind. He said, “Miss Qiao, there’s a stool over there. Let’s sit and wait.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap and coolly followed them.","...","In the office.","Bo Jingxing and Qin Si went in first.","Bo Zheng had just returned after making the request to the Red Alliance, but they had yet to reply. He was quite anxious. He only raised his brows when he saw Qin Si and the others enter. “You guys are here?”","“Third Uncle.” Bo Jingxing was a noble young master outside, but he was obedient in front of his third uncle.","Qin Si wasn’t familiar with Bo Zheng.","However, they were all from Beijing and were in the same circle. It was inevitable that they would meet on certain occasions, so he had seen Bo Zheng before.","In addition, Bo Zheng was his good friend’s elder. He still greeted him politely, “Hello, Uncle Bo. I’m Qin Si.”","Bo Zheng glanced at him and nodded. His expression softened slightly. “I know. Jingxing mentioned you. You’re here too?”","“I don’t trust Master Wang,” Qin Si replied frankly.","Bo Zheng nodded again and stopped talking.","At this moment, Luo Ming rushed over, his expression even uglier than before.","“Captain Bo, Zhou Hengfeng said that he can’t come.”","He didn’t look at Bo Jingxing and Qin Si. He said with a reddened face, “At first, I told him to come over and help, and he agreed readily. In the end, he immediately made excuses when he heard that Young Master Ye was also trapped. One moment, he said that he had a cold, and the next moment, he said that his relative had a car accident. Ha! He treated me like a fool.”"]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513 Your Friend’s Surname Is Qiao? Where Is She?","paragraphs":["1513 Your Friend’s Surname Is Qiao? Where Is She?","The Zhou family’s matter had caused an uproar previously.","Ever since Zhou Wei went to prison, the Zhou family had declined and was gradually removed from the few new noble families in Beijing.","Zhou Hengfeng must have hated this matter, so he found all sorts of reasons not to help.","Luo Ming was angry because this was not a personal matter. There were so many trapped people, but Zhou Hengfeng deliberately found excuses to not help.","Who couldn’t tell that he wanted to raise the price and negotiate with Captain Bo?!","“He’s just trying to put on airs. He wants us to beg him!” Luo Ming was livid. He was so angry that his voice trembled. “In his dreams!”","Bo Jingxing was listening at the side. Hearing this, he frowned and looked at Bo Zheng. “Third Uncle, did you ask Zhou Hengfeng for help?”","“Yes,” Bo Zheng replied with a dark expression, as if he was so disgusted by Zhou Hengfeng that he didn’t want to speak.","Qin Si didn’t care what they said. He was still thinking about Qiao Nian and the others who were stopped outside. He braced himself and faced the slightly solemn atmosphere. He said to Bo Zheng, “Um... Uncle Bo, I have a friend still waiting outside. Can you get the people outside to let her in...”","Luo Ming was originally still immersed in Zhou Hengfeng’s antics. However, his eyebrows twitched when he heard Qin Si mention the scoundrels he had brought with him. He wanted to say a few words, but he couldn’t because of Qin Si’s identity.","However, he looked at him reproachfully.","His eyes seemed to say, “At a time like this, you still care about your friends outside!”","Qin Si felt awkward under his gaze. He touched his earlobe and explained, “My friend came all the way here with us to find out about Master Wang’s situation. We came in. It’s not good for her to be stopped outside... Sister Qiao...”","As he spoke, he couldn’t help but mention Qiao Nian’s nickname.","Bo Zheng did not agree to let his friend in at first. He only looked in his direction when he heard the person’s name. “Your friend’s surname is Qiao?”","“Yeah.”","What was wrong with the surname Qiao?","Qin Si still didn’t know that Ye Wangchuan had brought Qiao Nian to see Bo Zheng and even helped him track down Eagle Eye. He scratched his head in confusion.","“How old is she?” But Bo Zheng was like a drowning man grasping at straws. His eyes lit up.","Qin Si said, “She’s not old. She’s just a freshman. 18? 19? Anyway, she’s not old! But Sister Qiao isn’t here to play. She’s very worried about Master Wang’s safety. We...”","Bo Zheng placed the teacup he was holding on the table before Qin Si could finish speaking, startling him.","Bo Zheng didn’t think so himself. A surprised expression appeared on his face. He grabbed his arm and asked, “Where is this person? Is she outside?”","Qin Si was completely dumbfounded.","Luo Ming didn’t understand at first, but when he saw how excited Bo Zheng was, his mind also turned. His eyes were like torches, and he was much more excited than when he saw Qin Si and the others. He asked, “Captain Bo, is Young Master Qin talking about the one from last time...?”","“It should be her.” Bo Zheng smiled and relaxed.","Luo Ming reacted more strongly than he did. He immediately started for the door. “I’m going to bring her in.”","Bo Zheng did not waste his breath. He let go of Qin Si’s arm and ignored Bo Jingxing as he quickly followed him out.","Outside.","Zhang Yang was still looking around. He turned his head and said to Qiao Nian, “I wonder when Young Master Qin and the others will come out?”"]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514 Sun Accepted the Order!","paragraphs":["1514 Sun Accepted the Order!","Qiao Nian sat calmly on a stool meant for resting and played with her phone. She accidentally saw Bo Zheng’s message on the black market.","He was requesting the Red Alliance’s help to look for someone.","She took the job without looking at the sensational scene on the black market network because of Sun’s reappearance and then closed the local area network page.","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids, her dark eyes looking in the door’s direction. She restrained her arrogance and said, “Soon.”","!!","Zhang Yang looked at her strangely and was about to ask “Miss Qiao, how did you know?” when Deputy Captain Luo and Bo Zheng came out and walked quickly in their direction...","Zhang Yang immediately stood up from the stool, not knowing where to put his hands and feet. “Captain Bo.”","He had a better relationship with Qin Si.","He usually played with Qin Si, but he was not too familiar with Bo Jingxing, let alone his uncle, Bo Zheng.","He hadn’t even seen him that many times.","Zhang Yang didn’t dare to address him directly as Qin Si did. After greeting him, he placed his fingers on the seam of his pants and stood straight like a high school student in military training.","Qiao Nian saw them coming as well and calmly raised her cap. Unlike Zhang Yang, who was so frightened that he immediately stood up, she stood up slowly and greeted Luo Ming. “Deputy Captain Luo.”","Luo Ming was more excited to see her than anyone else. “Miss Qiao, it’s really you... That’s great!”","Bo Zheng also saw the girl wearing a familiar sweater and a baseball cap standing not far away. His excitement was indescribable. He walked over and said, “I didn’t expect you to come, too. If Qin Si hadn’t told me that you were outside, Young Master Ye...”","“I know.”","Qiao Nian had called Ye Lan previously, and Ye Lan had told her everything.","She knew Ye Wangchuan well and knew that nothing could happen to him.","Moreover, Gu San was still by his side. He would give his life to protect Ye Wangchuan.","Hence, Qiao Nian wasn’t particularly anxious. At the very least, she was much calmer than Bo Zheng and the others.","She asked politely, “Do you need my help?”","Bo Zheng was overjoyed. He suppressed his excitement and immediately said, “Yes, definitely.”","“I’ll take you in first.”","He immediately brought her back while explaining the situation to her.","“... Our technicians have checked the signal inside. There seems to be a problem with the signal base station. There’s no signal at all. We can’t pinpoint their exact location now.","“Miss Qiao, is there any way you can find out their precise location?”","Bo Zheng discussed the situation with Qiao Nian along the way. “As long as we have a location, the rest will be much easier.”","Qiao Nian didn’t answer him immediately. She just followed him.","Her aura was restrained, but it was still impossible to ignore the willfulness in her bones.","“I want to see it first.”","It was quite a pleasant voice.","Like a cold drink in summer to ease the restlessness in Bo Zheng and the others’ hearts, he smiled and was no longer in a hurry. He just led Qiao Nian inside.","“Yes. See it first, then we’ll talk.”","The people who had stopped Qiao Nian and the others from entering were now silent as cicadas in winter. They watched helplessly as their deputy captain and captain surrounded the girl and welcomed her in.","He stole glances at Qiao Nian with a puzzled expression.","Why are Captain Bo and Deputy Captain Luo treating that girl differently?"]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515 Deputy Captain Luo Worshiped Her Like a God","paragraphs":["1515 Deputy Captain Luo Worshiped Her Like a God","After Qiao Nian entered, she saw the technician sitting in front of the computer, staring blankly at the screen. It was obvious that there was no progress.","She walked over and spoke calmly. “Let me see.”","The technician was still trying to figure out how to locate him when he turned around and saw a","young girl standing behind him. Bo Zheng and the others had also entered.","!!","He was stunned for a moment before looking in Bo Zheng’s direction. “Captain Bo?”","What was wrong with the people outside? Why did they let everyone in?","Even a girl was allowed in!","What the hell? This wasn’t a market!","Deputy Captain Luo walked over, walked past Bo Zheng, and urged the technician, “Give up your position for Miss Qiao to use the computer.”","“?” For a moment the technician wondered if he’d heard correctly.","He then looked at Qiao Nian.","The girl in front of him did not look old. She was wearing a baseball cap, so he couldn’t see her face clearly. However, she looked quite ordinary. There was nothing special about her.","Luo Ming was more impatient than anyone else and urged him again. “What are you doing? Why are you in a daze? Give up your computer and let Miss Qiao try.”","Luo Ming was famous for his hot temper. He was direct with everyone.","Only Bo Zheng could suppress him.","However, Luo Ming had always been impartial and rarely gave anyone face when it came to serious matters.","He didn’t even treat Bo Zheng so respectfully. Suddenly, he treated an ordinary girl like a god, making the technicians look at each other in confusion.","The technician he was urging gave up his seat. However, he didn’t want Qiao Nian to touch his computer. “There’s a code on my computer. Don’t play around.”","Qiao Nian ignored him and pulled out a chair to sit down. She took out a small tablet from her shoulder bag. He had no idea how she did it.","The small tablet became a small laptop within a few moments. She connected to the Wi-Fi, her thin white hand tapping out a few code symbols on the editor...","After a while, a map of Shuangjiang City appeared on her computer. Green lines covered the entire Shuangjiang City like a dense net.","The technicians behind her were stunned by Qiao Nian’s actions.","Before he could speak, the girl pulled on her cap and rested her hand on the keyboard. Her eyes were quite delicate as she looked up and asked, “Can someone assist me?”","Assist was a hacking word in a location search. It meant helping with odd jobs and providing big data analysis.","The technicians in the room were either stunned or did not react. For a moment, no one spoke.","Qiao Nian probably felt that it would be better to find someone else to help her.","She didn’t ask further. She picked up her phone and logged into the Red Alliance’s exclusive software, then sent a message to Slim Waist Control.","[Sun: Get back to me online. I need your help with something.]","She had sent the message only seconds ago, but Slim Waist Control was already calling.","Qiao Nian would never have accepted it in the past.","However, she had already met with him in the illegal zone last time. Coupled with the special circumstances this time, she hesitated for only a second before answering casually.","“Hello.”","...","Bo Zheng, Qin Si, and the others were waiting for the results beside her.","Qiao Nian was on the phone with someone, and she skillfully typed out an incomprehensible code based on the data provided by the other party.","He was extremely fast!","He couldn’t help but be curious. He turned to ask Qin Si, “Is Miss Qiao’s friend also a computer genius?”"]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516 Uncle Bo, You Must Have Heard That Person’s Name","paragraphs":["1516 Uncle Bo, You Must Have Heard That Person’s Name","Qin Si could already tell who the other party was.","His expression was a little complicated. After all, he had been to the illegal district with Gu San and the others before and knew about Qiao Nian’s friend.","“Ah, I suppose so.”","Qin Si couldn’t tell Bo Zheng about Slim Waist Control, so he could only answer vaguely, “The other party is Sister Qiao’s friend.”","He’d been about to mention the Red Alliance. However, there were too many people around. Thus, Qin Si swallowed his words.","What?","Back then, he was also very surprised. He had never thought that Qiao Nian had friends from the Red Alliance.","Although Qiao Nian’s friend wasn’t Sun, Slim Waist Control was still very impressive.","In any case, he had never understood why there were so many strange people around Qiao Nian.","Bo Zheng was about to ask more when his phone rang. He took it out and looked down.","His mature, handsome face lit up with surprise.","Luo Ming was by his side all year round and rarely saw him reveal his emotions. He asked, “Captain Bo, did something good happen?”","Everyone present was from his team, or Bo Jingxing and his friend.","Bo Zheng did not hide anything. He looked up in a good mood and said, “Sun from the Red Alliance has accepted the order.”","“The Red Alliance again?” Qin Si subconsciously asked in a low voice.","Bo Zheng might not have heard them. He explained, “Before you came, I posted a mission on the underground network to the Red Alliance. I didn’t expect them to accept it!”","Everyone in the top small circle in Beijing knew about the existence of the illegal district and the independent continent. Of course, they also knew about the forces entrenched there.","The Red Alliance was a very special existence in the illegal district.","And in the Red Alliance, Sun was special among special people.","As the leader of the Red Alliance, Sun was too mysterious. He basically never showed his face to the outside world. The outside world didn’t know if Sun was a man or a woman. How old he was...","However, it wasn’t surprising that hackers were mysterious.","Therefore, after so many years, although everyone was curious, they didn’t delve too deeply into Sun’s gender and age.","After Bo Zheng finished speaking, he was originally happy and was about to greet the other party.","If Qiao Nian said that there was no solution, they still had a way out. They could still find another expert to try.","“I’ll go out and contact the other party to see if it’s convenient for him now.” Bo Zheng took his phone and was about to go out.","Qin Si stopped him. “Uncle Bo, wait.”","Bo Zheng stopped in his tracks and looked at him in confusion, as if he did not understand why he was stopping him.","Qin Si was a little embarrassed by his gaze. He thought for a moment and said, “Sister Qiao is currently working with the people from the Red Alliance to find out Master Wang’s location. Why don’t you wait a little longer and wait for the results? You can still find Sun if it doesn’t work...”","Bo Zheng and Luo Ming looked confused.","Bo Zheng subconsciously looked in the direction of the girl in the call. “You said that Qiao Nian’s friend is from the Red Alliance?”","The Red Alliance had a high threshold.","In the past few years, other than a young member of the Qi family who almost entered the Red Alliance, only Zhou Hengfeng had barely touched the edge.","Qiao Nian was only a freshman at Qing University. How could she know someone from the Red Alliance?","“Her friend’s status in the Red Alliance is not low.” Qin Si did not hide anything and simply said, “Uncle Bo, you must have heard that person’s name.”"]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517 Sister Nian: This Child’s Brain Isn’t Good, He Likes to Call Daddy","paragraphs":["1517 Sister Nian: This Child’s Brain Isn’t Good, He Likes to Call Daddy","“?”","Bo Zheng did not speak. Luo Ming couldn’t help but ask, “Who is it?”","“Slim Waist Control.”","Bo Zheng was speechless.","Luo Ming was speechless.","They had, of course, heard the name of Slim Waist Control.","He was one of the most active members of the Red Alliance. Usually, the Red Alliance relied on Slim Waist Control to contact the outside world, but this person was also difficult to approach.","Miss Qiao was actually friends with him?","Luo Ming recalled the first time he had met Qiao Nian. He had even doubted her ability with disdain.","Although he had been convinced later, he had never associated Qiao Nian with a place like the Red Alliance.","His throat was dry, and his voice was hoarse. “Miss Qiao knows someone from the Red Alliance...”","“It’s not surprising that she knows someone from the Red Alliance, right?” Qin Si beat around the bush at this time. He said very calmly, “I told you from the beginning that Sister Qiao isn’t here to play. She might help. Your people even stopped her from coming in.”","Luo Ming’s lips twitched. He really wanted to say — who the f*ck would have thought that Qiao Nian would know someone from the Red Alliance?","As the two of them spoke.","Qiao Nian hit Enter. Her posture relaxed, and so did her brows.","“How is it?” Bo Jingxing was the calmest among them. Neither he nor Zhang Yang participated in Qin Si’s conversation. They were focused on Qiao Nian’s situation.","As soon as he spoke.","Bo Zheng and Luo Ming’s attention was pulled back to the girl.","“I’m checking the location of Gu San’s phone. I still have to wait 10 minutes.”","Qiao Nian placed one hand on the back of the chair and picked up her phone with the other, preparing to hang up.","On the other end of the voice call, Slim Waist Control’s loud voice sounded. “Boss, why are there people talking over there? Are you outside?”","Qiao Nian paused for a second, a string tightening in her brain. Her face was expressionless, but her head hurt.","She was in a hurry and had forgotten to tell Slim Waist Control that she had someone with her. Stop talking nonsense.","“Boss? Boss?","“Boss, are you disconnected?”","Qiao Nian didn’t say a word. The person on the other end of the line was like clockwork, stirring up trouble. His voice wasn’t soft, and he was still shouting.","Qiao Nian’s temples were about to explode. Her fingers ruthlessly cut off the call, put the phone back, and coughed. “This child doesn’t have a good brain. He likes to call Daddy.”","There was complete silence.","The few of them were stunned by Slim Waist Control’s words.","Especially Bo Zheng and the others.","Qin Si had just explained to them a few minutes ago that the friend Qiao Nian was talking to was Slim Waist Control from the Red Alliance. However, not long after, Slim Waist Control called Qiao Nian ‘Boss’.","There was only one boss in the Red Alliance.","Sun!","Bo Zheng thought of the message on his phone 10 minutes ago. The answer was obvious.","Qiao Nian = Sun.","Even though he was knowledgeable, he did not expect a freshman to be related to Sun.","This feeling...","For a moment, Bo Zheng couldn’t digest this bombshell. No wonder Ye Wangchuan had brought Qiao Nian to look for him.","Just as everyone was dumbfounded and unable to recover, the girl spoke in a deep and calm voice.","“I’ve got their location.”","On the other side.","Rain poured down in Quchi Town, and the extreme weather enveloped the sky of Shuangjiang City.","It had been raining heavily for three days, causing the riverbank to be flooded.","To make matters worse, the only road that led out was also broken by boulders and mud washed down by the landslide. They had completely lost contact with the outside world."]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518 Master Wang: Let Me Do It!","paragraphs":["1518 Master Wang: Let Me Do It!","The crowd was gathered in a high-slung clearing. For the moment, there was still food and a clean water supply, but it wouldn’t last long.","Outside the crowd gathering point, the rain poured down.","The dark sky was like a gaping hole. Rain poured down like it was free.","A step away was rain.","Under the eaves, a thin-faced man stood outside. A corner of his windbreaker was lifted, making his figure stand out. Under his suit pants, his legs were straight and long. He was handsome and unique.","The man’s eyes were downcast, his dark lashes hiding the emotion in them. He held the phone in his hand and looked down.","His phone was still on the WeChat page.","The last message was from Qiao Nian.","[I’ve got the medicine. How about you?]","Qiao Nian had sent him a message two days ago. He was about to reply when the wind cut off the signal station outside.","Ye Wangchuan suddenly frowned. His slender and beautiful hand held his phone as his gaze locked onto the WeChat page.","He wondered if she had returned from Country M.","Ye Wangchuan was worried and frowned uneasily.","Gu San walked out from the side and saw the man playing with his phone outside. He walked over quietly. “Master Wang, is there still no signal?”","Ye Wangchuan put his phone away. His eyes were sharp and angry, his thin lips pursed. “No.”","Gu San looked at the rain outside and rubbed his temples. He said with a headache, “I don’t know when the rain will stop. We’ve been trapped inside and don’t know what’s going on outside. Why haven’t Young Master Bo and the others found us yet?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his chin slightly and looked out at the storm. Suddenly, he said, “I’ll go to the signal station to take a look.”","“At this time?” Gu San was shocked and quickly stopped him. “Master Wang, the rain is so heavy outside, and the surrounding mountains have been sliding. It’s too dangerous outside! Don’t be anxious. Young Master Bo and the others must be thinking of a way to enter. We’re not in a hurry...”","Ye Wangchuan never made decisions easily. “It’s been too long,” he said simply. “I can’t wait that long.”","Qiao Nian was still in Country M.","Even if Ji Lin helped keep an eye on her, he might not be able to protect her 24/7.","Either way, he needed to get in touch with the outside world immediately.","His girlfriend was still waiting for his reply.","Seeing that Ye Wangchuan was determined to walk into the rain, Gu San walked towards the signal base station without looking back.","“Master Wang!” he shouted after him, but Ye Wangchuan didn’t look back.","Seeing that the rain was about to swallow the man’s back, Gu San gritted his teeth and rushed into the rain...","...","The signal base station had been guarded and repaired.","However, progress was very slow. It could be said that there was almost no progress.","When Ye Wangchuan and the others arrived, a few repairmen were still discussing whether to give up on repairing this base station. After all, it was too dangerous to repair the signal base station in such heavy rain.","“Young Master Ye.”","The person in charge was hesitating when he suddenly saw Ye Wangchuan and Gu San coming over from the corner of his eye. He quickly strode over and wiped the rain off his face. He looked at the two of them in surprise.","“Young Master Ye, Young Master Gu, why are you here?”","“...” Gu San’s mouth moved, but he didn’t know how to say it.","What could he say?","Since Master Wang insisted on coming, he could only follow.","Ye Wangchuan suppressed his surging emotions and asked the person in charge, “How is it?”","The person in charge was not stupid. He knew that he must have asked about the maintenance of the signal base station. He looked troubled and shook his head. “No progress yet. I don’t know when it will be fixed.”","Ye Wangchuan was silent for a second. Suddenly, he took off his windbreaker and handed it to Gu San. As he rolled up his sleeves, he revealed a strong arm and said calmly, “Let me do it.”"]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519 There’s a Signal","paragraphs":["1519 There’s a Signal","It was raining cats and dogs in Shuangjiang City.","The signal base station was right in the middle of the storm.","The news that Ye Wangchuan wanted to personally repair the base station spread throughout the entire repair team. The workers seemed to have heard a joke and watched coldly.","They had heard that a young master from Beijing was trapped here with them. His status was quite high. Every time the person in charge mentioned Young Master Ye, his expression would always turn fearful, afraid of offending that person.","How could such a young master, who didn’t have any experience, repair the base station?","Ha!","The few workers on the repair team were not optimistic at all.","They all felt that the people from Beijing were making a scene here~","They would have to pay for Ye Wangchuan’s actions if anything happened.","Who could look good at this thought?!","“Master Wang, can you hear me?” Gu San hugged Ye Wangchuan’s windbreaker and stomped his feet anxiously. “Why don’t you come down? It’s raining so heavily. It’s too dangerous up there!”","Ye Wangchuan had already gone up with the toolbox on his back. His robust figure in the storm was not as weak as the repair team initially thought. He looked like he had some skills.","His figure was completely hidden in the rain, and Gu San could only see his silhouette.","The people above ignored him. He didn’t know if they didn’t hear him or if they didn’t have time to respond.","Gu San paced around anxiously. He gritted his teeth and asked the person in charge, “Do you still have any tools? I’ll go up and take a look.”","The person in charge’s face turned pale from fright. He kept looking up at the figure on the base station, afraid that something would happen to Ye Wangchuan. Then, even if he had 10 lives, it would not be enough to pay for it.","He quickly stopped Gu San from leaving. “Young Master Gu, don’t joke with me. I’m already scared to death with Young Master Ye going up there alone. My legs are weak now! I won’t be able to find anyone to help if you also go up and anything happens to Master Wang...”","Gu San’s temples throbbed. He glared at him. “Stop talking nonsense!”","“Yes, yes, yes. I’m in a hurry, aren’t I?” The person in charge slapped his mouth and looked sickly, but he refused to let go. “Let’s just wait.”","They waited for an hour.","The rain was heavy and cold. Gu San was running out of patience.","As time passed, the person in charge’s expression became increasingly gloomy.","“Will Young Master Ye repair the base station?”","“...” Gu San gulped and looked at the figure up there. Actually, he was not confident either.","He didn’t know if Master Wang knew how to fix foundations.","His own mind was still blank.","All he knew was that it didn’t matter if Master Wang knew how to do maintenance work, as long as he was fine and safe.","Finally!","As the two of them waited eagerly, the man nimbly got off the base station and said, “It’s fixed.”","The person in charge looked confused. “Fixed?”","The workers who had failed to repair the signal base station earlier looked at each other. They looked at each other frivolously and searched for their phones, thinking that he was showing off. But when they looked at their phones, it really had a signal.","“Damn, it’s really fixed?!”","“How did you do that?”","They had tried for a long time but failed. Young Master Ye from Beijing had single-handedly fixed the signal base station?","Ye Wangchuan ignored them and grunted. He reached out and said with a low voice to the still stunned Gu San, “Give me the phone.”"]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520 Master Wang: I’ve Won the LOP Award in Physics","paragraphs":["1520 Master Wang: I’ve Won the LOP Award in Physics","“Uh, here.” Gu San hurriedly handed him his phone. His mind was still filled with question marks, and his mouth was as fast as his brain. “Master Wang, when did you learn how to repair?”","“I’ve never learned it.”","Gu San: “?”","“I won a LOP in physics,” Ye Wangchuan said casually. Without looking at Gu San’s instantly green face, he took his phone and walked to a quiet corner...","Gu San was left behind to silently calculate the conditions to win the physics LOP Award. The Ansag Award was the second-biggest physics award in the world after the Nobel Prize.","Master Wang had actually taken it!","He couldn’t help but think of Qiao Nian.","Miss Qiao seemed to have won the World Software Competition this time...","Indeed, a genius would only be with a genius!","Even winning awards in a big shot’s world was a joke!","...","Outside the Emergency Rescue Center.","Qiao Nian hung up the call with Ye Wangchuan and walked back.","Qin Si and Bo Jingxing were there.","Qiao Nian relaxed a lot. Rubbing her temples, she said to the others, “The signal station in Quchi Town has been fixed.”","Bo Zheng, Luo Ming, and the others were still working out a rescue plan. They were stunned when they heard this. “Wasn’t it broken?”","“It should have just been fixed.” Qiao Nian’s face under the baseball cap was exquisite and eye-catching.","Everyone turned to her.","She didn’t have any other expression. Her eyes were a little dry as she handed the phone to Bo Zheng and the others. “I just spoke to Ye Wangchuan.”","“Master Wang?” Qin Si flushed with excitement. “How is it? Are Master Wang and the others alright?”","Ye Wangchuan and Gu San were trapped there. This was Bo Zheng’s biggest headache, so he looked at the girl with concern.","Qiao Nian didn’t hide anything. She said concisely, “They’re fine. It’s just that the signal isn’t good. We didn’t speak much before the signal went out again.”","Qin Si heaved a long sigh of relief and patted his chest. “It’s good that they’re fine. It’s good that they’re fine.”","Bo Jingxing reacted quickly. He picked up his phone and said to the others, “I’ll go out and tell Aunt Ye so that she won’t worry.”","“Okay.” Bo Zheng nodded and gestured for him to go out and make the call.","Bo Jingxing quickly walked out and called the people in Beijing.","As soon as he left, Qiao Nian looked at Bo Zheng and the others and continued, “I just asked about the situation there. Many others are also trapped with them. There are about 168 people, old and young. Some of them can’t move easily... Can you save them all at once?”","“There are more than a hundred people trapped there?” Bo Zheng didn’t expect there to be so many trapped people inside and felt a headache.","Deputy Captain Luo also looked surprised. “So many people?”","He frowned, his rough face dark and anxious. He turned to speak to Bo Zheng. “Captain Bo, there are still so many people there. What if we only have three rescue boats?”","“We definitely won’t be able to bring everyone out at once.” Luo Ming waved his hand in frustration. “But if we don’t save the crowd immediately, the heavier the rain, the more dangerous it will be. We won’t be able to guarantee their safety if another landslide happens.”","Bo Zheng pursed his lips and made a prompt decision. “Arrange for the rescue boats to go in first. Bring the people out in batches. I’ll think of a way.”","As the two of them spoke, Qiao Nian tugged at the brim of her cap and interrupted, “I have an idea.”"]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521 Qiao Nian Has a Way?","paragraphs":["1521 Qiao Nian Has a Way?","Bo Zheng and Luo Ming looked at her.","Qiao Nian had been able to pinpoint Ye Wangchuan and Gu San’s exact location. Putting aside her identity as a member of the Red Alliance, Qiao Nian had also won first place in the World Software Competition.","Bo Zheng had more or less heard of such a big event that brought glory to the country.","But rescue had nothing to do with computing. Even if Qiao Nian was the boss of the Red Alliance, the Red Alliance’s forces were mainly concentrated in the illegal area. They couldn’t extend their reach into the country...","Qiao Nian said that she had a way. Could it be that she could help them get helicopters and speedboats?","...","In Beijing.","In a private room in the Imperial Mansion.","Yuan Yongqin sat with a smile. Today, she was wearing a light yellow shirt. Her professional attire was neat, making her look like a career woman.","She was in a business gathering. The people at the table were basically all famous figures in Beijing.","After she transferred the Cheng Feng Corporation’s focus back from Rao City a year ago, the Yuan family gradually became a new noble family in Beijing.","Yuan Yongqin naturally had many people fawning over her.","However, she had never participated in any dinner parties. Even if she did, she didn’t fancy them.","Even though she was smooth and slick at the dining table and did not offend anyone, no one could get close to her throughout the meal.","Fortunately, she wasn’t the main character of the meal today. Yuan Yongqin was relaxed as she watched the commotion.","“Come, President Jiang, let’s toast to you.” Someone took the lead and poured a glass of white wine. He walked up to the main character of the day and said fawningly, “I heard that your daughter went to Continent O and successfully entered the Pharmacy Association. Miss Jiang is so young and has achieved a lot. President Jiang, you’re too good at educating your children! Young Master Jiang is so outstanding, and so is Miss Jiang. I really don’t know how you raised your children. I’m so envious.”","Jiang Zongnan exchanged a few pleasantries with the other party and returned politely. The two of them drank some wine.","The other party drank a glass of wine and blushed. He said, “I heard that your niece even won first place in the World Software Competition. Congratulations.”","At the mention of Qiao Nian, Jiang Zongnan felt a little awkward. However, he still clinked glasses with him.","On the other hand, Yuan Yongqin was chatting distractedly with the people around her throughout the meal. When she heard someone mention Qiao Nian’s first place in the software competition, she looked in Jiang Zongnan’s direction.","Jiang Zongnan looked a little awkward, but nothing else could be seen.","He looked rather pleased with himself.","After all, many people praised him for Jiang Xianrou’s joining the Pharmacy Association.","Yuan Yongqin raised her wine glass and curled her lips imperceptibly. Her eyes were filled with disdain.","Because Jiang Xianrou had hooked up with Qi Yan and became a member of the Pharmacy Association, the second branch of the Jiang family was doing well. They looked very proud, but she had heard through the grapevine that Jiang Yao had been fired from Tian Chen.","Now, these people were trying their best to curry favor with Jiang Xianrou and felt it was a safe stance to take!","She sipped the wine in her glass and put it down slowly, disapprovingly.","However, it made sense on second thought. Although these people had some status in Beijing, they were not from the top circles.","They might not be well-informed. They probably thought that Jiang Yao was still in Tian Chen and Jiang Xianrou had entered the Pharmacy Association.","They believed the second branch of the Jiang family was about to take off.","At that moment, the door to the private room opened.","Her secretary, Su Mo, hurried in and leaned in to speak in her ear."]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522 What a Coincidence, Sister Qiao Went Back to the Hotel to Rest","paragraphs":["1522 What a Coincidence, Sister Qiao Went Back to the Hotel to Rest","“You’re saying Nian...” Yuan Yongqin’s expression changed slightly. She immediately picked up her bag, stood up, and said to everyone, “I’m sorry, I have something on. I won’t be able to accompany everyone today. I’ll leave first.”","Yuan Yongqin was now a popular female newcomer in the country. The people at the dining table couldn’t wait to flatter her. How could they make things difficult for her just because she wanted to leave first?","They immediately exchanged pleasantries.","Yuan Yongqin seemed to be in a hurry and did not exchange too many pleasantries with them. She soon took her things and quickly left the private room with Su Mo.","Seeing that the other party was leaving in a hurry, Jiang Zongnan couldn’t help but think of Qiao Nian.","Nian Nian had a good relationship with Yuan Yongqin.","He frowned, his gaze slightly worried.","...","Outside the Imperial Mansion’s private room.","Yuan Yongqin quickly walked to a quiet place and immediately stopped. “How’s Nian Nian? Why did she go to Shuangjiang City?”","It had been raining heavily in Shuangjiang City recently. She heard that it was quite dangerous there.","Yuan Yongqin was filled with worry. “What did she tell you on the phone?”","Su Mo looked down and said very respectfully, “Miss Qiao only asked us to send a few helicopters and boats over. It’s best if they’re bigger.”","Cheng Feng Corporation had its own freight line, and it had transportation vehicles all over the country. Naturally, there were also these in Shuangjiang City.","Yuan Yongqin nodded. She took out her cell phone from her handbag and said, “Go and arrange it first. Anything that she’s asked for, transfer them to her as much as possible. I’ll contact someone I know and see if I can get her more.”","“Yeah.”","Su Mo was a woman of action.","She mainly wanted to inform Yuan Yongqin first. In fact, she had already spoken to the transport department and was just waiting for Yuan Yongqin to say the word.","As soon as Yuan Yongqin gave the order, she immediately went to contact the relevant people.","...","Three hours later.","The people who had been trapped for two days were basically all safely transferred out.","Because of the weather, the helicopters did not get in in the end.","However, Cheng Feng Corporation’s boats were very useful.","Not only did Yuan Yongqin transfer all the ferries from Cheng Feng Corporation over, but she also got many other boats through her connections.","Many people in Shuangjiang City were paying attention to the rescue team’s big move.","They were guessing who had made such a big scene.","Not to mention Shuangjiang City, even Rao City, which was hundreds of kilometers away, had heard of Shuangjiang City’s rescue operation.","Gu San was the first to see Qin Si and the others after he came out.","He still did not understand why so many rescue boats had come. He asked Qin Si and the others emotionally, “...Third Uncle Bo has invested heavily this time?”","He followed Ye Wangchuan all year round and was more like a friend to Qin Si and the others than a subordinate.","Qin Si’s expression turned indescribable as he recalled how Slim Waist Control had called Qiao Nian “Boss”.","Faced with Gu San’s sigh, he could only squeeze out a dry sentence. “It’s not Third Uncle Bo this time.”","“Hm?”","Before Gu San could ask him and before Qin Si could digest Qiao Nian’s actions, he changed the topic. He looked behind Gu San and asked, “Where’s Master Wang?”","“Master Wang went back to the hotel to change first,” Gu San said casually.","Ye Wangchuan arrived with him, but he left without waiting for Qin Si and the others.","Gu San didn’t think too much about it and asked, “That’s strange. Why don’t I see Miss Qiao?”","Qin Si gave him a look that said, “What a coincidence. Sister Qiao went back to the hotel to rest!”"]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523 Seeing Jiang Zongnan Hastily Leave","paragraphs":["1523 Seeing Jiang Zongnan Hastily Leave","On the other side.","Qiao Nian had just received a call from Yuan Yongqin.","She took off her baseball cap and threw it aside. Her eyes were cold as she walked to the fridge and opened it to get herself a bottle of water.","She closed the door behind her and said in a clear voice, “Hello, Aunt Yuan.”","“Are you at the hotel yet?” Yuan Yongqin was still in the parking lot outside the Imperial Mansion, with the windows opened to let in the air.","She had just contacted many people and had not had time to go back.","“Yes.” Qiao Nian walked to the couch and sat down. She crossed her legs, looking relaxed. Lowering her eyes, she replied politely, “I just arrived.”","Yuan Yongqin heaved a long sigh of relief. Her tense face finally revealed a smile. “It’s good that you’re fine. It’s good that you’re fine. You almost scared me to death this time. I didn’t expect you to go to Shuangjiang City...","“By the way, Nian Nian, have the people been successfully evacuated?”","She was most concerned about Qiao Nian’s safety, followed by what Qiao Nian had told her about the safety of the hundred or so trapped people.","Qiao Nian unscrewed the cap of the bottle. Not in a hurry to drink, she answered her question first. “Third Uncle Bo and the others have already gotten everyone out.”","She held the mineral water bottle, her black eyes filled with warmth. She lowered her voice and said, “Aunt Yuan, thank you.”","Far away in Beijing, a mature woman in her forties was stunned when she heard that. She grabbed her cell phone and laughed. “The two of us don’t need to say things like this!”","Then, she suddenly noticed a familiar figure hurrying out and getting into a car by the roadside out of the corner of her eye.","Jiang Zongnan?","Yuan Yongqin recognized the man at a glance and was a little distracted. Her gaze was also attracted by the outside of the Imperial Mansion.","Jiang Zongnan got into the Jiang family’s private car after the chauffeur opened the door for him.","But the problem was, wasn’t Jiang Zongnan socializing with the people in the private room?","What happened?","Why would he leave in a hurry halfway through?","Yuan Yongqin put one hand on the steering wheel and narrowed her eyes. She couldn’t figure it out.","“Aunt Yuan?” The girl’s slightly husky voice called out from the other end of the phone.","Yuan Yongqin’s attention was forcefully pulled back. Only then did she notice that she was still on the phone with Qiao Nian. She said awkwardly, “I’m sorry, I just saw an acquaintance and was distracted. Nian Nian, what did you say just now? Why don’t you say it again? I didn’t hear you clearly.”","As usual, Qiao Nian asked calmly, “Who did you see?”","“Just—”","Yuan Yongqin almost blurted out Jiang Zongnan’s name.","She swallowed the words. “Nah, a business associate. I suddenly saw him nearby and did a double take. You don’t know the man.”","She had heard a little about Qiao Nian’s relationship with the Jiang family’s second branch.","Qiao Nian had long fallen out with them!","It was said that they had even split up.","At this thought, Yuan Yongqin felt that there was no need to tell Qiao Nian about such a brainless matter. Seeing that Su Mo had returned, she said to the person on the other end of the line, “Nian Nian, rest early. I’ll hang up first.”","“Mm.”","The girl had a beautiful voice.","Yuan Yongqin’s frown disappeared and she hung up.","Su Mo happened to walk back at this moment. Seeing that she had rolled down the windows and was on the phone, she knew who she was talking to.","“President Yuan, is Miss Qiao alright?”","Yuan Yongqin smiled faintly and put her cell phone away. “She’s fine. She’s already back at the hotel.”"]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524 Anyway, Nian Nian Has Already Fallen Out With Them","paragraphs":["1524 Anyway, Nian Nian Has Already Fallen Out With Them","“That’s good.” Su Mo felt relieved. She opened the door to send Yuan Yongqin back.","Suddenly, she heard Yuan Yongqin’s deep voice.","“I just saw Jiang Zongnan leave in a hurry. I wonder if something happened.”","Su Mo immediately looked up and asked, “President Yuan, do you want me to ask around?”","Yuan Yongqin was in her forties, but she had taken very good care of herself. In addition, she had never gotten married nor had children. Her skin was tight and lustrous. Moreover, she was dressed appropriately and looked to be in her early thirties. She had a rich and mature temperament that little girls did not possess.","She frowned, tapping her fingers idly on the steering wheel as if thinking.","A moment later, Yuan Yongqin shook her head and said, “Forget it. Anyway, the Jiang family’s second branch has long fallen out with Nian Nian. Their matters have nothing to do with us. She just came back from Continent O. There’s no need to affect her mood because of them... It’s better to not know.”","Su Mo also felt that she had a point and let the matter drop.","...","In a hotel in Shuangjiang City.","Qiao Nian ended the call with Yuan Yongqin and placed her cell phone on the coffee table.","The sound of water splashing in the bathroom stopped.","After a while, Ye Wangchuan walked out in a bathrobe.","His black hair was still dripping wet, but it did not affect his handsome facial features. Under the light, the man’s nose was high, and his skin was extremely fair. His muscular and slender figure was hidden in the bathrobe. Qiao Nian could vaguely see his waist and abdomen wrapped in the white bathrobe...","Her dark eyes narrowed for a moment, a little dangerously. She stared intently in someone’s direction, then casually looked away and pursed her lips. “You should get dressed.”","Ye Wangchuan was wiping the water from his hair with a towel when he suddenly heard the girl’s slightly hoarse voice. He lowered his head and realized that the belt around his waist was not fastened properly.","He fastened the belt again, walked over, and sat down on the sofa opposite Qiao Nian. His voice was clear and gentle as he asked, “How is Old Master Su?”","Qiao Nian crossed her legs and narrowed her eyes, feeling a little sleepy. “I’ve already given him the medicine from the Pharmacy Association. He’s fine now. All the indicators of his vitals have stabilized for the time being. We’ll see what happens next...”","She was vague. Ye Wangchuan could roughly guess that Su Huaiyuan’s life was not in danger for the time being.","He nodded, his tone relaxed. “That’s good.”","Qiao Nian tilted her head and glanced at him. Seeing that his hair was still dripping, she thought for a moment and asked, “Do you want me to help you dry your hair?”","For a moment, Ye Wangchuan suspected that he had heard wrong. The big boss was good at everything, but she always found things troublesome. Sometimes, she didn’t even bother to dry her hair after washing it. She let it dry naturally. This time, Qiao Nian actually took the initiative to help him dry his hair...","He was only distracted for a moment. In the next second, his Adam’s apple was already bobbing up and down. He leaned back on the couch very naturally. “The hairdryer is in the bathroom drawer.”","“Mm,” Qiao Nian replied. She stood up, put down the mineral water bottle in her hand, and walked towards the bathroom.","A minute later, she came out with the hairdryer in her hand. She plugged it in and dried the man’s hair.","She patiently blew Ye Wangchuan’s hair, her movements slow. It could be seen that she was working hard. “...My skills are not good.”","Skills are not good.","Why did this sentence sound so ambiguous?","Ye Wangchuan chuckled. His thin lips curved in a teasing smile. “I think it’s okay.”"]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525 Master Wang Took the Black Box","paragraphs":["1525 Master Wang Took the Black Box","Qiao Nian felt a little frustrated. She couldn’t explain why, but she did feel a little frustrated. Pursing her lips, she glanced at him and silently increased the speed of the hairdryer.","Ye Wangchuan felt a hot wind blow through his hair. He knew that he had provoked someone. He raised his hand and touched the bridge of his nose. The smile on his lips seemed to be unable to be put down as he said in a low voice, “I found something this time.”","Qiao Nian realized that she had not been saying anything and casually asked, “What is it?”","“The plane’s black box.”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were cold as he asked in a low voice, “Haven’t you been investigating your mother?”","Qiao Nian stopped drying his hair. “How did you know?”","Ye Wangchuan turned around and looked at her with black eyes as dark as the night. “I know that you’ve been investigating your mother when you were in Rao City, but there’s been no progress. I’ve also been keeping an eye out in private. Your mother’s situation is very complicated... I only found out that she was in a plane crash back then. Many people died in that plane crash. Your mother was lucky to escape and gave birth to you a year later. After that... all the news about her was deliberately erased.","“The plane crash was not an accident. Someone must have been targeting your mother. At that time, the plane crashed in Shuangjiang City. Because the plane fell into the river, the wreckage was never recovered. Some time ago, a local fisherman fished out a black box. It was said that it was left behind by the plane that crashed, so I came over with Bo Jingxing.”","Qiao Nian had been investigating for so long.","Of course, he knew that Ji Qing had encountered a very serious plane crash back then. Although Ji Qing had luckily escaped, many people died.","It was said that all the crew members were dead.","The news was vague about the cause of the plane crash. It only said that the accident was because the plane had deviated from its original route...","As for why the plane had deviated from its predetermined course, the news did not say. The secret had been buried with the captain and copilot.","After Ji Qing escaped death, she didn’t say anything about the plane crash. Everyone acted as if the plane crash had never happened.","She had found it strange when she found out about this.","However, it had been a long time since the incident. She did not find any person related to that case, nor did she have any other clues.","Qiao Nian didn’t expect Ye Wangchuan to investigate the plane crash and even help her get the black box. “You... went all the way to Shuangjiang City to get that black box?”","Ye Wangchuan rubbed his temples as he looked at her. “Yes.","“I should have told you earlier. It’s just that Old Master Su was sick and you left in a hurry to the Pharmacy Association. I’m not sure if the one the fishermen salvaged was the one left behind by Auntie’s plane crash back then. I was afraid that you would be disappointed, so I didn’t tell you.”","Qiao Nian quickly dried his hair and pulled out the cord. She then placed the hairdryer aside and gave him a complicated look. After a long while, she said, “Actually, this has nothing to do with you. You don’t have to take the risk.”","The more she investigated, the more she realized that the matter back then was shrouded in mystery. The forces surrounding it were big. At the very least, she could sense that it was the work of the illegal district.","As for how deep the water was, she still wasn’t sure.","It was too dangerous!","There was no need for Ye Wangchuan to get involved in it for her."]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526 Sister Nian: Sorry, I Haven’t Done Anything Yet","paragraphs":["1526 Sister Nian: Sorry, I Haven’t Done Anything Yet","“Nian Nian wants to deny it?” His voice was hoarse and seductive.","Qiao Nian glanced at him, her clear eyes clearly unable to keep up with his rhythm. “What do you mean I’m denying it?”","When did she deny anything?","She didn’t seem to have done anything of that sort.","“Aunt Ji is your biological mother and my future mother-in-law. How could it not have anything to do with me if it’s about my future mother-in-law?”","Ye Wangchuan propped his long legs up, his eyebrows relaxed. His arm was on the couch, and the new wound on his left palm was quite conspicuous.","Especially after soaking in the water, the flesh on both sides of the wound turned white from the blisters. It was a shocking sight.","Qiao Nian had offered to dry his hair because she saw the cut on his hand.","Ye Wangchuan, on the other hand, acted as if nothing had happened. He didn’t care about his injury at all. He looked at the girl casually and smiled attractively. “...Or are you not intending to admit what you’ve done?”","Qiao Nian glanced sideways at him.","The girl’s eyebrows were quite exquisite. She was stunningly beautiful, like a dazzling flame that instantly corroded one’s vision.","“I haven’t done anything.”","“Hm?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him again, her brows furrowed slightly. She calmed down and said reasonably, “I said I haven’t done anything yet.”","“Tsk.” Ye Wangchuan didn’t understand what she meant at first. When he did, a smile spread across his lips. His eyes were sharp as he reached out and pulled her over. He looked at the girl with a burning gaze. “Then, do you want to test the goods first?”","When he wasn’t smiling, he was already very attractive. When he smiled, he was even more charming, like a seductive demon. His deep eyes almost drowned her.","Qiao Nian was speechless. “... Examine what?”","“I thought Goddess Qiao hadn’t done it yet?”","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her hand with a faint smile. His voice was low and hoarse. “How do you know if you’ll be satisfied if you don’t check the goods?","“Nian Nian, aren’t you going to check?”","Qiao Nian’s ears burned. But on the surface, she maintained a calm expression. “Ahem, I think it’s not bad.” At the very least, she could give him 10 points for his appearance.","Ye Wangchuan looked at the girl’s averted gaze and saw that she was not as calm and at ease as before.","His thin smile became even more obvious.","Although he spoke nicely, he never let go of her hand. “...It’s easy to make mistakes when you’re only looking at it. I suggest you check it.”","Qiao Nian was rendered speechless. She wriggled her hand out but did not shake him off. She turned around and was about to tell him that she was going back to her room to take a shower and change her clothes.","Caught off guard, the man’s handsome face enlarged in front of her, and two soft thin lips pressed down.","It was a little cool and faintly minty.","Ye Wangchuan wrapped his arm around the girl’s soft waist and licked his thin lips. He smiled devilishly. “Goddess Qiao, do you want to check?”","Check for what!","Qiao Nian’s face heated up. Just as she pushed his chest away, she averted her gaze. “...Let go first.”","“Mm.” A certain someone agreed faster than anyone else, but he didn’t let go at all.","A kiss came down more ferociously than before.","“Ye...”","Qiao Nian frowned. The remaining two words were bitten on the lips by the man and drowned in the passionate kiss.","After the kiss, the hotel room was filled with a strange and dangerous atmosphere.","Qiao Nian took a deep breath to lower the temperature on her face. She said, “I’ll go back to my room. Have a good rest.”","Her figure disappeared quickly as if she was escaping. This was the first time she was so unsettled!"]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527 Qin Si: The Clown Is Actually Me","paragraphs":["1527 Qin Si: The Clown Is Actually Me","Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl disappeared. The door of his room was slammed shut, and his thin lips curled into a smile.","At that moment, his cell phone rang on the table.","Ye Wangchuan realized that Qiao Nian had left the bottle of mineral water on the coffee table. His eyes narrowed. He bent down and picked up his phone from the couch.","[Qin Si: Master Wang, are you and Sister Qiao done? We’re going out to eat. Zhang Yang has a friend who owns a restaurant that’s said to be pretty good. Do you want to join us?]","!!","Ye Wangchuan’s gaze narrowed as he leaned back on the couch. His long legs were crossed as his fair hand typed a reply.","[Y: I’m busy.]","[Qin Si: You haven’t showered yet?]","[Qin Si: Sister Qiao didn’t reply to my message, either.]","Ye Wangchuan kept his hand on his cell phone and smiled lazily. He had no intention of replying to him immediately. He scrolled through the other messages and took a photo of the water bottle on the coffee table to send to the girl with the all-black profile picture.","Five minutes later.","His cell phone vibrated again.","It was still Qin Si.","Qiao Nian’s profile picture was still. It was as if she had not seen his message.","This attitude of pretending to be dead was... quite attractive.","Ye Wangchuan’s smile was even more obvious. He propped his arm up and opened Qin Si’s message.","[Qin Si: Sorry, I was too slipshod!]","A dog emoji followed.","... There was a colorful wig on the dog’s head, and a few golden words flashed beside it.","“The clown is actually me!”","...","In a hospital in Beijing.","“How is it, Doctor? How’s my artiste?”","Jiang Li’s manager followed the doctor who came out of the ward with a worried expression.","He had only received the news half an hour after Jiang Li’s accident and rushed over from the company.","When he arrived, Jiang Li had already been sent to the operating room for emergency treatment.","Fortunately, the surgery did not take long. The patient was quickly wheeled out and sent to the ward.","The person in charge of Jiang Li was a middle-aged male doctor. He was slightly plump and looked a little slovenly in a white coat, but his attitude was that of a good doctor who loved his job.","He wasn’t angry that Yang Cheng had followed him all the way. After taking the time to read the patient’s examination report, he took out a ballpoint pen from his chest pocket and drew a line on the report. He signed his name and looked at the other party. “You are the patient’s...?”","At his age, he rarely cared about the gossip in the entertainment industry. Every day, he would either be undergoing surgery or on the way to surgery. He didn’t know many celebrities.","It wasn’t surprising that he didn’t recognize the emergency patient he had taken over as a top celebrity in the entertainment industry.","“I’m his manager.”","“Manager?” The male doctor looked him up and down as if he had not registered the patient’s relationship with the man in front of him.","Jiang Li’s manager reacted quickly and immediately changed his words. “...I’m his colleague.”","“Doctor, how is Jiang Li’s health?”","The manager was especially anxious.","The middle-aged doctor probably realized that he had been operating on a celebrity, but he did not show much of a reaction. He calmly said, “He broke three ribs on his right side. There are soft tissue contusions all over his body to a certain extent. The ligament in his left wrist is pulled... There’s nothing else. The situation is more optimistic.”","The manager let out a little sigh of relief as he caught the tail end of a string of jargon. “I’m glad he’s okay.”"]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528 I Heard He Fell From a Great Height","paragraphs":["1528 I Heard He Fell From a Great Height","“He’s fine.” The doctor glanced at him and asked, “I heard he fell from a great height?”","The manager nodded with a complicated expression. “Yes, the cable suddenly snapped when he was shooting a commercial and no one reacted in time.”","“No wonder. I was wondering why the ligament in his left hand was torn but his right hand was fine.” The doctor looked at him deeply and said meaningfully, “All I can say is that he was lucky this time. The advantage is that he’s young and he was quick to react. Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.”","The manager knew that Jiang Li was lucky this time.","He couldn’t say more to an outsider. He forced a smile and thanked the doctor.","The doctor was quite busy. After speaking to him for a while, he was immediately called away by a nurse to prepare for the next surgery.","...","At 3 PM.","Only then did the Jiang family rush to the hospital.","Jiang Zongnan, Jiang Yao, and the Yuan family all came.","Jiang Zongjin also rushed to the hospital when he heard the news, but because of what had happened before, he only quietly asked Jiang Li’s manager about the situation.","He then went straight to the ward to see Jiang Li.","He did not communicate with the people from the first branch of the family.","Yuan Qing wanted to curry favor with the second branch’s family, so she was the most enthusiastic among the relatives. As soon as she heard the news, she immediately rushed to the hospital with her son.","“Zongnan, is Jiang Li alright?” Yuan Qing was here, but she did not seem to really care much about the patient’s condition. She talked to Jiang Zongnan instead of going in.","However, it made sense. Everyone in the Jiang family knew that Jiang Li was the most useless and the least favored.","Compared to Jiang Yao, who had entered Tian Chen at a young age, and Jiang Xianrou, who was now a pride of the family, Jiang Li was simply useless in her eyes!","He was so useless.","Jiang Zongnan was on the phone. Hearing her question, he greeted her tiredly. “Aunt, you’re here too.”","Yuan Qing immediately looked at him reproachfully. “With such a big thing happening at home, I definitely have to come and take a look.”","“Okay.” Jiang Zongnan wasn’t in the mood to see if she was pretending.","Yuan Qing pretended to be concerned. “Is Jiang Li alright? I heard that he had an accident and fell from five meters.”","Jiang Zongnan had just contacted a few doctors he was familiar with and was now responding to concerns. In addition, the other relatives were also looking over.","He rubbed his temples and said in a low voice, “He’s fine. He just broke a few ribs. The doctor said his life isn’t in danger. He just needs to stay in bed and recuperate for two months and won’t be able to get out of bed anytime soon.”","Serious injuries took a long period of recovery.","Jiang Zongnan knew this even if he didn’t know medicine.","It was already a blessing in disguise that Jiang Li did not injure other parts of his body. Jiang Zongnan did not ask for much. He was relieved to hear that Jiang Li had to stay in bed to recuperate.","“That’s good,” Yuan Qing said.","Jiang Zongnan quickly responded, “Alright, he has woken up. You can enter the ward if you want to see him.”","“Yeah.”","The relatives all nodded.","...","Inside the ward.","The white walls and white sheets seemed to form a pure white world.","Jiang Li had just woken up and the anesthetic was about to wear off. He couldn’t use the painkiller for the time being and he felt as if all his bones had been reassembled.","A drip hung from a nearby rack.","He acted strong. Ever since he woke up, he did not make a sound or cry out in pain. He looked at the manager who poured him water and asked, “How is it outside?”"]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529 It’s Not an Accident This Time","paragraphs":["1529 It’s Not an Accident This Time","The manager brought him a glass of water and helped him up to drink it. He then looked at him helplessly. “How else can it be?”","Jiang Li took a sip of water. Everything that went down his throat tasted like rust.","“It’s about to blow up outside.” Seeing that he could drink water, the manager was slightly relieved. He pretended to be relaxed and said, “You have 20 endorsements. You still have seven or eight advertisements to shoot. The variety show schedule and the music award ceremony... Anyway, we have to pay a lot of compensation for the breach of contracts this time. Fortunately, the company is supportive. As soon as they heard the news, they immediately spent money on public relations to suppress the news of your injury. Otherwise, who knows what kind of commotion it would have caused outside.”","Jiang Li relaxed slightly when he heard that the news of his injury had been suppressed.","The manager fed him water and adjusted the bed so that his injuries would not be aggravated.","Only then did he continue, “The news of you being injured has been suppressed for the time being, but someone heard that you were absent from work halfway through filming an advertisement and hyped up the news of you acting like a big shot on the Internet. Your popularity is high, and you can be on the trending searches at any time. So, the topic of you acting like a big shot is now on the trending searches. The company is having a meeting to discuss whether to announce that you’re hospitalized...”","“Don’t announce it.” Jiang Li tried to get up without thinking.","“What are you doing!”","The manager quickly told him to lie back down. As he did so, he said reproachfully, “I’m just telling you. Don’t get agitated. Aren’t I still here? If I don’t agree, the company definitely won’t make a statement.”","“Mm.” Jiang Li had forced himself to sit up just now, and his injuries hurt again. He frowned and looked at his manager with his thick eyebrows and big eyes. His attitude was tough and stubborn. “Don’t tell the public that I’m hospitalized, and don’t spread the news of my injury.”","He thought for a moment and instructed his manager, “Brother Yang, try your best to bring down the trending searches’ popularity. In short, I don’t care what price I have to pay. I don’t want to see myself on the news. I’m afraid that Nian Nian will be worried when she sees the news...”","The manager rolled his eyes angrily when he heard that. “I knew that Miss Qiao was the reason you don’t want the public to know!”","Jiang Li did not argue.","“Don’t worry, I’ll tell the company.” The manager tucked him in and looked at him angrily. “Anyway, you have money. You’re just playing around in the entertainment industry. It’s a pity that the top celebrity I finally managed to bring out is you. I’m always the most anxious when something happens!”","Jiang Li was a top celebrity.","His fan club, Li Hua, was famous for its astonishing combat power in the fan circle.","If the news of Jiang Li’s hospitalization spread, it would definitely dominate the trending searches. The entire Weibo might explode.","However, if Jiang Li forcefully suppressed the trending topic and did not show his face for three months, all his work would be canceled. Later, haters would definitely spread rumors online that he was unprofessional and that he was acting like a big shot... In short, they would gather the masses to make their point!","The masses were a double-edged sword.","Jiang Li seemed a little tired. He closed his eyes, unwilling to speak again.","The manager’s anger subsided when he saw that his lips were still pale and weak. He said to the sickly person in the bed, “By the way, the staff member in charge of the cable cord ran away.”","Jiang Li finally opened his eyes and looked at him. His fingers were curled up. He frowned and his voice was dry. “He ran away?”"]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530 A Big Man Wearing Ear Studs, What a Hooligan","paragraphs":["1530 A Big Man Wearing Ear Studs, What a Hooligan","The manager said, “They found out that the staff responsible for the accident had run away right after you were taken to the hospital.","“I pulled some strings to check on him. He bought a plane ticket three days ago. His wife and kid flew out of the country yesterday and he left today in a hurry. No one realized he was gone until it happened.” The manager lowered his voice. “In addition, the police found signs that the cable that supported you was cut by a knife.”","This meant that Jiang Li’s fall was not just an accident.","Jiang Li frowned. He didn’t know who hated him so much.","!!","They were still talking when the ward door opened.","Jiang Zongnan and his relatives came in from outside.","The manager immediately shut up and exchanged glances with him, then said, “Young Master Jiang, I’ll leave first. Take care of yourself.”","Jiang Li nodded.","He politely greeted Jiang Zongnan, ignored Yuan Qing and the other Jiang family relatives, and hurried to the company to settle the trouble.","Jiang Li refused to publicize his injury, so there were still many public relations arrangements. They needed to be prepared in advance.","To avoid being caught off guard by the circle’s enemies.","...","The corners of Yuan Qing’s mouth twitched imperceptibly the moment he went out. She whispered in disdain, “I don’t understand the world these days. A grown man still has his hair permed and wears ear studs. He’s a hooligan. One look and I can tell that he’s not a decent person.”","“Mom, stop talking.” Her son was very obedient. He pulled her and lowered his voice to persuade her.","Yuan Qing kept a straight face and stopped talking.","However, she was perfunctory when facing Jiang Li, unlike how she was with Jiang Yao and Jiang Xianrou.","“Jiang Li, are you okay? You have to listen to the doctor and rest more. Take this opportunity to stop getting involved in the entertainment industry. What’s so good about those dirty places? You’re not young anymore. It’s time for you to grow up. Look, your sister has gone to the Pharmacy Association. You should find something serious to do. What’s the point of a man being in the entertainment industry every day? It’s not like your family lacks this bit of money.”","Her words were extremely unpleasant. It was annoying to hear.","Sure enough, Jiang Li frowned, but because of her seniority, he couldn’t say anything. However, he did not give her much face and ignored her.","Yuan Qing pulled a long face. “I know you don’t like to hear what Aunt says, but I’m doing this for your own good. Look at how hardworking Xianrou is...”","She brought up Jiang Xianrou again.","It was mainly because after Jiang Xianrou’s filiation banquet last time, she couldn’t sleep well for a few days when she went back. She had always regretted betting on the wrong side.","In the end, she didn’t expect Jiang Xianrou to really have the ability to get Qi Yan to bring her to Continent O and become a member of the Pharmacy Association.","She was inexperienced and did not know what the Pharmacy Association was about. She only knew from Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru’s reaction that the Pharmacist Association was very powerful. Anyway, it wasn’t a place that ordinary people could enter.","Jiang Xianrou successfully became a member of the Pharmacy Association, so she felt much more at ease recently.","Jiang Li ignored her. His eyes were cold and calm. “If she’s capable, go and tell her. Don’t tell me. No matter how much you tell me, she won’t hear your praise. There’s no need to waste your breath on me!”","Seeing that Jiang Li didn’t like her advice, she looked around the ward again. Then, she turned and asked Jiang Zongnan, “Qiao Nian didn’t come?”"]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531 Asking Jiang Xianrou For Help","paragraphs":["1531 Asking Jiang Xianrou For Help","Jiang Zongnan frowned and did not want to respond to her. But he eventually answered quietly, “Nian Nian still doesn’t know that Jiang Li is hospitalized.”","Yuan Qing’s brows immediately raised and she started to speak sarcastically again, “She doesn’t know? Her relationship with Jiang Li is so good. Her brother is hospitalized, and she doesn’t even know about such a big matter.”","“...It happened too suddenly. I didn’t have time to tell her.” Jiang Zongnan rubbed his temples, unwilling to argue with her. “Alright, Aunt. Jiang Li still needs to rest. Let’s go out to let him rest.”","Yuan Qing frowned and pouted.","She had wanted to criticize Qiao Nian, but she saw that Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Li were both unhappy.","Thus, she suppressed her dissatisfaction and turned to her grandnephew. “Jiang Yao, do you want to call Xianrou?”","Jiang Yao was supposed to fly to the illegal district today, but he went outside to cancel his flight because of the sudden incident.","He walked in with his cell phone and heard Yuan Qing’s arrangements. He subconsciously frowned.","Yuan Qing did not realize how annoying she was. She put on the airs of an elder and quickly made arrangements for others. “Xianrou must know many powerful doctors in the Pharmacy Association. Give her a call. She just has to tell the people from the Pharmacy Association and they will definitely come. You don’t have to trouble yourself to look for doctors everywhere...”","Jiang Yao’s handsome face stiffened as he looked at her expressionlessly.","She looked like she had never seen the world and couldn’t stop praising Jiang Xianrou. She was saying that Jiang Xianrou was doing very well in the Pharmacy Association.","Jiang Yao recalled what had happened when he bumped into Qiao Nian in Rao City.","The person that his aunt should be talking about was Qiao Nian, whom she looked down on.","Xianrou...","Even if Jiang Yao didn’t know if his sister had successfully integrated into the Pharmacy Association under Qi Yan’s introduction, he knew that it was impossible for Jiang Xianrou to make the members of the Pharmacist Association work for her.","“Xianrou is so outstanding. She can definitely...” Yuan Qing was still nagging.","Jiang Yao interrupted her impatiently. “She’s just an ordinary member of the Pharmacy Association. She’s not as capable as you think.”","“But Xianrou...”","Jiang Yao had always had a good relationship with Jiang Xianrou.","Unlike Jiang Li, who sided with outsiders.","Yuan Qing didn’t understand why he had suddenly interrupted her. She had clearly been praising Jiang Xianrou the entire time. Why was Jiang Yao still unhappy?","“Dad, let’s go out and talk.” Jiang Yao ignored her and walked past her.","Jiang Zongnan couldn’t stand Yuan Qing’s use of his seniority to criticize him. He nodded and followed him out.","As soon as the two of them left, Yuan Qing’s face burned with pain and she felt a little embarrassed. She muttered awkwardly, “Is it not right for me to care about a junior? As expected, people are annoying everywhere when they’re old.”","Yuan Qing’s son still had some backbone. Seeing Jiang Zongnan and the others’ attitude, he was also so embarrassed that he wished he could find a hole to hide in.","Seeing that his mother was still chattering, his face heated up. He turned around and said to his nephew, “Jiang Li, have a good rest. Uncle will visit you another day.”","He grabbed his mother’s hand and walked out. He lowered his voice and said, “Mom, stop talking. Let’s go back! We’ll talk when we get back. He still has to rest...”","The ward finally quietened down after Yuan Qing was dragged away."]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532 Sister Nian Is the One Who Can Drive the Pharmacy Association","paragraphs":["1532 Sister Nian Is the One Who Can Drive the Pharmacy Association","In the corridor outside the ward.","Jiang Yao found a quiet corner and stopped, then said, “Dad, have you contacted the doctor?”","“I’ve got a few experts...”","Although the Jiang family couldn’t compare to the few families at the top of the pyramid in Beijing, their status was considerably high.","!!","To Jiang Zongnan, it was not difficult to find a doctor for his son.","“It’s just that Mr. Huang hasn’t answered me yet.” Jiang Zongnan’s tone changed. He sighed and said with a bitter expression, “You also know that Mr. Huang has long retired. It’s rare for him to come out. Many people both locally and abroad are queuing up to look for him, but he’s unmoved. However, it’ll definitely be best if Mr. Huang can come out of retirement. At least we don’t have to worry about him having to live with side effects from his current injury.”","Mr. Huang was famous even internationally. He wasn’t the kind of person who could be invited casually.","Jiang Zongnan had this plan, but that was about it.","He contacted Qing University and wanted to use his connections there to get Mr. Huang to come out.","However, Principal Liang had yet to reply to him. There was a high chance that he had not mentioned it to Mr. Huang.","Jiang Yao had a headache again.","Actually, Qiao Nian was Mr. Huang’s disciple. If she asked, Mr. Huang might give her face. As for the others... it would be difficult for their family to invite a master of Mr. Huang’s level!","Jiang Yao knew this very well.","He raised his hand with a solemn expression and said, “I’ll personally go find Mr. Huang and see if he’s willing to give me face. If I can, that’s good. If not...”","“If not, we’ll think of another way.” Jiang Zongnan relaxed his brows and patted his shoulder gently. His expression softened. “Jiang Yao, it’s been hard on you.”","Jiang Yao nodded. He was actually very uncertain. He didn’t think that Mr. Huang would do him a favor just because he appeared.","But now, other than begging Qiao Nian for help, this was the only way!","...","Ye Residence.","Ye Wangchuan was safe and sound. Ye Lan finally dared to tell Old Master Ye about it.","In the end, she poured a glass of water for Ye Maoshan and placed it on the table. Her eyebrows relaxed.","She sighed and said, “I heard from Jingxing that it’s all thanks to Nian Nian that they were able to locate and transfer the rescue resources this time... If not for her, I don’t know how long they would have had to suffer.”","As Ye Wangchuan was fine, Old Master Ye listened to her calmly. He was also looking down at his cell phone as he listened.","Ye Qichen had returned from his rehabilitation overseas for some time. He was also sitting on the couch and playing games.","Hearing this, he raised his head. His fair and cute little face was exceptionally charming. The corners of his mouth were tense as he continued firmly, “My sister is good, to begin with.”","Ye Lan saw his protective stance and was stunned by his cuteness. She walked over and pinched his tender little face. She said with a smile, “Yes, yes, yes. Your sister is the best. She’s the best person in the world. Alright?”","Ye Qichen was only obedient in front of Qiao Nian. In front of the others, he always had his way. He turned his face away and placed the iPad aside. He looked at Ye Lan with a serious expression and said, “That’s right.”","Ye Lan had no words.","Ye Qichen didn’t think that there was anything wrong with his words. He didn’t see the sadness on his grandmother’s face at all. He looked at her with his big black and white eyes, afraid that Ye Lan would not understand what he meant. He said again, “My sister is the best person in the world!”","Ye Lan had no words.","Why was she feeling a little sour inside?"]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 Elder Ye: When Are You Getting Married?","paragraphs":["1533 Elder Ye: When Are You Getting Married?","She turned around sourly to find some sense of presence. Then, she looked at Old Master Ye, who didn’t seem to hear them, and shouted, “Dad, what are you looking at?!”","“Nothing. Just sending a message.”","“What message?” Ye Lan leaned over and glanced at his phone.","Ye Maoshan’s expression was serious. He immediately hid his phone from her. When Ye Lan walked away speechlessly, he said, “I’ll ask Nian Nian when they’ll be back.”","!!","Ye Maoshan waited until she was far away before he picked up his phone again and looked at it. He found Ye Wangchuan’s WeChat and sent a message.","[When are you getting married?]","...","The following day.","Saturday.","Beijing International Airport.","After the plane landed, Ye Wangchuan saw the message on WeChat.","[Grandpa: When are you getting married?]","He stood there with one hand folded and waited for Qin Si and the others. At first glance, he thought that he had seen wrong. He frowned and looked again.","The dialog box was very concise.","Old Master Ye wasn’t a talkative person. Usually, they wouldn’t contact each other for no reason. If there was anything, they would just talk about it briefly.","There was only one recent message in the entire dialog box.","It was the question Ye Maoshan had asked: When are you getting married?","Ye Wangchuan looked at the message on WeChat and was silent for two seconds before replying casually.","[Y: She’s only a freshman.]","Old Master Ye seemed to be playing with his phone. Just as he sent the message, he received a new WeChat message.","Ye Wangchuan’s phone vibrated.","He glanced down at it again.","[Grandpa: You can get married in her first year. Do you dislike Nian Nian for being young?]","He hadn’t had time to reply when Old Master Ye sent another message.","[Grandpa: She doesn’t even look down on an old bachelor like you. Be content!]","Ye Wangchuan’s temples twitched violently, and his thin lips couldn’t help but twitch. His usual lazy expression disappeared as he was rendered speechless by the old man.","He raised his eyebrows and replied Elder Ye.","[Y: I’m not complaining. She’s not old enough to get married.]","The legal age of marriage in the country required the man to be 22 years old and the woman to be at least 20 years old.","Qiao Nian had just entered her first year of university. She still had to wait two more years.","Ye Wangchuan had just replied to him when Old Master Ye’s WeChat message flashed over again. [That’s nothing, it’s easy to solve! I’ll find some connections to get you two married through the back door~!]","It was followed by a happy emoji.","Ye Wangchuan knew that the emoticon he sent must have been stolen from Ye Qichen.","His thin lips pursed and he decided not to reply.","He put his phone back into his pocket and looked up to see Qin Si and Qiao Nian returning with water.","“Master Wang.” Gu San followed them to buy water. When he returned, he handed him a cup of hot coffee respectfully. “Here’s your coffee.”","Ye Wangchuan took it and looked at them.","Qin Si and Gu San were both holding water bottles, and even Zhang Yang had bought coffee. Only Qiao Nian’s hands were empty.","He raised his eyebrows and ignored Qin Si and the others. He walked up to the girl and said in a low voice, “Why didn’t you buy water?”","Qiao Nian had been avoiding him since yesterday. When he suddenly approached her, the girl subconsciously raised her hand, not used to it. She pulled down the brim of her cap and said casually, “I’m drinking mineral water. It’s in my bag.”","She didn’t like drinks like coffee and milk tea. They were too cloying for her.","Given the choice, she would still prefer mineral water."]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534 Sister Nian Is Angry","paragraphs":["1534 Sister Nian Is Angry","Ye Wangchuan saw that she had bought water and nodded. He was about to ask her if she wanted to go back directly or eat something when Qiao Nian’s phone rang.","The girl took out her phone from her pocket and lowered her eyes to look at it. She didn’t know who was calling her, but her eyebrows and eyes were restrained. Her gaze wasn’t as wilful as before. Her expression was very serious as she answered the call. “Hello, Dad.”","Qin Si was about to ask who it was when Qiao Nian called him “Dad.”","He turned his head away silently and walked over to Ye Wangchuan. “Master Wang, are we having lunch together?”","!!","“We’ll talk about it later.”","The man’s voice was lazy, a little desultory.","It was obvious that he was waiting for Qiao Nian to decide.","Qin Si clicked his tongue and turned to Zhang Yang resentfully. “Is your friend in the shop? Let’s have hotpot for lunch. Sister Qiao likes it.”","“I’ll call and ask him.” Zhang Yang reached for his phone and prepared to call his friend.","If Qiao Nian wanted to eat hotpot, he would definitely call her back!","Unexpectedly, before Zhang Yang could make the call, Qiao Nian acknowledged her father in a low voice and said to them after hanging up, “I have something on at noon, so I won’t be eating with you.”","“Uh, Sister Qiao... Aren’t you going back to Rhine Apartments?” Qin Si still wanted to play games with her.","Zhang Yang and Gu San also looked at her.","The girl’s eyebrows were quite exquisite, and no emotions could be seen in her expression. However, Ye Wangchuan keenly captured the haze in her eyes.","Qiao Nian rarely got angry.","She seemed offended this time.","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and stuffed the coffee back into Gu San’s hand. He said to the girl very naturally, “Where are you going? I’ll accompany you.”","“There’s no need...” Qiao Nian subconsciously refused. Halfway through her sentence, their eyes met. She retracted her gaze impatiently and rubbed her temples, seemingly compromising. “Okay.”","An hour later.","The red-flagged black sedan pulled up in front of the hospital.","The license plate was an arrogant ‘Beijing A.888888’. Just by looking at this license plate number, passers-by knew that the owner of this car was not to be trifled with.","Ye Wangchuan drove.","After parking the car, he unbuckled his seatbelt and got out first. When he walked around to help Qiao Nian open the car door, he saw Jiang Zongjin. He greeted him very politely, “Uncle.”","“It’s Wangchuan...” Seeing that he had come with Qiao Nian, Jiang Zongjin nodded at him as a greeting. He turned his head and waited for Qiao Nian to get out of the car. He immediately greeted her warmly, “Nian Nian.”","“Which ward is Jiang Li in?” On the way, Qiao Nian called Jiang Li’s manager and asked about his condition.","She received another message from Liang Conglin asking about Jiang Li.","She heard from Liang Conglin that Jiang Yao was looking for connections and wanted Elder Huang to take a look at Jiang Li. She called Nie Mi.","Nie Mi had just called her back five minutes ago, saying that Mr. Huang was out of town and would be back tomorrow.","After thanking him, Qiao Nian closed her eyes and meditated. She didn’t speak along the way, her brows furrowed with impatience.","He could tell she was angry this time.","At the very least, when she heard from Jiang Li’s manager that the accident wasn’t an accident, Qiao Nian’s face was filled with an unstoppable sharpness!","Jiang Zongjin told her what floor and number Jiang Li’s ward was on.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips, took a deep breath, and strode towards the in-patient department..."]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535 Damn, Who Betrayed Him?","paragraphs":["1535 Damn, Who Betrayed Him?","In the ward.","Jiang Li was on an IV drip and couldn’t move his body yet. He was bored lying in bed alone and was wondering if he should call a nurse to turn on the television for him. He would find a variety show to pass the time.","The ward door opened at this moment.","“You’re just in time.” Jiang Li propped up his free arm and spoke briskly. He turned to the door and said, “Come over and help me turn it on...”","!!","The first thing he saw was the corner of a shirt.","He was still wondering why the nurse didn’t wear a uniform to work.","In the next second, Jiang Li’s expression changed drastically. He looked at the person who came in in shock and said, “Nian Nian.”","Sh*t, who sold him out!","Jiang Li instinctively wanted to sit up, but unfortunately, the anesthetic had yet to wear off. His entire body was weak and powerless. He could still lie on the bed, but he felt a little dizzy when he exerted force.","Qiao Nian walked over as if she knew what he wanted to do. She calmly picked up the remote control board on the cabinet beside the bed and turned on the television for him. “What do you want to see?”","There was some silence.","Jiang Li’s mind was blank. He looked at her and opened his mouth, but no words came out. “I’m fine with anything.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian understood him well. She responded lazily and pressed the remote control to a variety show. Then, she placed the remote control where he could reach it. Then, she dragged a chair over and sat by his side.","The girl didn’t initiate a conversation.","Jiang Li didn’t dare to move. He kept glancing at the girl beside him nervously. “Nian-Nian Nian, why are you here?”","Didn’t he tell his manager to find a way to keep the news quiet?","Qiao Nian shouldn’t know.","Jiang Zongjin and Ye Wangchuan entered as soon as he finished speaking.","It wasn’t strange for Ye Wangchuan to follow Qiao Nian.","Jiang Li was mainly looking at Jiang Zongjin.","He understood everything as soon as Jiang Zongjin entered. For a moment, he was a little depressed. With a bitter face, he was about to cry. “Uncle, why did you tell Nian Nian? I said not to tell her so that she wouldn’t worry.”","Jiang Zongjin touched the bridge of his nose awkwardly. “...You didn’t tell me not to tell Nian Nian.”","So he did.","Jiang Li was rendered speechless by his genius logic and couldn’t find a retort.","Qiao Nian ignored them.","She had been reading Jiang Li’s medical report since she came into the ward and dragged a chair for herself.","She read things quickly.","Her eyes glanced past 10 lines at once.","Now she had a rough idea of his injuries.","She put the case report back. With her eyes half-closed, she couldn’t read his emotions. “Who did this?” she asked rather irritably.","“Huh?”","Jiang Li was dumbfounded by the question. He first looked at Qiao Nian, then subconsciously looked in Ye Wangchuan’s direction.","Ye Wangchuan shrugged and gestured for him to answer honestly.","He turned his head back again in silence. “I don’t know,” he told her sickly.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and glanced at him again. She changed her words. “Do you have any enemies in the circle who want to mess with you?”","Jiang Li felt that he had embarrassed himself this time. He was too embarrassed to look Qiao Nian in the eye. He shook his head and said shamelessly, “I think I’m quite popular. No one in the circle hates me so much.","“The most they’ll do is buy some of the hot searches to spread my scandal and pay a few marketing accounts to set the pace. They won’t do anything illegal.”"]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536 Can’t Master Wang Be Human?","paragraphs":["1536 Can’t Master Wang Be Human?","“Oh.” Qiao Nian didn’t think that it was someone from the entertainment industry, either.","The other party was very experienced in cleaning up his own tail.","No one in the entertainment industry had such high standards.","And it was just as Jiang Li said.","!!","Everyone was in the same circle. It was normal to have small fights over resources and popularity, but they wouldn’t commit murder and arson.","Seeing that she was deep in thought, Jiang Li was afraid that she would worry about him, so he forced himself to stay awake and said, “Nian Nian, don’t worry about me. I’m fine. I just broke three ribs, right? I...”","“Yes?” The girl’s voice was dry as she interrupted him and looked at him with dark eyes. “Are you all right?”","Jiang Li was immediately suppressed by her aura. His mouth twitched.","He didn’t say anything yet, but the girl had already gently squeezed his injured wrist.","Jiang Li immediately grimaced in pain and almost admitted his mistake on the spot. “Ouch!”","Qiao Nian didn’t make things difficult for him. She only checked to see if he had hurt his bones. Seeing that he was in so much pain, she immediately let go.","“You’ll have to recuperate for a while. You won’t be able to use your hand for at least three months. I’ll mix an external dressing for you later. Remember to ask the nurse to change it for you every day.”","Jiang Li was as obedient as a spoiled eggplant now. “I understand.”","After saying that, he hesitated for a moment before at her again. Seeing that the girl’s eyes were cold and sharp, he said slowly, “Um... Nian Nian.”","Qiao Nian looked at him, one hand in her pocket, as if waiting for him to continue.","Jiang Li pursed his pale lips and said worriedly, “Don’t worry about this. I’ll take care of it. It might be a bit more complicated than you think. You’re still a freshman. Don’t worry about me. I’m an adult. I can handle myself.”","He wasn’t afraid of anything else, but he was afraid that Qiao Nian would get involved because of him.","Jiang Li could vaguely smell that the water was very deep, or at least not as simple as it looked.","Although he wasn’t as passionate about this circle as Jiang Yao and Jiang Xianrou, it did not mean that he did not have crisis awareness.","Jiang Li trusted his sixth sense.","Many people must be involved in this matter, and the situation was far more complicated than it seemed. He really didn’t want to implicate Qiao Nian.","“Master Wang.” Worried that Qiao Nian wouldn’t listen to him, he turned to look at the man on the other side of the bed and said in a low voice, “I can’t be discharged for the time being. Help me keep an eye on Nian Nian. Don’t let her interfere in this matter. We’ll talk about this after I’m discharged.”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened. His handsome face was calm and composed as he gave him a faint look. “I can’t promise you that. I can’t control her.”","Jiang Li was confused.","Ye Wangchuan exchanged glances with him and smiled. He was frank in front of his future father-in-law. “I always listen to her.”","Jiang Li was speechless.","Jiang Zongjin was a man of few words and was quite a pedant.","He glanced at him upon hearing that the man could still speak frankly in front of Jiang Li. His brows relaxed, and his expression was gentle. He was obviously satisfied. The more he looked at his son-in-law, the more satisfied he was.","Jiang Li saw his uncle’s satisfied gaze and his mouth twitched. He felt even more depressed.","... He was still lying on the hospital bed. Could Master Wang still be human?","What a f*cking dog!"]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537 Sending Jiang Zongjin Back","paragraphs":["1537 Sending Jiang Zongjin Back","Qiao Nian didn’t say anything. She just stood by the bed for a while. Before she left, she said to him, “Rest well. I’ll investigate this matter.”","Jiang Li had wanted to talk to her and tell her not to be rash.","Unfortunately, the doctor happened to come in to take his blood pressure at this moment. Qiao Nian wanted to ask about his condition, so she followed the doctor out.","Jiang Li didn’t find a chance to talk to her until she left.","...","Outside the in-patient department.","Qiao Nian learned more about Jiang Li’s situation before separating from his attending doctor.","Ye Wangchuan had been following her. Now, he saw a layer of frost between her brows. He asked in a low voice, “Shall we go back to Rhine Apartments?”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian nodded and turned to Jiang Zongjin. “Dad, I’ll go back and change my clothes. You should go back to school, too. I have news for you.”","“You’re not coming with me?”","Jiang Zongjin glanced at the handsome young man beside her and felt quite uncomfortable. However, he felt much more at ease when he thought of Ye Wangchuan’s character. “Alright, go back and rest. Don’t worry about Jiang Li. Dad will find a way to investigate.”","Qiao Nian’s mind was filled with this matter. She nodded, looking very obedient. She looked up and said, “I’ll send you back.”","Jiang Zongjin could see her fatigue. Without thinking, he waved his hand and refused. “No need, I’ll go back by myself. You don’t have to trouble yourself...”","A hand patted his shoulder before he could finish speaking. Ye Wangchuan was very polite. “Uncle, let’s go. I drove here. I can take you back.”","“But...” Jiang Zongjin still looked a little hesitant.","He didn’t want Qiao Nian to tire herself too much.","Ye Wangchuan’s words were concise and his voice was convincing. “We’re going back, anyway. It’s on the way.”","Jiang Zongjin pursed his lips, still hesitating.","Qiao Nian tugged at the brim of her cap. Her exquisite face was clear as she looked at him. “Dad, let’s go together.”","“Alright.” Jiang Zongjin no longer hesitated. He nodded and said, “Young Master Ye, sorry to trouble you.”","“Just call me by my name, Uncle.” Ye Wangchuan took out his car keys.","He was wearing a light-colored shirt under a long trench coat. The trench coat’s style accentuated his broad shoulders and narrow waist, making his slender figure stand out.","Ye Wangchuan glanced at the girl with a hint of gentleness in his eyes before looking away. He then looked at Jiang Zongjin and said, “You can call me Little Ye.”","As expected.","Jiang Zongjin’s frown eased a little. The more he looked at him, the more satisfied he was. He didn’t stand on ceremony and nodded. “Little Ye, I’ll have to trouble you to take care of Nian Nian for me.”","“Not at all. It’s what I should do.” The man’s voice was low and charming.","Qiao Nian glanced at him silently as she stood coolly with her hands in her pockets. However, she didn’t retort. She only gave him a sideways glance. It was lazy and eye-catching.","...","Qiao Nian basically didn’t talk on the way back.","It was mostly Ye Wangchuan chatting with Jiang Zongjin.","Ye Wangchuan had always been a smooth talker, but few people around him needed him to spend so much effort to treat them. Therefore, he usually didn’t seem to speak much.","But once he started chatting seriously, there were quite a few topics to talk about.","Jiang Zongjin chatted with him all the way.","From the moment Qiao Nian started talking about academic topics, Ye Wangchuan was able to catch almost every topic perfectly. Moreover, his ideas were very insightful. It was obvious that he was someone with experience in society."]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538 Sister Nian: If You Want to Play, She’ll Fight You to the End!","paragraphs":["1538 Sister Nian: If You Want to Play, She’ll Fight You to the End!","Jiang Zongjin’s first concern was his daughter, and his second concern was academics.","Ye Wangchuan could chat with him on both topics. Thus, Jiang Zongjin’s impression of him improved.","Less than 40 minutes later.","Jiang Zongjin was still a little unsatisfied when he got out of the car. He said very naturally, “Little Ye, I’m here. You guys can go back. We’ll talk another day. By the way, the principle of the spiral activation you just mentioned...”","Ye Wangchuan understood instantly. He smiled and immediately said, “I’ll organize a document for you and send it over later.”","Jiang Zongjin was overjoyed.","This was because the theory Ye Wangchuan proposed was very novel. At least, it was a direction that the academic world did not think of yet.","He was personally very interested.","“Good, good.” Although he was happy, he didn’t forget that Qiao Nian was still in the car. He reminded the girl looking down at her phone, “Nian Nian, rest early when you get back. Don’t tire yourself out.”","Qiao Nian didn’t say much along the way. She played with her phone the entire time.","She seemed to be texting someone.","Jiang Zongjin knew that she knew many people and had many friends, so he did not disturb her. He only talked to her when they were about to part.","Qiao Nian put down her phone and looked up. She rolled down the window and saw the concern in his eyes. A warm feeling flowed through her heart. Her voice was slightly hoarse and low. “Yes, I know. Dad, go back. I’ll ask you out for a meal when I’m free.”","Jiang Zongjin was happy upon receiving her promise and hurriedly replied, “Hey! You guys can go. I’ll go in after you leave.”","Ye Wangchuan said goodbye and turned the car around. The black flag drove quietly towards Rhine Apartments...","Qiao Nian rolled down the window when the person in the rearview mirror gradually became smaller. She placed her hand by the window and said softly to the man, “I’ve found out who did it.”","Ye Wangchuan drove slowly knowing she was tired and turned on the air conditioner. He grunted and raised an eyebrow when he heard this. “You found out so quickly?”","“... I can’t say that I’ve found anything. I can only say that I’ve caught a small tail.” Qiao Nian’s lips curled up into a smile, but it didn’t reach her eyes. She said coldly, “Let’s not go back yet. I need to go somewhere.”","She gave him the address.","Qiao Nian rested her fair fingers on the window lazily and frivolously, but her eyes were icy. “... I’m looking for someone.”","She had to find someone somewhere.","She couldn’t say some things in her father’s presence. However, this matter was quite interesting according to what she found out.","If the other party wanted to play, she would naturally play along!","Ye Wangchuan didn’t even ask who she was going to find. He just put the address she gave him on the GPS.","...","At the same time, in a high-end KTV in Beijing.","A group of young men and women were gathered together and playing happily.","These people didn’t look old. all of them had dyed hair. They were either yellow or green. It was obvious that most of them were young people in society.","On one side of the brown sofa, a boy about Qiao Nian’s age sat in a corner. His face was tense the entire time as he scrolled through the news on his phone.","Beside him, a man with green bird feathers put down the microphone and carried a cup over. He smiled and clung to his shoulder, sitting beside him. “Young Master Yao, why aren’t you playing with everyone today?”","Yao Yu’s heart was in turmoil. How could he still be in the mood to play with them? He immediately frowned and pushed his hand away. He lowered his voice and said, “You guys play, I...”","The door to the KTV room was suddenly kicked open before he could finish speaking.","“Who the f*ck is that!”","“Holy sh*t!”","The group of young men and women in the private room became noisy.","Only Yao Yu recognized the person who barged in. His face was pale from fear and his body was trembling like a sieve. He opened his mouth and shouted, “Cousin!”"]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 - 1538 Sister Nian: If You Want to Play, She’ll Fight You to the End!","paragraphs":["1538 Sister Nian: If You Want to Play, She’ll Fight You to the End!","Jiang Zongjin’s first concern was his daughter, and his second concern was academics.","Ye Wangchuan could chat with him on both topics. Thus, Jiang Zongjin’s impression of him improved.","Less than 40 minutes later.","Jiang Zongjin was still a little unsatisfied when he got out of the car. He said very naturally, “Little Ye, I’m here. You guys can go back. We’ll talk another day. By the way, the principle of the spiral activation you just mentioned...”","!!","Ye Wangchuan understood instantly. He smiled and immediately said, “I’ll organize a document for you and send it over later.”","Jiang Zongjin was overjoyed.","This was because the theory Ye Wangchuan proposed was very novel. At least, it was a direction that the academic world did not think of yet.","He was personally very interested.","“Good, good.” Although he was happy, he didn’t forget that Qiao Nian was still in the car. He reminded the girl looking down at her phone, “Nian Nian, rest early when you get back. Don’t tire yourself out.”","Qiao Nian didn’t say much along the way. She played with her phone the entire time.","She seemed to be texting someone.","Jiang Zongjin knew that she knew many people and had many friends, so he did not disturb her. He only talked to her when they were about to part.","Qiao Nian put down her phone and looked up. She rolled down the window and saw the concern in his eyes. A warm feeling flowed through her heart. Her voice was slightly hoarse and low. “Yes, I know. Dad, go back. I’ll ask you out for a meal when I’m free.”","Jiang Zongjin was happy upon receiving her promise and hurriedly replied, “Hey! You guys can go. I’ll go in after you leave.”","Ye Wangchuan said goodbye and turned the car around. The black flag drove quietly towards Rhine Apartments...","Qiao Nian rolled down the window when the person in the rearview mirror gradually became smaller. She placed her hand by the window and said softly to the man, “I’ve found out who did it.”","Ye Wangchuan drove slowly knowing she was tired and turned on the air conditioner. He grunted and raised an eyebrow when he heard this. “You found out so quickly?”","“... I can’t say that I’ve found anything. I can only say that I’ve caught a small tail.” Qiao Nian’s lips curled up into a smile, but it didn’t reach her eyes. She said coldly, “Let’s not go back yet. I need to go somewhere.”","She gave him the address.","Qiao Nian rested her fair fingers on the window lazily and frivolously, but her eyes were icy. “... I’m looking for someone.”","She had to find someone somewhere.","She couldn’t say some things in her father’s presence. However, this matter was quite interesting according to what she found out.","If the other party wanted to play, she would naturally play along!","Ye Wangchuan didn’t even ask who she was going to find. He just put the address she gave him on the GPS.","...","At the same time, in a high-end KTV in Beijing.","A group of young men and women were gathered together and playing happily.","These people didn’t look old. all of them had dyed hair. They were either yellow or green. It was obvious that most of them were young people in society.","On one side of the brown sofa, a boy about Qiao Nian’s age sat in a corner. His face was tense the entire time as he scrolled through the news on his phone.","Beside him, a man with green bird feathers put down the microphone and carried a cup over. He smiled and clung to his shoulder, sitting beside him. “Young Master Yao, why aren’t you playing with everyone today?”","Yao Yu’s heart was in turmoil. How could he still be in the mood to play with them? He immediately frowned and pushed his hand away. He lowered his voice and said, “You guys play, I...”","The door to the KTV room was suddenly kicked open before he could finish speaking.","“Who the f*ck is that!”","“Holy sh*t!”","The group of young men and women in the private room became noisy.","Only Yao Yu recognized the person who barged in. His face was pale from fear and his body was trembling like a sieve. He opened his mouth and shouted, “Cousin!”"]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 I’ll Give You Five Minutes to Explain","paragraphs":["1540 I’ll Give You Five Minutes to Explain","His grandmother had been repeatedly humiliated by his cousin. Every time she came home, she would mention how arrogant Qiao Nian was and how she didn’t respect her elders...","Yao Yu had never seen Qiao Nian before, but he had heard a lot about her from Yuan Qing.","His cousin, whom he had never met before, was different from Jiang Xianrou. She had never given face to her relatives!","His grandmother was so noble in the Jiang family, let alone him.","He was afraid that Qiao Nian would be heartless.","“I-I can explain.” Yao Yu was so frightened that sweat broke out on his forehead. He shivered and said to the girl, “I just heard from my father that Cousin Jiang Li was hospitalized. This matter really has nothing to do with me. I was also deceived. Believe me! Really, I wouldn’t dare to do such a thing even if I had ten guts.”","“Young Master Yao, what are you talking about?” The green-haired guy was still clueless. “Why does your cousin look like she’s here to cause trouble? Young Master Yao, do you want me to stand up for you?”","Yao Yu wished he could slap him unconscious. He quickly took the time to glare at him.","The little green-haired guy thought that he was giving him the go-ahead and immediately showed a look of understanding. He used the excuse of going to the bathroom to sneak out and make a call.","Ye Wangchuan was guarding the door. He was in no hurry when he saw him go out to call for reinforcements. In fact, he had no intention of stopping him.","He leaned back lazily and waited for Qiao Nian to finish.","...","The green-haired guy went out.","The other men and women in the private room did not dare to make a sound. They all glanced over, trying to figure out what was going on.","Although Yao Yu did not dare to be domineering in Beijing because of his relationship with the Jiang family, he was still doing well in the circle of ordinary people.","He was related to the Jiang family.","Jiang Xianrou was his cousin.","Top celebrity Jiang Li was also his cousin.","Although a thousand miles was a long journey, the people outside didn’t know that his grandmother actually did not have much say in the family. The Jiang family actually did not like Yuan Qing, this aunt who could never figure things out.","The people outside only thought that his family had a background and could come into contact with upper-class families.","In addition, Yao Yu was generous with his money and hung out with a large group of bad friends.","Today was the day he came out to play with a group of friends.","Ignoring the others in the room, Qiao Nian sat down on the sofa boldly. Her face was exquisite and eye-catching under the private room’s dazzling lights, making her look rather valiant.","She sat there exuding an oppressive aura.","“I’ll give you five minutes to explain.”","Qiao Nian wasted no time. With that, she took out her phone, turned it on, and threw the evidence in front of him.","Yao Yu picked up the phone and looked down. His heart suddenly tightened.","As expected.","A transfer record was shown on the screen. He had transferred three million yuan to a staff member working on Jiang Li’s commercial.","Yao Yu broke out in cold sweat. His hand trembled as he held the phone. He looked at Qiao Nian again, his eyes filled with fear and unease. “I was deceived.”","After saying this, he saw that Qiao Nian was looking at him coldly. Her chin was exposed under her baseball cap, and she exuded an oppressing aura.","He swallowed again silently and tried to get his brain working. “A week ago, someone found me through my friend. He said he wanted to bribe the staff around Cousin Jiang Li so that it would be convenient for him to get first-hand information in the future. He said that their company didn’t want anything big. They just needed to get some photos of Cousin Jiang Li’s life. Some small daily activities would do.”"]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 He’s Quite Afraid of Qiao Nian","paragraphs":["1541 He’s Quite Afraid of Qiao Nian","“I didn’t want to agree at first. The entertainment industry is already in chaos. What if he lied to me and bribed the staff to take photos of Cousin Jiang Li’s private life? It’s not like there haven’t been similar incidents in the entertainment industry. The paparazzi bribed the staff around celebrities to take photos of them changing their clothes in private.”","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow at him and said with a hoarse voice, “Continue.”","Yao Yu seemed to have been encouraged. He mustered up his courage and continued, “In the end, two days later, he contacted me again and said that there was no need to look for someone like Cousin’s assistant. He had a candidate... Not long after, he sent me that person’s information. I saw that he was just a staff member in charge of miscellaneous things around Cousin, not an assistant or anyone important.","“But I still hesitated. It didn’t feel right to me. I even asked him about it. I said if you’d found a candidate, why didn’t you contact the staff yourself?","“He told me that I was a relative. In the future, when that staff member was discovered, Cousin Jiang Li wouldn’t really do anything to me. At most, he would just scold me. If they contacted that staff member and they were discovered, it would be very troublesome to deal with them. That’s why they looked for me.”","All Yao Yu could feel now was regret. He regretted being so easily deceived. He looked at Qiao Nian and continued, “... At that time, I didn’t think too much about it. In addition, they were generous and directly transferred five million yuan into my account. They told me that the remaining two million yuan was my hard work. I-I didn’t resist the temptation.”","Yuan Qing often talked about the relationship between the Jiang family’s eldest branch and the second branch in front of him.","He knew that Qiao Nian had the best relationship with Jiang Li.","Therefore, as soon as Qiao Nian appeared in the KTV room, he knew that she was definitely here to look for him. Moreover, she was looking for him because of Jiang Li’s hospitalization.","“Cousin.” Yao Yu was quite afraid of his cousin, whom he had never met before. He felt that Qiao Nian was different from Jiang Xianrou.","Jiang Xianrou liked to do things in secret.","Qiao Nian was the kind of person who... it was fine if he didn’t provoke her, but if he did, she wouldn’t even bother playing dirty with him.","His grandmother was definitely not important enough to Qiao Nian. Yao Yu was quite afraid of trouble.","This time, he was so frightened that he looked like he was about to cry. “I really didn’t know that they bribed that staff member to cut the safety wire. It wasn’t until I saw the trending topic on Weibo that I realized something was wrong and called my father... I only found out half an hour ago that Cousin Jiang Li was hospitalized.”","Yuan Qing relied on her status as a relative to live with the Jiang family. Jiang Li’s hospitalization was such a big matter, so she would at most go over herself.","If he died, she would bring her son along.","As for her grandson’s generation, they were even further away from the Jiang family.","She really wanted to bring Yao Yu to show his face in front of Jiang Zongnan and Old Master Jiang. Unfortunately, Jiang Li’s hospitalization was not a happy occasion, so she couldn’t bring her family to the hospital at this time.","Yao Yu explained his side of the situation. He took out his phone and wanted to transfer the money to Qiao Nian. “... I only spent a fraction of the two million yuan. I haven’t touched the remaining 1.95 million. I’ll return the money to you.”","The girl had been listening to him with her eyes half-closed. Her aura was restrained. Her fair fingers were on the armrest, and she seemed to be casually tapping it.","She raised her eyelids and looked over when Yao Yu finished speaking. “You still have that person’s contact information?”"]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 I Saw This Person in Country M","paragraphs":["1542 I Saw This Person in Country M","Yao Yu immediately looked up and shook his head in confusion. “No, I don’t.”","He immediately explained, “I heard from my dad that after Cousin Jiang Li got into trouble, he immediately checked his WeChat. That person has already blocked me.”","“Oh.” Qiao Nian wasn’t surprised.","If the other party could think of finding a scapegoat from the Jiang family, how could he not block Yao Yu on WeChat?","!!","“Since he wanted to talk to you, have you seen him in person?” Qiao Nian wasn’t in a hurry. She glanced at the boy in front of her and asked unhurriedly, “Are you an art student?”","“How did you know?” Yao Yu asked instinctively. He touched his earlobe and did not dare to say another word. “I saw him once. In the cafe outside this KTV.”","Qiao Nian didn’t explain to him how she knew.","On the way here, she had already obtained all the information about Yao Yu since he was young, including his admission to the Beijing Academy of Fine Arts through Jiang Zongnan.","Yuan Qing spoiled him rotten.","He was vain and greedy.","In private, he often took advantage of his family’s relationship to sell the wool around Jiang Li. He even liked to show off that he was Jiang Li’s cousin in school to attract the girls’ attention.","His friends were all sorts of people.","However, Yao Yu had one advantage—art.","He had a great love for art.","The information Qiao Nian had obtained was very clear. Yao Yu was best at drawing portraits.","He liked realistic sketches.","This kind of sketching was at the bottom of the art world. Many people did not approve of this talent.","No matter how good he was at sketching, the art world appreciated concepts more, like the style of the abstract master Bishop.","Yao Yu probably didn’t go to school often because of this.","He was seen as a slacker.","“I’ll get someone to bring you a pencil. Draw the appearance of the person you came into contact with.” Qiao Nian called the waiter and asked him to bring some drawing tools.","An hour later.","Yao Yu drew a person. He scratched his head and made sure that he had drawn all the details of the person he remembered. Then, he put down his pen resentfully and handed the portrait to Qiao Nian. “Cousin, I’m done.”","Qiao Nian didn’t look at it immediately. Instead, she propped up her legs and looked at him arrogantly. Then, she got up. Before she left, she suppressed the ruthlessness in her voice and said concisely, “Report to the police station yourself and tell them what you just told me. As for how the police will deal with you and how they should detain you, it’s up to Jiang Li to forgive you. I won’t interfere.”","At most, Yao Yu was an accomplice who had been deceived. The plot was not serious. As for whether to detain him or educate him, it depended on the attitude of the “person involved”.","Yao Yu revealed an expression that was uglier than crying. However, he was much more discerning than his grandmother. He glanced in the direction the girl had left. At the very least, he knew that Qiao Nian had let him off this time.","He shouted gratefully after the girl, “Don’t worry, cousin. I’ll turn myself in.”","Qiao Nian left without looking back.","Her footsteps never faltered.","After leaving the private room and getting into the car, she took out Yao Yu’s sketch and looked at it. Then, she handed it to the man and said in a slightly hoarse voice, “I saw this person in Country M.”"]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 This Time, We Must Let the Qi Family Die Clearly","paragraphs":["1543 This Time, We Must Let the Qi Family Die Clearly","Ye Wangchuan took the sketch and looked at it. On the white paper, a middle-aged man’s image was outlined with a 2B pencil.","The middle-aged man had an ordinary appearance. He had a long, thin face and high cheekbones. He did not look like someone to be trifled with. His triangular eyes emitted a fierce light.","Yao Yu’s character sketch had its own characteristics.","In just a few strokes, he had not only drawn the appearance and characteristics of the middle-aged man, but also deliberately outlined the man’s shoulders and back.","The man was dressed in a well-ironed suit. He looked quite like a high-rise.","However, Yao Yu drew out the details. The middle-aged man tried his best to hide it, but he couldn’t hide some of his habits.","Like bending his back!","This habit of nodding and bowing would make him subconsciously show humility when interacting with others.","And this humble inertial reaction clearly did not fit an entertainment company executive.","... This man was not an entertainment executive.","Ye Wangchuan saw through the disguise immediately. He rolled down the window and propped his arm on the side. He sat quite casually and spoke to the girl. “Who is it?”","“The Qi family’s chauffeur.”","Qiao Nian reached for her seatbelt and fastened it herself. As she did so, she told him briefly about what had happened outside the hotel in Country M.","When the Qi family’s chauffeur stopped her, she had a deep impression of his domineering attitude, so she remembered this person.","“You were stopped by someone in Country M?” Ye Wangchuan’s tone was a little dangerous. He lowered his voice, making it a little sinister.","Qiao Nian glanced at him and calmly rolled up the window. She turned on the air conditioner and said calmly, “The other party didn’t succeed. Your men appeared in time to help me settle it.”","She had yet to ask someone about the Bright Gate.","However, Qiao Nian had no intention of asking. After all, she had some things to tell him.","Everyone had their own secrets. She didn’t feel that Ye Wangchuan had the obligation to explain his matters to her.","“The other party probably didn’t expect Yao Yu to be able to draw him from memory after meeting him just once.” Yao Yu’s grades in school were too poor, and he often fought and skipped classes. He was like a young rascal. It was not surprising that the Qi family did not expect him to have this ability.","Qiao Nian hadn’t expected him to be able to sketch a character so vividly. He could have gone to the Criminal Investigation Department and studied criminal sketching.","At least in this aspect, Yao Yu was a genius.","“It seems that this matter has something to do with the Qi family.” A name had already appeared in Ye Wangchuan’s mind—Qi Yan.","“Yes.” Qiao Nian’s eyes were cold, but she wasn’t in a hurry. “Let’s investigate first.”","She and Ye Wangchuan were thinking of the same person—Qi Yan.","“I’ll definitely make her pay if she really did that to Jiang Li!” Qiao Nian’s eyes were cold, but her voice was unrestrained.","It was really fierce!","The Qi family had some influence overseas, especially the Qi family’s soul, Qi Yan. Because she had married into the royal family of Continent O, she was also closely related to the illegal district and the independent continent.","However, Qiao Nian didn’t take them seriously.","This time, she wanted the Qi family and Qi Yan to die clearly!","...","5 PM.","Jiang Zongnan had just returned home from the company when he received a call from Yuan Qing.","“Director Jiang.” The servant at home helped him put his bag aside.","Jiang Zongnan loosened his tie and the buttons on his collar. As he held his phone, he walked to the side in frustration and picked it up. “Hello, Aunt. What’s the matter?”"]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 Old Lady Yuan Complained in Annoyance","paragraphs":["1544 Old Lady Yuan Complained in Annoyance","He was sometimes quite impatient with these relatives.","The other relatives were fine. At least they had some insight. They only called him when something happened.","Yuan Qing was different. All these years, she had relied on her seniority to trouble him.","No one liked a distant relative who liked to put on airs in front of them, let alone a cousin.","Jiang Li was still in the hospital.","And there was too much to do at the office.","Jiang Zongnan was about to be annoyed to death, so his tone was not good. “You said that Nian Nian ran to the KTV to scare Yao Yu? How is that possible?”","He frowned and continued, “Nian Nian isn’t that kind of person. She hasn’t even seen Yao Yu before. Why would she especially run to scare him... It’s not that I don’t believe you. This matter is too ridiculous. I can’t find a reason for her to do this. There has to be a reason for everything. She’s not crazy. How is that possible!”","Jiang Yao happened to enter at this moment. He went to Qing University and asked about Mr. Huang’s residence through Liang Conglin.","Jiang Yao waited at Mr. Huang’s place for a few hours. Unfortunately, Mr. Huang did not return. He could only go home.","As he entered, he saw Jiang Zongnan on the phone with an ugly expression. He walked over and asked, “Dad, who are you talking to?”","Jiang Zongnan took his phone away and tried his best to control his tone so that he wouldn’t sound too frustrated. “Your aunt called and said that Qiao Nian went to the KTV at noon to threaten your cousin. I’m talking to her now.”","After he took the time to tell Jiang Yao, he frowned and walked to the sofa. He said to the nagging old lady on the other end of the phone, “In short, I don’t believe Nian Nian will do this. She has no reason to bully Yao Yu.”","“Why doesn’t she have a reason?! She’s such a person, to begin with. She doesn’t have any manners at all. Who knows how Yao Yu provoked her? She wants to bring people to block the door and look for Yao Yu. I’m already so old, don’t tell me I have the mood to slander a junior?”","Yuan Qing was furious. Her grandson was her life. She wanted nothing more than to fight Qiao Nian to the death.","Therefore, she didn’t give Jiang Zongnan a chance to speak. She gritted her teeth and continued, “Yao Yu’s friend called me and said that. How can I spout nonsense? I don’t know what she said to him. Now, Yao Yu has run to the police station and said that he wants to turn himself in. His father and I called him a few times, but we couldn’t get him back. I’m preparing to go to the police station to find him.","“It’s fine if she’s usually disrespectful to me, but she’s bullying me this time. She’s an uneducated person from Rao City. Doesn’t Zongjin know how to educate his children?! She’s so arrogant at such a young age. She’ll cause serious trouble sooner or later!”","Jiang Zongnan’s expression instantly darkened, but he still did not speak. However, from his expression, it could be seen that Yuan Qing’s words were too unpleasant and he was a little unhappy.","Yuan Qing had a loud voice. When she was young, her personality was shrewish and unreasonable. She liked to throw a tantrum about everything.","Even more so in old age.","She had aged, but her voice had not softened at all. Even though Jiang Zongnan had not turned up the volume, Jiang Yao could hear what she was saying clearly.","“Dad, give me the phone,” Jiang Yao said with a dark expression.","Jiang Zongnan was about to be annoyed to death by her. He handed over the phone with a dark expression."]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 Face Slapping, Speechless","paragraphs":["1545 Face Slapping, Speechless","Jiang Yao took it and didn’t waste any time. He said bluntly, “Aunt, you can call my uncle if you’re unhappy with Qiao Nian.”","There was some silence.","Yuan Qing was rendered speechless.","She had tried to call Jiang Zongjin before she called Jiang Zongnan. Unfortunately, Jiang Zongjin refused to answer her call.","Yao Yu was squatting at the police station. She had no choice but to call Jiang Zongnan.","Jiang Yao knew his uncle’s temper very well. Everything else was fine, but he was rather domineering when it came to Qiao Nian.","He sneered, his eyes filled with disdain. Then, he slowly said to the person on the other end of the line, “You can call Qiao Nian directly if you can’t reach him.","“Didn’t you say that you don’t know how Qiao Nian bullied Yao Yu? You can ask her about it.”","“...” Yuan Qing couldn’t even afford to offend Jiang Zongjin, let alone Qiao Nian.","That fiend. Even if she had ten guts, she wouldn’t dare to call her. Moreover, she reckoned that the other party wouldn’t answer if she called.","Yuan Qing was put on the spot by his words. “I’m just worried about your cousin.”","Before she could finish, Jiang Yao interrupted her rudely. “If you’re really worried about him, ask him what he did when you got to the police station. Why did he have to turn himself in? This is much more useful than you calling my father now!”","After saying that, not wanting to waste time with her anymore, he said happily, “Aunt, that’s all. I still have something to tell my father. I’ll hang up first.”","Then, he hung up without giving Yuan Qing a chance to speak.","Jiang Yao returned the phone to Jiang Zongnan and said expressionlessly, “Dad, you should answer fewer calls from your aunt in the future. I think she’s getting more and more confused recently. She almost can’t figure out her surname.”","“Yes.” For the first time, Jiang Zongnan did not refute his eldest son’s words. He took the phone from him and nodded silently.","Yuan Qing’s surname was Yuan. At the end of the day, she was just a relative of Old Master Jiang.","He could tell the difference between a close relative and a distant relative.","It was not up to an outsider to accuse the family of being ill-bred even if they had split up.","Yuan Qing kept calling Qiao Nian uneducated.","What was the difference between that and saying that the Jiang family had no upbringing?","Jiang Yao frowned and walked to the sofa to sit down. He pursed his lips and thought for a moment before asking, “Dad, is Yao Yu related to Jiang Li’s injury?”","Jiang Zongnan subconsciously revealed a surprised expression. “Why would Yao Yu get involved in this matter?”","“Qiao Nian has always had the best relationship with Jiang Li. It’s impossible for her to cause trouble for Yao Yu for no reason...”","Jiang Yao couldn’t figure it out himself. Halfway through his sentence, he frowned again. “Forget it, it’s useless to talk about this now. I’ve already asked my friend to investigate. We’ll know what happened when we find out how Jiang Li fell.”","Jiang Yao got up again, picked up his things, and said before Jiang Zongnan could speak, “Dad, I’ll go upstairs first.”","“Go on.”","Jiang Zongnan waved his hand tiredly.","Jiang Yao went upstairs to his room without saying a word.","On the second floor.","Entering his room, he dug his phone out of his shirt and looked down.","He sent a message to Jiang Xianrou in the morning telling her about Jiang Li’s situation and asking if she could come back early.","She finally replied after a few hours."]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 Jiang Xianrou Is Back","paragraphs":["1546 Jiang Xianrou Is Back","Jiang Yao looked at his phone hopefully.","However, after reading it quickly, it was like a bucket of cold water had been poured over his head. His heart turned cold, and his eyes were filled with disappointment.","Jiang Xianrou told him that she still had to participate in an important assessment for a new member before she could determine which master she would be assigned to.","In addition, the independent continent had an annual exchange.","If she performed well, she would have a chance to go to the independent continent with Robert to meet the faction behind the Pharmacy Association, which was the diamond big shot of the illegal district.","Jiang Yao continued reading.","Jiang Xianrou sent him seven or eight messages. Every one of them was about the Pharmacy Association and the opportunity to go to the Independent Continent in the future. He read all of them, but not a single one mentioned Jiang Li, who was still hospitalized.","This cold attitude was a stark contrast to Qiao Nian’s.","Jiang Yao suddenly realized why Jiang Li didn’t dote on his biological sister at home. He doted on his cousin, who had only been back for more than a year. He even fell out with his family for Qiao Nian.","If it were him...","He imagined what Jiang Li would think if he was still lying in the hospital. Jiang Yao fell silent.","...","Qiao Nian was determined to investigate it. Even though the Qi family had cleaned up their own mess, she still found out everything.","Five days later.","The Red Alliance sent her a detailed transfer record. With Yao Yu as the source, they basically found everyone.","Among them was the Qi family’s driver’s bank account.","He had used his relative’s identity card to open an account to transfer the five million yuan to Yao Yu.","In addition, there were also several million yuan in the account books of the Hengfeng Corporation. These checks almost turned the bank system upside down.","Most importantly, Qiao Niao was awesome because of the data screening she had done through the World Bank’s internal system. The security network that Hengfeng Corporation had spent a lot of money to buy didn’t even realize that their system had been attacked by a trojan horse and that their database had been stolen.","She had all the information.","Qiao Nian stayed in her room for five days.","Just as she had guessed, all the evidence she had found pointed to one person, Qi Yan.","...","The next day she went downstairs with the stack of information.","Downstairs, Qin Si, Zhang Yang, and the others were all there. Gu San was making coffee for them.","Qin Si was also talking about going to the hospital to see Jiang Li later.","At this moment, he saw Qiao Nian coming down from the corner of his eye. He immediately greeted her with a cheeky smile. “Sister Qiao, you’re finally out of seclusion? I haven’t seen you since I came here. I thought I wouldn’t be able to see you again today.”","“Ah.” Qiao Nian glanced at him lazily. It could be seen that she was still a little sleepy from her half-closed eyes as she walked over.","Zhang Yang’s attitude towards Qiao Nian was much more polite than Qin Si’s. He sat up straight and greeted her respectfully, “Miss Qiao, good morning.”","Qin Si’s phone rang at this moment. He walked to the side to answer it.","Qiao Nian walked over and found a seat in a corner of the sofa.","Gu San brought her a cup of tea and placed it on the table in front of her. He said softly to the girl, “Miss Qiao, your black tea.”","“Thank you.” After sitting down, Qiao Nian slowly thanked him.","Gu San immediately waved his hand.","At this moment, Qin Si came back angrily and said to everyone, “Jiang Xianrou came back from the Pharmacy Association and called to ask me if I wanted to eat with her. She even said that Qi Yan was coming, too. So what if Qi Yan is coming? Do I have to go?”"]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 Sister Nian: Go, Why Not?","paragraphs":["1547 Sister Nian: Go, Why Not?","Qiao Nian had just taken a sip of tea. She put down the cup now. Undisguised sharpness could be seen in her exquisite eyes, and even the corners of her lips curled up.","Qi Yan was here too?","She leaned back and smiled, then said in a rather flamboyant tone, “Tsk. Are they planning to send themselves to their deaths?”","Everyone in the room turned to look at her as soon as she said that.","Qin Si reacted the fastest. He scratched his head and asked with a puzzled expression, “Sister Qiao, what are you talking about? What do you mean by sending people to their deaths? Are you talking about Qi Yan and Jiang Xianrou?","“Forget about Jiang Xianrou. She...”","Qin Si couldn’t be bothered to mention Jiang Xianrou’s past antics. He was more confused as to why Qiao Nian would specifically mention Qi Yan.","He wasn’t stupid. He wasn’t as smart as Ye Wangchuan, but he was smarter than the average person.","He thought for a moment about what Qiao Nian had been doing these past few days and immediately reacted. “Jiang Li’s injury is related to Qi Yan?”","Qiao Nian didn’t answer him.","Qin Si had already guessed most of it and couldn’t help but sigh. “The Qi family must be tired of living!”","He found it unbelievable. “How much hatred does she have for Jiang Li to be so ruthless and want his life?”","Jiang Li was lucky to survive this time.","He might not have survived if there were other things on the ground.","Qin Si couldn’t understand why Qi Yan would do this.","Everything had a reason. Why was Qi Yan acting like a mad dog?","“She didn’t leave for the river.” Qiao Nian spoke slowly and unhurriedly, but she didn’t explain too much to him. She looked up at the handsome man and asked, “Did Jiang Xianrou say where they are going? What time does it start?”","“Where else would it be? There are only a few places to eat in the upper circles of Beijing. She wouldn’t have had access to anything more sophisticated.”","Qin Si didn’t beat around the bush and replied bluntly, “She told me that she’s holding a banquet at the Imperial Mansion at noon. She booked a banquet hall on the first floor. It seems like she’s going to invite a lot of people.”","Qin Si’s eyebrows raised frivolously, and he didn’t give Jiang Xianrou any face. “Tsk, she just entered the Pharmacy Association, is she that capable? She just held a filiation banquet with great fanfare. How long has it been? And now she still wants to hold a banquet after coming back. Is she afraid that no one knows that she has returned from Continent O?”","Jiang Xianrou was the one who invited them to the banquet this time, but everyone knew her motive. She wanted to tell the people in Beijing’s circle that she had successfully entered the Pharmacy Association and officially became a member.","Those people in Beijing usually liked to flatter the strong and trample on the weak.","Jiang Xianrou was going to be in the limelight again!","Jiang Xianrou had always liked to be in the limelight. She was probably feeling proud right now.","“Sister Qiao, are you going?” Qin Si was quick-witted. When Qiao Nian asked him about the time and place of the banquet, he knew that she might be interested.","Qiao Nian propped up her legs and rested her arms on the armrest of the sofa. Her legs were well-proportioned and straight under her jeans, and her sitting posture was valiant.","She turned her head, her lashes fluttering. She couldn’t keep the sharpness out of her eyes.","“Yes, why not? Someone happens to deliver a pillow when I’m dozing off. Do I have any reason to refuse such a good thing?”","She had originally planned to look for Qi Yan.","Tsk, Qi Yan even came knocking on her door.","What reason did she have not to welcome Jiang Xianrou?","Of course, she had to give them a proper celebration.","...","Imperial Mansion.","Jiang Xianrou’s flight arrived at ten o’clock, and she arrived at Hall No. 1 of the Imperial Mansion at 10:30 AM to receive the guests with Tang Wanru."]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 What Should Come Should Come","paragraphs":["1548 What Should Come Should Come","She made a big show of it this time.","The guests began to arrive at eleven o’clock.","Ruan Sisi and some of her close friends had arrived early.","Tang Ning did not come.","However, Jiang Xianrou looked down on a small fry like Tang Ning now. In her eyes, she only looked up to those in the top circles in Beijing. The other circles had become insignificant in her eyes.","She might not even care about Ruan Sisi now, let alone Tang Ning. The Tang family was even more worthless to her.","Jiang Xianrou led the group in and arranged a seat at the back for them. After exchanging a few pleasantries with them, she went out to greet the other guests.","The Pharmacy Association’s reputation was obvious.","Many of the top families in Beijing more or less gave Jiang Xianrou face on the Pharmacy Association’s account.","No one from the Wei family came to Jiang Xianrou’s filiation banquet, but this time, Wei Ying specially came to welcome her.","Apart from her, Wei Ling and Shen Jingyan also came.","Ever since Old Master Wei passed away, the Wei family’s momentum had gradually weakened. However, Wei Mingxuan was quite capable. After this period of hard work, the Wei family gradually calmed down from the storm caused by Old Master Wei’s sudden death.","Wei Ying was pushed out of the family’s inner circle. However, Wei Mingxuan was a soft-hearted person. Wei Ying was his only biological sister, so he did not go too far.","At least he gave her some face.","Although Wei Ying’s status in the family was not as high as before, the Wei family was still one of the three most domineering families in Beijing.","A lean camel was still bigger than a horse.","She was definitely giving Jiang Xianrou enough face by taking the time to attend a junior’s welcoming banquet.","Jiang Xianrou was also sensible. She personally went with her mother to welcome Wei Ying, Wei Ling, and the others. She held her arm from afar and greeted the three of them warmly, “Grandma Wei, Aunt Wei, Uncle Shen.”","“Aiya, look at how sweet her mouth is. It’s so adorable.” Wei Ying was wearing a green modified cheongsam today. There was a matching emerald beaded necklace around her neck. At first glance, she looked elegant.","Unfortunately, there was no flesh on her face. On closer inspection, her eyes were fierce and her lips were thin. It was obvious that she was not a gentle elder.","She put on a loving expression in front of Jiang Xianrou and held her hand, then said gently, “Xianrou has grown up. I remember the last time I saw you, you had just entered Qing University. In the blink of an eye, you entered the Pharmacy Association.”","She tilted her head again and said to Tang Wanru gently, “Madam Jiang, you raised a good daughter!”","The last time Wei Ying saw Jiang Xianrou was the year the Jiang family gave Jiang Xianrou her coming-of-age ceremony.","That year, the Jiang family made a big scene for Jiang Xianrou and invited many famous people to participate.","Many people attended because of Old Master Jiang’s personal invitation.","Wei Ying was one of them.","Tang Wanru couldn’t stop smiling at her praise. She even said politely, “Old Madam, don’t praise her anymore. She still has a lot to learn.”","“If she still needs to improve despite entering the Pharmacy Association at her age, wouldn’t the others be too ashamed to live?” Wei Ying came this time on account of the Pharmacy Association.","“You’re very lucky to be able to enter the Pharmacy Association this time.” Since it was a compliment, she would definitely praise her to the end. Anyway, she wasn’t losing anything by praising her."]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 Young Master Ye and the Others Aren’t Coming?","paragraphs":["1549 Young Master Ye and the Others Aren’t Coming?","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t hide the joy in her eyes, but she pursed her lips and remained calm. She didn’t show it on her face just because Wei Ying praised her in public.","Wei Ling looked at the mother and daughter from the side. The smile on her lips disappeared, and she suddenly asked, “By the way, Young Master Ye will be coming today, right?”","Jiang Xianrou’s expression changed the moment she finished speaking.","Tang Wanru could no longer maintain her smile. “This...”","!!","“Young Master Ye and Xianrou are so close. Isn’t he coming?” Wei Ling touched a sore spot. Her smile was quite gentle, and her words pierced Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru’s sore spots like sharp thorns.","Jiang Xianrou’s face turned even paler. Her smugness was also suppressed. She said without a change in expression, “Young Master Qin and the others...”","She was about to say that Qin Si and the others were busy and didn’t have time to come over, but her phone suddenly vibrated.","Jiang Xianrou hurriedly glanced at it. It was a WeChat message.","A message from Qin Si.","She quickly clicked on it.","[Qin Si: I’ll come over later.]","At first, Jiang Xianrou suspected that she had seen it wrong. She ignored her image and took a closer look at her phone.","Qin Si had indeed sent a message saying that he was coming over.","Overjoyed, Jiang Xianrou immediately replied, telling him to inform her in advance when they reached so that she could pick them up outside.","She finished replying to the message.","Tang Wanru couldn’t help but feel awkward and was about to help her out. “Young Master Ye and the others...”","“Mom.” Jiang Xianrou immediately stopped her. She looked at Wei Ling with a smile and replied, “Aunt Wei, they’ll be arriving later. Do you want me to arrange for you to sit at the same table?”","There was some silence.","Wei Ling had only heard that Jiang Xianrou had fallen out with the people in her small circle. Coupled with the fact that she couldn’t stand the mother and daughter’s arrogant faces, she deliberately tried to disgust them.","She didn’t expect Ye Wangchuan and the others to really come.","When she thought of how her family had been tortured by the Ye family some time ago, her expression immediately became awkward. She immediately said, “I was just asking casually. It’s fine. You don’t have to go through so much trouble to arrange for us to be together.”","“Yes, alright.” Jiang Xianrou walked down the stairs.","She was just making conversation.","She wasn’t stupid to really put them together.","Wouldn’t she lose face again if Qin Si and the others left?","...","11:30 AM.","The welcoming party was half an hour away from starting.","Qi Yan had also arrived.","Tang Wanru accompanied her in.","Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao were outside to see if there were any more guests.","As the protagonist of the day, Jiang Xianrou did not go in. She was still waiting outside with her phone.","Finally, her phone rang.","Seeing the caller ID, Jiang Xianrou picked it up almost without hesitation. “Hello, Young Master Qin, you’re here?”","Qin Si had just parked the car.","Zhang Yang and Bo Jingxing were also both here.","Of course, Ye Wangchuan came too.","He walked with Qiao Nian. Both of them were wearing blue today. Blue was an extremely eye-catching color, and both of them had fair skin.","It was pleasing to look at as they stood together.","They were simply more eye-catching than the other.","Gu San walked behind them dutifully. He was already used to this.","Back then, before Master Wang could woo her, the two of them were already very compatible.","Miss Qiao was now Master Wang’s girlfriend. When a couple stood together, it wasn’t too much to praise them.","Qiao Nian rarely wore anything other than black and white. Today, she looked exceptionally refreshing. In addition, her aura was eye-catching.","They immediately attracted the attention of many passersby as they walked.","Qiao Nian didn’t think so herself. Her shoulders were relaxed and she wasn’t holding anything as she followed Qin Si and the others into the Imperial Mansion."]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 Why Are You Here?","paragraphs":["1550 Why Are You Here?","Outside the banquet hall.","Jiang Xianrou was already looking forward to their arrival.","It had been a long time since she had seen Qin Si and the others.","She hadn’t even been hopeful.","She tacitly acknowledged that Qin Si and the others would not give her face. Who knew that the tables would turn and Qin Si would suddenly send a message saying that he was coming over?","Jiang Xianrou’s beautiful eyes were bright, and the corners of her mouth curled up. She was in a very good mood.","Jiang Yao helped arrange for a few guests to enter. Seeing that she was waiting for someone outside, he walked over and asked, “Xianrou, why are you standing here? Is anyone else coming?”","“Yes, Master Wang and the others are coming.” Jiang Xianrou didn’t hide it from him. Then, she saw someone from the corner of her eye.","Her eyes lit up. She ignored Jiang Yao and immediately went over. “Qin...”","She saw the girl behind Qin Si before she could finish speaking.","...","Qiao Nian was too ostentatious.","Even if she was surrounded by a group of people, it did not affect others from being the first to discover her existence.","Jiang Xianrou’s expression changed, and her tone immediately became unfriendly. “Why are you here?”","Her words were clearly directed at Qiao Nian, but the girl did reply.","Qin Si was unhappy. He stood in front of Qiao Nian and said, “I asked Sister Qiao to come with me. Why? You don’t welcome us? Forget it, then.”","“That’s not what I meant.” Jiang Xianrou reacted fast.","She knew that because of Qiao Nian, she had had many conflicts with Qin Si and the others. If she showed any more hostility, Qin Si might not give her any face.","Despite her discomfort, she suppressed it and forced a smile. She looked in the girl’s direction and said meaningfully, “I just didn’t expect her to come. I couldn’t get through to her when my father called earlier. I thought she wasn’t in Beijing.”","She had been staying in the Pharmacy Association for the past two weeks. She didn’t even know when Qiao Nian returned from Country M.","Jiang Zongnan had mentioned inviting Qiao Nian to lunch.","Unfortunately, he and Jiang Yao called Qiao Nian, but they couldn’t get through.","...","She didn’t want Qiao Nian to come over to cause trouble for her.","After all, even if she didn’t see anyone, she wouldn’t remember that she had met Qiao Nian in Country M. She didn’t have to wonder why Qiao Nian knew the dean.","Now that she saw the flamboyant figure in the crowd, all of Jiang Xianrou’s memories surged back. She once again recalled her meeting with the girl in the Pharmacy Association.","After that, no matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t find out Qiao Nian’s relationship with the Pharmacy Association. She also couldn’t find out what identity Qiao Nian had used to appear there.","So far, she only knew that Qiao Nian had a good relationship with Zhong Yiliu.","They were friends.","As for why two people with such a big age difference knew each other and how they became friends, she had no idea.","Jiang Xianrou’s expression changed several times before she finally took a deep breath and calmed down.","She was quite good at putting on a show after she returned from the Pharmacy Association. She smiled slightly, turned her head, and said to the girl, “Qiao Nian, why didn’t you tell me that you were coming back? Mom and I were worried that it wouldn’t be safe for you to be alone outside... It’s good that you came back safely. Next time you go on a long trip, remember to tell your family. Uncle doesn’t know that you went to Country M, right?”"]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 Sister Qiao, We Won’t Go In","paragraphs":["1551 Sister Qiao, We Won’t Go In","“Tsk.” Qiao Nian clicked her tongue impatiently as she looked at Jiang Xianrou in frustration. “Jiang Xianrou, aren’t you tired of pretending all day? I’m tired for you even if you aren’t.”","Jiang Xianrou’s face instantly collapsed. If not for the fact that she was pinching her fingernails tightly, she would have broken down on the spot and could not continue pretending.","Even if she barely managed to keep her composure, she was still angered by Qiao Nian’s words. At the very least, she no longer had the courage to continue disgusting others.","Jiang Yao walked over and called out the girl’s name. “Qiao Nian, why didn’t you tell me you were coming?”","!!","He actually didn’t mean anything else, but his words sounded like ostracization.","They automatically excluded Qiao Nian from the Jiang family.","Qin Si frowned.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened and turned cold.","Qiao Nian’s expression was indifferent, as if she didn’t feel anything else. “I’m here to look for someone.”","Jiang Yao frowned. Then, he relaxed his brows and asked her as gently as possible, “Who are you looking for?”","...","“Qi Yan.” Qiao Nian was concise and didn’t hide anything from him.","The moment Qi Yan’s name was mentioned, Jiang Xianrou had the biggest reaction. She immediately looked over vigilantly. She opened her mouth and was about to refuse.","After a short silence, Jiang Yao said to the girl before she could speak, “I’ll bring you in.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and pressed down on her cap.","She wanted to say refuse since she would definitely settle scores with Qi Yan today. It didn’t matter if Jiang Yao brought her in or not. It wouldn’t affect her decision.","“I know which table she’s sitting at. I’ll take you there so you don’t have to find her yourself.”","Jiang Yao added, “There are quite a lot of people inside. You’ll only waste your time searching them one by one.”","Qiao Nian swallowed her words and glanced at him with her bright eyes. Her long eyelashes hid her emotions. She pursed her lips and didn’t say anything else.","Seeing that she agreed, Jiang Yao heaved a sigh of relief and his brows relaxed. Without further ado, he turned and led the way.","Qiao Nian stuffed a hand into her pocket and pushed her cap down, silently following behind him.","Seeing that she was about to go in, Qin Si glanced at Jiang Xianrou, whose face was turning pale. At this moment, he said lazily, “Sister Qiao, go in. We’ll wait for you outside.”","...","Jiang Xianrou’s mind was buzzing non-stop. She didn’t understand why Jiang Yao’s attitude towards Qiao Nian had suddenly changed so much.","Before she could figure it out, she heard that Qin Si and the others were not going in. Her expression changed.","“Young Master Qin, aren’t you going in?”","Qin Si had no intention of going in. He glanced at her casually and said, “We’re just here to accompany Sister Qiao, not to eat. Why would we go in?”","Zhang Yang looked down and immediately added, “Then, I won’t go in either.”","Gu San didn’t say anything. He just stood there motionless like a wooden stake, making it obvious that he was not going in.","Jiang Xianrou looked around and placed all her hopes on the remaining two people.","After the previous incident, Bo Jingxing had long known about Qiao Nian’s relationship with Ye Wangchuan. As a smart person, he had already made up his mind.","He avoided Jiang Xianrou’s pleading gaze and looked at the man standing beside him. He said gently, “Wangchuan, accompany Sister Qiao in. We and the others will wait for you here.”","... Bo Jingxing wasn’t going in, either!","Nodding, Ye Wangchuan walked past her and followed Qiao Nian in.","...","Jiang Xianrou’s blood surged as if she had been slapped, and her ears buzzed.","She had even promised the Wei family that Qin Si and the others would come.","In the end... they were indeed here, but not to attend her welcoming banquet.","They refused to enter.","What could be more humiliating, more clearly delineated?","Jiang Xianrou’s chest heaved up and down. Her nails dug deep into her flesh, and her vision darkened. At this moment, she wished that Qin Si and the others wouldn’t have come. It was better than them coming with Qiao Nian."]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 Jiang Yao: Jiang Li’s Accident Is Related to Qi Yan?","paragraphs":["1552 Jiang Yao: Jiang Li’s Accident Is Related to Qi Yan?","Inside ballroom number one.","Jiang Xianrou had made a big scene this time.","Many celebrities in Beijing came to congratulate her.","Qi Yan was one of the important guests today and was arranged to sit at the main table by Tang Wanru.","!!","Sitting at the same table as Qi Yan were Wei Ling, Shen Jingyan, and the others. Some people from the periphery of the top circles in Beijing also came.","After the Qi family made a comeback, their influence overseas became even greater than before. Qi Yan even vaguely showed that she wanted to turn the family’s power to the country.","The Qi family naturally became a relatively popular force recently.","As the family’s soul, Qi Yan was equally eye-catching.","The Qi family had been so high-profile recently. Of course, some people wanted to befriend Qi Yan.","Shen Jingyan and Wei Ling came this time because Jiang Xianrou had entered the Pharmacy Association, and also because of Qi Yan.","Shen Jingyan took the initiative to chat with her. Wei Ling also played the role of a good wife, along with the others at the table.","In the blink of an eye, everyone at the table started chatting enthusiastically.","...","“Right there.”","Not far away, Jiang Yao pointed in the direction of the main table and gave Qiao Nian directions.","Qiao Nian looked at the woman sitting in the center of the room. Her lips curled up into a smile, but it didn’t reach her eyes. It was quite cold.","Jiang Li was still lying in the hospital, but Qi Yan was doing well. She was flushed with success and was even wearing a bright-colored dress today, as if she was afraid that no one could tell that she was in high spirits.","Qiao Nian restrained the sharpness in her eyes and said to Jiang Yao in a hoarse voice, “I’ll go over myself. You don’t have to accompany me.”","“?”","Jiang Yao frowned, vaguely sensing something. He asked, “Qiao Nian, why are you looking for Qi Yan?”","The girl turned to look at him.","Jiang Yao was a little uncomfortable and didn’t know where to put his hand. He took a deep breath and continued, “A few days ago, my aunt called and said that you sent Yao Yu to the police station... Is this related to Jiang Li?”","“You think it has something to do with Jiang Li?” Qiao Nian’s voice was slightly hoarse and mocking. She neither admitted nor denied it.","Jiang Yao was very embarrassed and could only avoid her gaze. He turned his head away and said, “I’m just guessing that you’re not the kind of person who makes trouble out of nothing. You and Yao Yu have never even met before. There’s no need for you to deliberately target him as the old lady said.”","Yuan Qing told Jiang Yao that she was deliberately targeting Yao Yu?","Qiao Nian hummed and said casually, “Whatever she says.”","“Qi Yan is also related to Jiang Li’s fall?” Jiang Yao looked at her with a burning gaze.","Qiao Nian didn’t answer him immediately. She only looked in the direction of the main table. Qi Yan was still chatting and laughing. She asked calmly, “What would you do if so?”","There was some silence.","Jiang Yao was confused by her question.","Qi Yan was Jiang Xianrou’s godmother. His mother even hoped to use Qi Yan’s connections for Jiang Xianrou to gain a foothold in the Pharmacy Association and even enter a higher circle.","Like the illegal district.","Or... the independent continent.","However, would he pretend not to know about it for Jiang Xianrou’s future if Qi Yan was related to Jiang Li’s fall?","Jiang Yao didn’t know what choice he would make when the time came.","After all, the two of them were related by blood. It didn’t seem right for him to be stuck in the middle."]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 Sister Nian: You Don’t Have to Go Over, I’ll Go Over Alone","paragraphs":["1553 Sister Nian: You Don’t Have to Go Over, I’ll Go Over Alone","“Tsk.” Qiao Nian smiled again. She already knew Jiang Yao’s answer. She said, “Don’t follow me. I’ll go alone.”","She had never cared for Jiang Yao and the others’ support.","She only did what she thought was right!","...","“Madam, you really know how to joke.” Shen Jingyan was chatting with Qi Yan for a while now. “I heard that Hengfeng Corporation plans to set up a branch in the country. You...”","Before he could finish his sentence, he saw a girl walking over. He was stunned for a moment before shouting, “Nian Nian?! You...”","His reaction was the same as Jiang Xianrou’s. He seemed to want to ask why Qiao Nian was here.","Beside him, Wei Ling’s expression changed at the same time when she saw who it was. Her lips were tightly shut, and she didn’t even want to say anything. She tilted her head to the side.","She didn’t dare to provoke Qiao Nian, but she couldn’t pretend that nothing had happened like Shen Jingyan either.","Unfortunately, she felt that her husband taking the initiative to greet Qiao Nian was already giving her a way out. The girl wearing the cap and clean clothes didn’t even look at them.","She didn’t even care about the people at the main table. Her aura was strong as she walked straight over and dragged a chair to the side to sit in front of Qi Yan.","Qiao Nian’s eyebrows were cold, and her dark and bright eyes were filled with coldness. She was surrounded by a low aura as she threw the things she had brought onto the table.","“Take a look?”","Silence filled the room!","They were all stunned by her arrogance.","What-what was this situation?","Shen Jingyan gasped in shock. Frowning, he stared at Qiao Nian. “Nian Nian, what are you doing? Do you know who she is? You...”","“Who is she?” Qiao Nian’s lips curled up, her meaning unclear. Her entire body exuded an undisguised sharpness.","With the reaction of a big shot, she looked at Qi Yan and wiped her eyes. Qiao Nian smiled and raised her exquisite chin slightly. “Oh, who are you?”","Qi Yan could still maintain her dignified aura at first, but she almost collapsed at her question. Unable to catch her breath, the corners of her eyes drooped, and she said with a fake smile, “Miss Qiao, you’re so young, it’s normal for you to be impetuous. I’m just a nobody, so there’s no need for me to introduce myself to you.”","“Yeah.”","She was just being polite. Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian responded casually.","“Hehe...” Qi Yan’s breathing was heavy and she couldn’t laugh anymore. Her eyes were sharp as she stared straight at the girl’s face.","Qiao Nian wasn’t afraid of her. In fact, she wasn’t even suppressed by her aura. She looked at her coldly and asked, “Are you sure you don’t want to take a look at what I gave you?”","On the other hand, Qi Yan felt a little suppressed by Qiao Nian’s aura. Her breathing became heavy for a moment. A moment later, she picked up the things Qiao Nian had thrown at her and started reading them page by page.","What Qiao Nian showed her was the evidence they had found over the past few days.","Page by page, the Qi family was hammered to death.","Qi Yan flipped the pages faster and faster, and her expression became more and more solemn.","Soon, she finished looking at everything. She looked up at the girl in front of her. Meeting the girl’s sharp gaze, Qi Yan felt that her aura had shortened by an inch. The first thing she said was, “Where did you get these things?”","Then came the second sentence. “I didn’t know.”","Qiao Nian had long known that she would say this, so she didn’t expose her. She nodded, looking very easygoing. “If I didn’t understand wrongly, you mean that Qi Lanyin did it alone.”","All her accounts went all the way to Qi Lanyin’s account.","Qi Yan insisted that Qi Lanyin did it.","After all, based on the evidence, Qi Lanyin could take the blame for this matter alone.","Qi Yan’s expression changed again. She looked at Qiao Nian, and her voice sank as she tried to hide her panic. “Qiao Nian, what are you trying to do!”"]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 Your Banquet Has Been Canceled. A Slap in the Face!","paragraphs":["1554 Your Banquet Has Been Canceled. A Slap in the Face!","She had to think. After all, something like this had happened before.","Previously, in Country M, she had only wanted to treat Qiao Nian to a cup of tea. Later, Qi Rongguang almost got into a car accident and was stopped in public as a warning to her.","She was beginning to regret her recklessness.","It was mainly because Qi Yan hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to trace the matter back to her. In fact, it only took her a week to find out everything.","After Qi Rongguang was stopped and warned, she thought for a long time before thinking about attacking Jiang Li.","She had always felt that the Qi family had suffered so much in the illegal zone because her brother was too weak.","Would Qiao Nian still dare to act if she knew that if she touched them, the people around her would suffer as well?","That was what she thought. That was why she had set Jiang Li up.","It was also a warning to Qiao Nian.","She was used to being strong in the Qi family and Country M. This was not the first time she had used such a dirty trick, but this was definitely the worst case of her failing.","She didn’t even know what Qiao Nian was up to.","It was precisely because she couldn’t figure out what her opponent wanted to do that the feeling of panic and powerlessness kept lingering in her heart.","“Lanyin is my niece. If you touch her—”","She had yet to finish speaking when she was interrupted.","“You don’t have to warn me.","“... I believe in an eye for an eye.” Qiao Nian’s eyes turned bloodshot. “Since you admit that Qi Lanyin did it, fine. I won’t look for you. I’ll look for her.”","She stood up and pulled out a chair, not giving Qi Yan a chance to speak again.","However, before she left, she still turned around and said arrogantly, “Qi Yan, I gave you a chance.”","Qi Yan’s heart turned cold. She stood up, feeling that she had missed something.","... Qiao Nian. Qiao Nian wanted to touch Qi Lanyin!","Qi Yan opened her mouth and blushed.","Qiao Nian didn’t give her another chance. Her back was cool and valiant as she walked away without looking back.","...","Jiang Xianrou had also told Tang Wanru about Qiao Nian’s sudden visit.","Tang Wanru went to look for Jiang Zongnan.","However, the girl had already left by the time the family rushed over.","When Jiang Zongnan and the others came over, they only saw Qi Yan standing there in a daze. Her face was pale and ugly.","No one at the main table spoke. They were all stunned, as if they had not recovered from what had just happened.","“What did Qiao Nian do this time!” Tang Wanru’s face turned green with anger when she saw the situation. Her tone was very rude.","Jiang Xianrou’s face also turned cold. She didn’t make it so obvious in front of Jiang Zongnan, but it was obvious that she was very unhappy.","“Can’t she bear to see Xianrou succeeding?” Tang Wanru lowered her voice again and gritted her teeth. “It’s fine if she doesn’t come, but she ruined the atmosphere when she did. What does she want? Can’t she bear to see Xianrou doing well?”","“That’s true. She only has the old man and Uncle in her heart. She barely has Jiang Li. When has she ever taken us elders seriously?”","Tang Wanru’s words were sarcastic and harsh.","“I really should get Uncle and Old Master to come over and take a look. These are the people they protect every day.” Jiang Zongnan had also expected this to happen, so he couldn’t say anything for a moment.","He walked over and asked Qi Yan, “In-law, what happened?”","There was some silence.","Qi Yan’s mind was filled with the girl’s words. She was in no mood to pay attention to him, so she remained silent.","Seeing her reaction, Jiang Xianrou frowned again. Her hatred for Qiao Nian deepened.","At this moment, the manager of the Imperial Mansion walked towards them. He sped up when he saw Jiang Xianrou and the others.","After a while, the manager of the Imperial Mansion walked up to them and said politely, “CEO Jiang, Mrs. Jiang, and Miss Jiang, the banquet you booked at the Imperial Mansion at noon has been canceled...”"]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 What’s the Difference Between Sending a Beggar Away?","paragraphs":["1555 What’s the Difference Between Sending a Beggar Away?","The manager’s smile was kind. As if he was very easy to talk to, he said respectfully to them, “CEO Jiang, Mrs. Jiang, see who’s free to come with me. I’ll return the deposit to you.”","The Jiang family couldn’t react for a moment.","Jiang Zongnan even suspected that he had heard wrong. He looked at him in shock. “What are you talking about? What cancellation? It’s already noon, and the banquet is about to begin. We have so many guests, and you’re suddenly telling me to cancel? How can we cancel?”","Tang Wanru was the same. She looked impatient and could barely maintain her dignified and elegant expression. “That’s right, Manager. We booked in advance. How can your Imperial Mansion cancel it just like that? All our guests are here, and you’re telling us to cancel it now... How can we arrange so many guests?”","!!","Jiang Xianrou did not say anything, but her face was pale. She thought of something and bit her pink lips. She was in a state of shock and had yet to recover.","The manager of the Imperial Mansion could still maintain a polite smile under such circumstances. He explained to them unhurriedly, “CEO Jiang, Mrs. Jiang, I’m just a worker. I know your situation, but don’t make things difficult for me no matter what the higher-ups order us to do.”","Jiang Zongnan’s temples were throbbing. His eyebrows sank, and his tone was dignified and impatient. “This is not a matter of making things difficult for you! Our guests are all here...”","He had never heard of the Imperial Mansion chasing someone out at the last minute. He didn’t expect such a thing to happen to him.","At this moment, Jiang Zongnan’s head was bigger than two!","In the banquet hall, other than the main table that was close and knew what had happened, no one else knew anything.","They invited half of the socialites in Beijing to attend Jiang Xianrou’s welcoming banquet.","Everyone was here.","The manager now casually said, “Cancel the banquet.” How could they arrange so many guests?","And what would they tell him?","Wasn’t this putting their faces on the ground to be trampled on!?","“Anyway...” Jiang Zongnan took a deep breath and looked solemn. He was about to say that the banquet could not be canceled.","Unexpectedly, the manager spoke before he could. “CEO Jiang, I’ve already said what I needed to say. It’s useless for you to make things difficult for me.”","There was some silence.","At this moment, the manager was very easy to talk to. However, under his seemingly easy-going appearance, he was unyielding and did not give the Jiang family a chance to refuse. “How about this, President Jiang? Our Imperial Mansion will compensate you for the penalty fee based on your deposit. Do you think this is okay?”","Jiang Zongnan’s expression changed again. He was livid and almost lost his temper.","This manager was very polite, but he was rude in his politeness!","He proposed to compensate for the breach of contract. What was the difference between that and dismissing a beggar?","No matter how poor the Jiang family was, they didn’t lack this bit of money.","Moreover, his family was reputable in Beijing. The other party’s words did not give him any face.","Jiang Zongnan was so angry that he didn’t know how to deal with the situation.","On the other hand, Jiang Yao went out to wash his face with cold water. When he returned, he realized that there was a commotion here and quickly walked over.","“Dad, what happened?”","He first looked at Jiang Zongnan, then at the manager standing respectfully opposite him. He asked, “Where’s Qiao Nian? Has she left?”"]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 A Joke in Beijing","paragraphs":["1556 A Joke in Beijing","“I don’t know. I didn’t see her.” Jiang Zongnan shook his head. He looked exhausted and didn’t seem to be in the mood for this.","“...” Jiang Yao was silent for a moment before looking in Qi Yan’s direction thoughtfully. However, he did not dare to think too deeply or mention his guess to Jiang Zongnan.","It was still a stalemate.","After asking Tang Wanru and figuring out what was going on, Jiang Yao rubbed his temples and turned to the manager. His eyes darkened as he said, “This is... Master Wang’s idea?”","!!","The other party didn’t answer directly. He only said, “Young Master Jiang, don’t make things difficult for me. I’m just following orders. I don’t know anything else.”","Jiang Yao nodded. He knew that he wouldn’t be able to get anything out of the other party. He took out his phone and walked to the side. “I’ll call Young Master Ye and ask him.”","The manager didn’t say anything else and didn’t urge them to settle the procedures. If Jiang Yao had the ability to make Master Wang change his words, he would immediately slap himself in the face.","Jiang Yao’s heart sank when he saw his reaction. However, he had no choice but to try to plead with Ye Wangchuan.","How else could he arrange so many guests in the banquet hall?","He couldn’t possibly tell everyone that they’d been evicted in the middle of the day?","If it really came to this today, the Jiang family’s second branch would become a joke in Beijing!","...","Jiang Yao had met Ye Wangchuan and the others before.","He had saved Ye Wangchuan’s number on his phone, but he was different from Jiang Li. He wasn’t very familiar with Ye Wangchuan and the others. He rarely interacted with them, so he barely called them.","But Jiang Yao couldn’t care less at this moment. He walked to the side and took out the phone number in his address book.","“Beep...”","The call went through. It started to ring.","Jiang Yao was slightly relieved.","...","At the same time, outside the Imperial Mansion.","The phone in the young man’s pocket vibrated. He took it out and glanced at it casually. He saw the caller ID of the Jiang family.","His well-defined hand snapped. Then, he looked up and asked the girl beside him, “What do you want for lunch?”","Qiao Nian pulled down the brim of her cap to hide the coldness in her eyes. She was rather annoyed. “...Hot pot?”","Qin Si happened to hear it. He pricked up his ears and immediately interrupted, “Sister Qiao, were you transformed from chili in your previous life? Why do you like spicy food so much? If I didn’t know that you were from Rao City, I would have thought that you were from Province S.”","Qiao Nian played with her phone as she walked with them. She held her phone in one hand and replied to messages quickly. Just looking at her figure was cool.","Coupled with her sloppy aura, she was especially eye-catching.","“Ah.” Qiao Nian had just finished replying to a message. She looked up at him and said lazily, “You don’t want to eat hotpot? Choose something you like. I’ll freeload off you. I’m fine with anything.”","Although Qin Si was addicted to talking, he had long treated Qiao Nian as his younger sister. He turned to Zhang Yang and said, “Let’s go to your friend’s place. Get him to reserve a private room for us.”","“Sure.” Zhang Yang did not refuse.","They had already walked out of the Imperial Mansion and Gu San went to get the car.","At this moment, Ye Wangchuan’s phone vibrated again. Qin Si saw him hanging up the phone again and couldn’t help but ask, “Master Wang, who is it? What’s with this serial call?”","The other party had already died once, but he still kept calling. His brain must be damaged!","At least he was shameless."]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 Only a Temporary Change of Location, Face Slap","paragraphs":["1557 Only a Temporary Change of Location, Face Slap","Ye Wangchuan put his hands in his pockets. Handsome, he was just like Qiao Nian—eye-catching with an oppressive aura. Smiling, he replied casually, “Pfft, an irrelevant person.”","Those related to Qiao Nian, such as Jiang Zongjin and Old Master Jiang, were all elders.","As for those who had nothing to do with Qiao Nian, such as the people from the Jiang family’s second branch, he had long classified them as “irrelevant people.”","He never wasted time on irrelevant people.","!!","Like... Jiang Yao.","...","In the banquet hall of the Imperial Mansion.","Jiang Yao called three times in a row, but the other party did not answer. He understood what Ye Wangchuan meant—he wouldn’t give them face!","He took a few deep breaths and barely calmed himself down. He walked back with a cold and embarrassed expression and said to Tang Wanru, who was full of anticipation, “Mom, Young Master Ye isn’t answering the phone. Let’s think about how to arrange the guests.”","Tang Wanru’s face turned green. She gritted her teeth and whispered, “It must be because of Qiao Nian!”","Jiang Yao did not comment. Or rather, he no longer had the energy to care about these things. He rubbed his temples and looked at his sister sympathetically. He comforted her softly, “Xianrou, don’t... don’t think too much. I’ll call the nearby hotel and ask if there’s a spare banquet hall. If there is, you and Dad can arrange for guests to go over first.”","There was some silence.","Extreme humiliation surged up. Jiang Xianrou almost bit through her lips. Her lips were stinging, so she reluctantly pinched her fingernails and nodded mechanically.","Jiang Yao patted her shoulder. He wanted to help her, but he didn’t have the ability. He could only helplessly contact the other hotels.","It was already noon. There was a good chance that the other places were already full.","However, Jiang Yao couldn’t think of any other way.","He had to try.","...","After he walked away.","The people at the main table who had witnessed this unexpected situation were silent.","They were all embarrassed by this situation.","Some had even thought of an excuse to leave later.","After all, anyone with a discerning eye could tell that Jiang Xianrou’s banquet had been ruined.","Moreover, Jiang Xianrou seemed to have offended... Master Wang.","It could be said that no one in Beijing wanted to provoke the Ye family. They only came to support Jiang Xianrou on the Pharmacy Association’s account. However, they didn’t expect that Jiang Xianrou had already fallen out with Master Wang.","Anyone with a brain knew that offending Ye Wangchuan for Jiang Xianrou was not a good deal.","Even with Qi Yan, this deal was still not worth it.","Everyone was someone who could make a name for themselves in Beijing, so who wouldn’t be smart?","Those who were closer to each other had long exchanged glances. They understood each other’s intention to find an excuse to slip away.","Only Wei Ying, Wei Ling, and Shen Jingyan, who were at the same table, were extremely embarrassed. They sat there restlessly as if there were needles under their buttocks.","In particular, Shen Jingyan’s well-maintained face was burning. It took him a long time to recover.","When Qiao Nian had first arrived, he had taken the initiative to talk to her. He had greeted her and been busy saying nice things.","He had thought that Qiao Nian would take the easy way out and give him some face. Unexpectedly, she did not look at him the entire time. She didn’t even look back when she left.","It made his act of taking the initiative to greet her and helping Qi Yan educate Qiao Nian seem so... ridiculous.","This had happened at the last minute.","After Jiang Zongnan calmed down a little, he still had to explain to the guests.","He reached the head table first and had just said, “Everyone ...”","Qi Yan had been tense until her phone suddenly rang. She grabbed it and looked down at the caller ID.","His expression changed drastically, and she picked up the call without caring who she offended. “Hello, Brother.”"]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 I Can Do Whatever I Say!","paragraphs":["1558 I Can Do Whatever I Say!","Was it Qi Rongguang?","Jiang Zongnan paused and waited for the call to end.","At this moment, Qi Yan had no heart to care about anyone else. Her mind was filled with Qiao Nian’s threatening words. Her heart tightened. When she heard Qi Rongguang’s words on the other end of the phone, she suddenly placed her hand on the table and stood up. “Are you talking about Lanyin...”","They all looked at her, startled.","!!","Qi Yan’s expression changed, and she did not look at others. “You said that Lanyin was kidnapped?!”","Everyone at the table turned to her in astonishment.","Shen Jingyan’s mind buzzed as an alarm sounded in his head. His tense face changed as he was shocked.","Lanyin... Could it be Qi Lanyin?","He recalled that Qiao Nian had just said something about Qi Lanyin and then Qi Yan received such a call.","Cold sweat broke out on his back. There was only one thought in his mind—Qiao Nian had done it!","He thought of the Qi family and the power behind Qi Yan. He felt a lingering fear. He couldn’t believe that Qiao Nian was so arrogant.","That was the Qi family!","Even if she was not afraid of the Qi family, what about the royal family of Country M behind Qi Yan?","What about the ties between the royal family and the illegal district?","... Didn’t she know fear?!","She dared to challenge the entire Qi family and the forces behind them!","Madness. What madness!","Qiao Nian was a lunatic!","...","Qi Yan was still on the phone.","Outsiders couldn’t hear what Qi Rongguang was saying on the other end of the phone, but she heard it clearly.","“I received a note from a stranger this morning. It said that they had taken Lanyin away. I quickly called home and asked them to look for Lanyin. As expected, she wasn’t at home. I sent someone to look for her usual favorite place, but they couldn’t find her. I couldn’t get through to her phone, and now her cell phone’s location has disappeared. I can’t even pinpoint her location with the Qi family’s satellite system.","“She was kidnapped!","“The other party’s so arrogant. Arrogant in every way. He clearly doesn’t think much of us.”","Qi Rongguang’s tone was solemn as he said, “The only clue we have now is that piece of paper. I’ve taken a good look at it. I noticed a Mandala flower mark at the corner. Do you think it’s that organization...","“Black Mandala.”","The Black Mandara was a killer alliance. In the early years, it was very famous in the illegal district. Later on, it suddenly disappeared.","There was no news in years.","This situation was the same as the Red Alliance back then. The Red Alliance had also disappeared for a period of time, but as Sun frequently appeared on the black net, the Red Alliance became active again.","And the Black Mandara organization was even more mysterious than the Red Alliance. It had been gone for a long, long time. Many people had only heard legends about it.","Qi Yan originally thought that it was done by the Bright Gate. After all, the Red Alliance was a hacker organization and did not do anything like kidnapping and killing.","Although she was worried at first, she didn’t expect Qiao Nian to be able to do anything to Qi Lanyin immediately. She even planned to arrange for a few more bodyguards to protect her.","She didn’t expect... Qiao Nian to be able to do what she said.","And she even brought up the legendary killer alliance.","They were even more efficient at killing and robbing than she was.","How provocative!","Qiao Nian was too arrogant!","Qi Yan even thought that if Qiao Nian was in front of her right now, she would definitely want to eat her flesh and drink her blood.","“Brother, don’t worry. I’ll be right back!”"]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 Someone You Can’t Afford to Offend","paragraphs":["1559 Someone You Can’t Afford to Offend","At this moment, in an abandoned chemical plant in Continent O, Country M.","Qi Lanyin was trussed up and thrown aside. Not far from her was a hot and tall young woman in a black motorcycle leather jacket and pants.","The woman looked valiant from the outside. She was very eye-catching.","She ignored Qi Lanyin’s gaze from beginning to end and leisurely walked to the side to find an intact stool from the pile of junk. Then, she dragged it out and found a piece of paper to wipe it clean before sitting down.","!!","Qi Lanyin watched in horror as the other party slowly took out a small tablet and quickly assembled it into a small computer. She then started to surf the Internet in front of her.","She bit her lip. Her eyes flickered for a long time before she finally found the courage to speak. “Who are you?”","The young woman seemed to have logged into a chat app. She turned and glanced at her with raised eyebrows upon hearing her question.","She didn’t even notice the open computer screen that covered her.","“You...” Qi Lanyin struggled to see clearly, but unfortunately, she was far away. The other party’s small computer seemed to have an anti-peeping film on it. She only saw a white screen and could not see what kind of chat software the other party had logged in.","She had no choice but to bite her lip again. She looked away indignantly, then her gaze landed on the young woman. She lowered her voice and threatened, “Why did you kidnap me? Do you know who I am? I advise you to let me go quickly. Otherwise, when my aunt and father find me here, they will definitely not let you off.”","“Oh.”","The young woman looked at her casually, as if she wasn’t intimidated at all. She was even in the mood to smile.","She looked at her gently and warmly and said, “Miss Qi, have you ever thought that I might kill you before they find you?”","What a gentle tone.","Qi Lanyin was so frightened that she paled!","“Tsk, I was only joking. Don’t worry, I don’t have the final say regarding your life. You can still live as long as someone doesn’t want you dead.”","The young woman crossed her legs, her beautiful eyes darkening. Her tone changed. “Of course, if she wants you dead, you probably won’t be able to see the sun tomorrow.”","“Who-who is the person you’re talking about?” Qi Lanyin panicked. It was obvious that she had never encountered such a situation before and was actually very afraid.","“Hmm.” The young woman glanced at her, her red lips curving. She didn’t answer her directly, just said slowly, “Someone you can’t afford to offend.”","Qi Lanyin refused to give up. She wanted to ask more, but the other party did not have the patience to play games with her. She reminded her ‘considerately’, “Miss Qi, I’ll have to find you a smelly sock to shut you up if you continue to talk so much nonsense. Are you sure you want to continue asking questions?”","Qi Lanyin had been spoiled since she was young and had developed a proud personality.","With her proud nature, she would rather die than have someone stuff smelly socks in her mouth.","So, her expression changed again and again before she tactfully fell silent.","There was only this abandoned chemical plant dozens of kilometers away, and there were only the two of them in the abandoned chemical plant.","After Qi Lanyin calmed down, the huge chemical plant also quietened down.","Satisfied, the young woman turned back to her mini-computer.","Qi Lanyin could only hear the sound of typing on the keyboard. She didn’t know who the other party was contacting or why she had kidnapped her..."]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 The Black Mandala Is Indeed Related to Sister Nian","paragraphs":["1560 The Black Mandala Is Indeed Related to Sister Nian","On the other side, in a hot pot restaurant in Beijing.","The bottom of the pot rolled out an alluring fragrance under the high temperature. The fiery red color alone was appetizing.","Qiao Nian ate until she was 70% full, then her eating speed began to slow down. When she threw down her chopsticks, she rested her chin on her cold white wrist and casually leaned back in her chair to play with her phone. Guan Yan had just sent her a message.","[Guan Yan: Boss, Qi Lanyin is in an abandoned factory. What are you going to do with her? Kill her or...?]","What a ruthless person!","Qiao Nian clicked her tongue. Holding her chin, she replied with one hand.","[Q: Wait a little longer.]","Soon, Guan Yan replied to her.","[Guan Yan: OK, I’ll follow your arrangements.]","[Guan Yan: Miss Qi is quite honest. I thought I would have to knock her out. I didn’t expect her to be so obedient.]","Qiao Nian didn’t know what had happened to make Guan Yan feel that Qi Lanyin was ‘honest’.","Her slender fingers tapped the side of her face. Her eyes were half-closed, lazy.","She didn’t reply. Her thoughts were scattered.","In a way, Qi Lanyin was indeed an ‘honest person’. At least compared to Qiao Chen and Jiang Xianrou, Qi Lanyin was much more sensible.","It had been the same in the illegal district before.","Once Qi Lanyin realized that she was at a disadvantage, she would not blindly argue no matter how angry she was.","Very sensible.","Just as Qiao Nian was thinking this, her phone buzzed again.","Pulled back to the present, she looked down at the new message on her phone.","This time, it wasn’t Guan Yan. It was Slim Waist Control.","He was talkative as usual.","Gossip.","He sent her a bunch of stuff.","Qiao Nian finished reading ten lines at a glance. He had sent seven or eight lines of text. In summary, everything could be resumed to one sentence—[The Black Mandala has reappeared!]","Qiao Nian’s lips twitched. Her body was very honest. She clicked away from his profile picture and ignored him.","She hadn’t forgotten that the last few times she had revealed her identity was because of someone’s big mouth!","If he knew that the Black Mandala was related to her and Guan Yan, Qiao Nian couldn’t imagine how she would be exposed completely.","Slim Waist Control always had countless ways to expose her!","So, it was best not to tell him.","...","Qiao Nian was playing with her phone lazily after her meal. Qin Si was almost full as well. He put down his chopsticks.","He glanced in the direction of the girl and immediately thought of something. He asked, “By the way, Master Wang, Sister Qiao, do you know about the Black Mandala?”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Ye Wangchuan noticed that the girl stopped playing with her phone and looked in Qin Si’s direction.","He also put down his chopsticks and wiped the corner of his mouth elegantly. His voice was low and pleasant. “What about it?”","“The Black Mandala has reappeared.” Qin Si was very keen to share the gossip. He immediately explained to Zhang Yang and the others in high spirits what the Black Mandala was about and how it appeared and disappeared.","In the end, he emotionally said, “Recently, the illegal district has become more and more lively. Many forces that used to keep a low profile have appeared recently. I can’t stand it anymore.”","Wasn’t it because there were too many people looking for trouble recently?","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened as he leaned lazily back in his chair. His shoulders relaxed and he looked noncommittal."]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 My Former Online Name Is ‘Gone With the Wind’","paragraphs":["1561 My Former Online Name Is ‘Gone With the Wind’","Seeing him like this, Qin Si pursed his lips in boredom. He turned to Qiao Nian and asked with a smile, “Sister Qiao, is there any news about the Black Mandala in the Red Alliance? What’s their background?”","The Red Alliance was the leader of the Hacker Alliance. Many secrets to the outside world were not really secrets to the Red Alliance.","Ever since Qin Si found out that Qiao Nian was the Red Alliance’s Sun, he often asked her random questions, many of which were gossip in the circle.","There was even such a boring thing as who the mother of the celebrity illegitimate child was!","!!","He asked just as casually this time.","Qiao Nian felt uncomfortable with his question. She changed her posture and coughed lightly. “No.”","“Oh.” Qin Si didn’t notice her discomfort and thought that she really didn’t know. He said to Zhang Yang calmly, “Tsk, I’ve always felt that the name Black Mandala is very similar to the name of the QQ group when I was studying in the past. My QQ nickname was Gone With the Wind. Don’t you think it’s very similar to Black Mandala? It’s so middle school.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Amazing!","God, Gone With the Wind!","The corners of her mouth twitched, and she almost didn’t defend herself. She reached out and touched the bridge of her nose. The words were on the tip of her tongue, but Qiao Nian held them back.","At that time, she was indeed in middle school. Black Mandala was originally her middle school name.","At that time, she had only gotten a second team from the Red Alliance. Later on, because she had to study, she didn’t care anymore.","There were a few others in the organization, all members she’d recruited on the dark web.","Usually, no one contacted each other. They would only contact each other through the Internet when something happened.","She and Guan Yan knew each other. As for the others... Qiao Nian had never seen them before.","But no one else had seen her in person.","Everyone got along quite casually.","It was a little like the QQ group Qin Si had described.","“Young Master Qin, why did such a mysterious organization suddenly become active?” Zhang Yang was different from Ye Wangchuan and Qin Si. The only places he could come into contact with were the forces in Beijing. He had learned many things from Qin Si.","He knew nothing about the illegal district.","Therefore, he was especially interested when Qin Si mentioned the illegal district. If he didn’t understand, he would ask. He was a very obedient child.","“How would I know?” Qin Si only knew a little about the illegal district. “I just heard that Black Mandala is moving again. As for what you asked...”","Qin Si smacked his lips and changed the topic to Qiao Nian. “Tsk, do you think I would know something that even Sister Qiao doesn’t know?”","He was very frank.","The only thing he didn’t do was write ‘lackey’ on his own face.","However, in the eyes of Zhang Yang and Gu San, his behavior was no different from a lackey. He knelt down to Boss Qiao openly.","Zhang Yang was silent for a moment before looking curiously in Qiao Nian’s direction.","The girl’s eyes became even more agitated, and she was even more speechless. She changed the topic. “Ahem, by the way, do you know anyone who has a collection of heavy equipment for a Boeing 737-300 from 20 years ago?”","“Heavy equipment?” Qin Si narrowed his eyes and looked at her in surprise. “Sister Qiao, why are you looking for the equipment for the plane? And a plane from 20 years ago at that. This model has long been discontinued, right?”","The Boeing 737-300 was a traditional aircraft model. This model had been discontinued about ten years ago.","Why was Qiao Nian looking for such a plane?"]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 Qiao Nian Wants to Find the Device to Play the Black Box","paragraphs":["1562 Qiao Nian Wants to Find the Device to Play the Black Box","“I have my own plans,” the girl answered him succinctly, her eyes exquisite.","“...” Qin Si was speechless.","Of course, he knew that!","He was asking what she planned to do with it.","!!","However, Qin Si was no fool. He could tell that Qiao Nian didn’t want to talk about it. He didn’t pursue the matter and racked his brains.","After a long moment, he remembered. “Ah, I know who has it!”","Qiao Nian suddenly looked at him. “Who is it?”","“Uncle Bo.”","Qin Si said quickly, “Bo Jingxing’s family owns an airline. His uncle’s private hobby is collecting things related to airplanes. I heard from Bo Jingxing that if his uncle hadn’t entered the International Criminal Investigation Team for some reason back then, he would be an outstanding pilot now.”","He was talking about Bo Zheng.","Bo Jingxing was also present. His eyebrows moved slightly when Qin Si mentioned his uncle. He also turned to the girl and said in a soothing tone, “Qin Si is right. I remember now. My uncle has collected a lot of these things. My uncle might have the thing you want. Shall I ask him?”","Qiao Nian reached out to pull down her cap and thanked him casually. “Yes, thank you.”","Bo Jingxing smiled. “You’re welcome.”","“You’ve helped him before. I’m sure he’d be happy to do you a favor.” He didn’t waste any time. Putting down his chopsticks, he got up. “I’m going out to make a call.”","Seeing him go out, Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and turned to talk to the girl. “Captain Bo might not be back from Shuangjiang City yet. Do you want me to drive you over to look for him?”","Qiao Nian, on the other hand, was calm and relaxed. She glanced at him and said, “It’s fine, I’m not in a hurry. If he’s not back yet, let’s wait until he is. Anyway, the item is in my hands. It doesn’t matter if I hear it a few days earlier or later. I can afford to wait.”","She’d waited a long time. A day or two wouldn’t make a difference.","Besides, she still had to deal with the Qi family’s matters and couldn’t leave Beijing for the time being.","“I just need to make sure there’s a replay device for this model. If there isn’t one in the country, I’ll put a reward on the dark web sooner or later.”","She’d been looking for this for days, but after all, the plane was a discontinued model, and it was a device that played old-fashioned tape-type black boxes. It was a small part of the plane’s accessories, and it wasn’t so easy to find.","Qiao Nian asked casually. If it really didn’t work out, she would think of another way.","Of course, it would be best if Bo Zheng had it!","...","Soon, Bo Jingxing returned to the private room with his phone.","His eyebrows relaxed as he said to the girl, “I asked. He has the equipment you mentioned, but it’s at his house. I can’t get it to you until he gets back. He’ll be back next week.”","“OK.” Qiao Nian’s voice was hoarse as she said readily, “Please let me know when Captain Bo comes back.”","“I told him already, he’ll call you when he gets to Beijing.”","Bo Jingxing still felt uneasy and added, “Just in case. If he comes back, I’ll send you another message.”","“Okay.” A trace of warmth flashed across Qiao Nian’s eyes.","She had never been particularly sentimental, so she said no more.","Bo Jingxing wasn’t the kind of person who liked to talk. After speaking briefly with Qiao Nian, he called the waiter to pay the bill.","Ye Wangchuan paid for it.","Next, everyone went home.","Gu San drove. Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan left the restaurant and returned to Rhine Apartments."]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 Big Boss, Someone Is Tracking Me","paragraphs":["1563 Big Boss, Someone Is Tracking Me","In a hotel suite in Beijing.","Qi Yan paced around the suite until the doorbell rang. Her tightly furrowed brows relaxed slightly, and her tense expression relaxed slightly. She quickly walked over and opened the door.","A scruffy foreigner was standing outside the door. The man was in his late 20s and looked very young. His features were not bad and his height was obvious.","However, he really didn’t like to tidy himself up. He was unshaven and exuded a sloppy sense of decadence.","It didn’t leave a good impression. It was too gloomy.","Wasn’t that Mas whom Qiao Nian had met in Rao City?","When Qi Yan saw him, she was like a drowning person grabbing onto a life-saving straw. She immediately pulled him in and said anxiously, “You’re finally here! Quick, help me find out Lanyin’s location. I asked the technical department of the corporation to investigate for a long time, but they didn’t find anything.”","Mas walked in with a computer in his right hand and sneered. He said in a disdainful tone, “The people from the technical department of the Hengfeng Corporation are trash!”","Qi Yan was a little embarrassed by his words, but she couldn’t say anything since she was asking him a favor.","She closed the door silently and followed the man into the living room.","She told the man about Qi Lanyin’s situation in a hurry. “Lanyin has been missing for half a day. We’ve used all the methods we can think of. We only found the last place she was seen. We sent people to look around the place, but they saw no one.”","“It’s normal that you can’t find her. Her phone’s GPS has already been blocked.” Mas seemed used to this kind of thing and wasn’t surprised.","He walked over to the living-room sofa, sat down, and took the computer out of his handbag. The black computer was heavy and looked different from any other computer Qi Yan saw before.","He said simply, “Give me her phone number.”","Qi Yan found a pen and paper and wrote a string of numbers.","Mas did not waste any time. He focused on the computer and opened the tracking system he had made himself. Then, he entered Qi Lanyin’s phone number.","Qi Yan saw the code numbers jumping on his screen. She finally felt safe when she saw the green numbers refreshing.","...","Meanwhile, on the other side.","Qiao Nian had just taken a cold shower and had yet to wipe the water droplets off her hair. She walked to the desk and casually opened her laptop.","The phone sat beside her, charging.","Then, the screen lit up.","The girl propped her legs up and leaned against the edge of the desk in an irregular posture.","Her features relaxed. Slowly, she grabbed the phone, clicked it open, and read the message.","Guan Yan: [Damn, someone is tracking me!]","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows.","She hit the boot button on her laptop with one hand. It booted up instantly and connected to Guan Yan’s computer.","As expected, Qiao Nian entered a few codes and saw a very aggressive trojan horse program trying to locate Guan Yan’s IP address.","“Heh, interesting.” Qiao Nian threw the towel aside and pulled out a chair to sit down. She propped her arm on the desk and sat down, looking very much like a big shot.","A strand of her black bangs hung down and covered her brow, but it couldn’t hide its sharp color.","Qiao Nian’s hand speed was fast. One could almost only see the shadows of her fair fingers tapping on the keyboard. Countermeasure codes poured out from her fingers one after another. She seemed to be able to type out these codes without even thinking.","In less than 20 minutes, Qiao Nian hit Enter and leaned back on the chair. She narrowed her eyes and lazily looked at the database that had begun to automatically generate on her computer..."]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 Face Slapping, Sister Nian Wins","paragraphs":["1564 Face Slapping, Sister Nian Wins","In a hotel suite dozens of kilometers away.","The young man was initially smug as he waited for his tracking system to decipher the computer IP address of the person who had kidnapped Qi Lanyin.","He was so relaxed that he started drinking coffee.","Until the defense systems of the other party that he had already broken through were repaired one by one, and even a very powerful virus began to devour the data on his computer.","!!","Mas couldn’t sit still any longer. He quickly tried to take back control of his computer.","A minute passed.","With great effort, he finally turned on the defense system of his computer.","Another five minutes passed.","The defense system he had developed was useless. The virus that had invaded his computer was still devouring his files. It was even beginning to destroy his system.","Mas’ jaw clenched and he pulled a long face.","Qi Yan realized that there was something wrong with his expression. She put down her teacup and asked him, “Mas, what’s wrong? Did it not go smoothly?”","The man ignored her and gritted his teeth. His face was ashen as he continued typing, trying to collide with the other party.","He knew who it was.","Qi Yan had told him before.","Sun!","Someone who had always been as famous as him but had never shown her face.","He had seen her once in Rao City. She looked like an ordinary girl. He had heard that she was still in her first year of university and had even lived in a small city before.","How could a genius like Mas tolerate such a person suppressing him for so many years?","He didn’t come here under the Qi family’s instructions.","He was willing to come this time mainly because he couldn’t swallow his defeat in the software competition. He wanted to compete with the Red Alliance and let the entire hacker world see who the uncrowned king was!","The seconds ticked by.","Mas’ forehead was covered in sweat. His typing speed had slowed down. Even Qi Yan could tell that he was powerless.","Qi Yan’s heart skipped a beat. She lowered her voice and asked, “Is it Qiao Nian?”","Mas ignored her.","An hour passed.","His hands left the keyboard completely.","It was at that moment that Mas’ computer defense system completely collapsed. His computer screen flickered a few times and then turned completely black.","Closer, as they both watched.","Two English words appeared on the computer screen.","Game Over!","Game over.","It was definitely a slap in the face!","Mas suddenly looked uncomfortable.","Qi Yan’s expression was not good, either. She walked to the side and took a deep breath to suppress her anger. She picked up her phone and dialed the number she wouldn’t call unless she had no choice.","“Beep...”","The phone rang seven or eight times. No one answered.","Qi Yan became even more embarrassed. She suppressed her humiliation and was about to call again when the other party picked up at the last second.","“... Countess.”","The royal family of Country M was also addressed royally. Qi Yan was often called Countess.","Except that those words sounded strangely ironic coming from a girl.","Qi Yan’s face burned, and the humiliation in her heart intensified. However, she had no choice but to lower her head.","“Miss Qiao, can I have a few minutes of your time?”","Qiao Nian had just poured herself a glass of water when she heard Qi Yan’s humiliated voice. Her red lips curled up coldly. “Oh, how do you want to talk to me?”"]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 Sure, I Want One Billion","paragraphs":["1565 Sure, I Want One Billion","Qi Yan’s voice came from the other end of the phone. It was obvious that she was still a little calm. “... I apologize to you and Young Master Jiang on Lanyin’s behalf. I’m sorry.”","Qiao Nian took a sip of water, too lazy to reply.","Would it help to be sorry?","Or did Qi Yan think that her apology could erase the fact that Jiang Li was still lying in the hospital bed?","!!","Qi Yan didn’t hear the girl’s response. Her face burned, and her breathing was heavy. She lowered her voice and said in humiliation, “In order to show our sincerity, we are willing to compensate Young Master Jiang for all his hospitalization expenses and losses. Miss Qiao, give me a number. I’ll get someone to transfer the money immediately.”","Qiao Nian slowly put down her cup. She pointed at her chin with a cold white hand, her eyelashes slightly lowered. “Do you want to compensate me?”","Did she seem short of money?","“It’s not remuneration. It’s just compensation for Young Master Jiang. This is also a token of my appreciation on Lanyin’s behalf.”","Qi Yan felt a little more confident and spoke much more smoothly. “I’m friends with your uncle and aunt, and I’m also your cousin’s godmother. Our families are considered relatives, after all. There’s no need for you to make things so tense. To be honest, the Jiang family doesn’t want you to blow things up to the point of being unable to clean up, right? Even Young Master Jiang himself doesn’t know that you made such a big deal out of standing up for him?”","Qiao Nian didn’t argue.","Jiang Li really didn’t know what she had done, and she didn’t want him to worry.","“Miss Qiao, I know you have a good relationship with Young Master Jiang, but before you do anything, you have to consider others!”","At this point, Qi Yan smiled and became more fluent. “Miss Qiao, you should have heard that there’s a spot in the Pharmacy Association to participate in the annual exchange in the independent continent.”","Qiao Nian remained silent.","She had always known about the annual exchange.","Every year an invitation was sent to her. Only, she never went.","Did Jiang Xianrou want to go to the independent continent?","A cold glint flashed across Qiao Nian’s eyes.","Did Jiang Xianrou know what the independent continent was? And she wanted to go there.","Did she think the independent continent was a good place?","Jiang Xianrou would probably be beaten up when she arrived there.","“The Qi family can help her get this spot in exchange...” Qi Yan did not finish her sentence.","Qiao Nian casually interrupted her. “Don’t you know that Jiang Xianrou is worthless to me?”","Qi Yan was speechless.","“I gave you a chance. Qi Lanyin did this alone. Every injustice has its perpetrator. I’ll look for her.” Qiao Nian’s tone was very calm.","Qi Yan felt as if someone was choking her. She could barely breathe. “Qiao Nian, what do I have to do for you to let Lanyin off?”","Qiao Nian pulled out a chair and sat down. She crossed her legs and supported her chin with her hand, as if she was seriously considering her question. Then, she replied casually, “Don’t you want to compensate me? Why don’t you give me a billion yuan first?”","Qi Yan was so angry that her head almost bled!","“How much did you say?”","“One billion.” Qiao Nian ‘thoughtfully’ confirmed it.","Qi Yan was trembling, not from fear, but purely from anger. “Miss Qiao, don’t force me. Where can I get a billion yuan for you!”"]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 Qi Yan Was Almost Pissed Off","paragraphs":["1566 Qi Yan Was Almost Pissed Off","The Qi family had just experienced the previous storm and almost went down.","Although Qi Yan had found a mysterious backer to help them survive, and they seemed to be more prosperous than before, only Qi Yan knew best that the Qi family was only maintaining superficial glory.","Her brother had researched the chip technology for 10 years, and the Qing University’s research team had also created a chip similar to theirs, which directly destroyed their 10-year plan.","For that chip technology, the Qi family had not only invested a lot of effort and manpower in the past 10 years, but they had also spent a lot of money on this project.","The final results were even beaten to it by others, making their goal of monopolizing the market fall short.","The chip technology also became useless.","The Qi family was relying on that technology to achieve the entire group’s transformation goal. Without the chip technology, their foundation was also injured.","This was also why Qi Yan hated Qiao Nian so much.","Back in the illegal district, if Qiao Nian hadn’t interfered, they would have long used the International IT Association to forcefully steal and plagiarize from the Qing University’s Research Institute.","In the end... Qiao Nian intervened, and everything changed.","It could be said that the Qi family’s current predicament was inevitably related to Qiao Nian.","She still dared to suggest giving her a billion.","A billion, not a hundred thousand.","Even if the Hengfeng Corporation had money, they wouldn’t be able to take out a billion yuan all of a sudden. Even if they could, it would definitely be a huge blow to them. They would be as good as dead even if they didn’t die.","“One billion is too much,” Qi Yan said without thinking.","Qiao Nian didn’t seem to mind. The corners of her lips curled up, and she said valiantly, “I’ll give you a day to think about it. It’s fine if you don’t pay me. There are many high-rise buildings in Country M. I want to see if Qi Lanyin will be as lucky as my brother if she falls from them. She’ll be able to keep her life, then.","“It doesn’t matter to you. It matters even less to me.”","“Qiao Nian!” Qi Yan was so angry that her head was filled with blood. Her vision darkened, and she almost fainted from anger.","Unfortunately, Qiao Nian ignored her and hung up.","She did not put down her phone immediately after hanging up. Instead, she leaned back in her chair and opened QQ.","She hadn’t logged into QQ in a long time. Now that she did, other than some messy group messages, there was also a message from Wen Ruxia.","“Qiao Nian, the MV will be released on October 15th. Can you post on Weibo and interact with me? I’ll do some publicity. My Weibo name is ‘Wind in Summer’.”","Qiao Nian rubbed her temples and realized that Wen Ruxia had sent her a message a week ago.","Which meant she never replied.","Qiao Nian looked at the date on the top corner of her phone.","October 13th.","Fortunately, there were still two days to go. There was still time.","Qiao Nian replied to Wen Ruxia on QQ. Then, she placed her phone beside her and quickly logged into her Weibo account.","She had only posted on Weibo twice.","Once on Jiang Li’s Weibo post to clarify.","The other time was when she tagged Qiao Chen and publicly announced that she had used her song to win the award.","After that, Qiao Nian never used Weibo again.","Mainly because she was usually busy and had no interest in sharing her life on Weibo.","As soon as she logged into her go-to account and password, 99+ messages popped up, followed by 99+ follows.","Her computer nearly jammed from the bounce.","Qiao Nian deleted all the private messages and followers that popped up. Finally, the computer page was clean. She added Wen Ruxia’s Weibo username and pressed the Enter key.","Weibo immediately showed her dozens of people called “Wind in Summer”.","She checked the first one. It was Wen Ruxia’s account.","Qiao Nian clicked on it."]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 Sister Nian: I Might Have Stabbed Gone With the Wind’s Nest Recently","paragraphs":["1567 Sister Nian: I Might Have Stabbed Gone With the Wind’s Nest Recently","Qiao Nian rarely used Weibo. Not only had she only posted two Weibo posts, but her follow list was also clean.","Other than following Jiang Li’s Weibo account, Qiao Nian had never followed anyone else.","Wen Ruxia was the second person she paid attention to.","She clicked on “follow” and then clicked on the “Wind in Summer” account. Next, she saw the Weibo post at the top.","!!","Wen Ruxia’s Weibo post was a video about the Winter Games. There were only a few comments and shares under her post.","Qiao Nian clicked on the comment section.","There were less than 10 comments in total, and they were all from people she knew.","[Flying Cat: Could that figure in the video be Young Master Wen’s goddess? @Wind in Summer 2.0, Young Master Wen, quickly forward your goddess.]","[Make Me Fly: God Qiao.]","[Gone With the Wind 2.0: Young Master, I’ve forwarded it!]","[Gone With the Wind 2.0: Alright.]","[Gone With the Wind 2.0: Transfer another.]","...","Qiao Nian’s half-squinted eyes were still a little sleepy. Seeing the curious ID in the comment section, Gone With the Wind 2.0, she couldn’t help but recall the middle school name that Qin Si had complained to her about.","It seemed to also be Gone With the Wind.","Resting her chin in her hand, she narrowed her eyes and double-checked. It was indeed Gone With the Wind, but there was a 2.0 behind the ID.","She had recently poked the nest of ‘Gone With the Wind’. Why was that name everywhere?","Qiao Nian took a few more glances at the ID and slowly closed the comments. Then, she composed a few words and reposted Wen Ruxia’s Weibo post.","After doing this, Qiao Nian got up to dry her hair.","Her hair was dripping wet. If she didn’t blow it dry, her shirt would get wet on her shoulders.","Ten minutes later.","The girl blew her hair half dry. When she was sure it wasn’t dripping anymore, she dropped the hairdryer and returned to the desk.","The computer had been beeping non-stop since earlier, but Qiao Nian had ignored it while drying her hair.","Walking over, she realized that the Weibo post she had reposted earlier had already been labeled as a hot topic. There were many more reposts and comments on the message board in the upper right corner.","Qiao Nian walked over and covered the mouse with one hand, then clicked on one of them.","[God, is that you in the video?]","[Master Zhui Guang, did you film an MV for Spark? Damn, did you star in it yourself?]","[Spread it around! We have to blow this up!]","[I’ve already given ‘Wind in Summer’ a lot of attention ~ (*^ω^*) Hehe, I can’t chase after my idol, but I have the same kind of attention as big shot Zhui Guang~ Smart Mom fan, peeping online!]","Qiao Nian didn’t finish reading all of them. She only saw a few comments that had received a lot of likes.","Then, she looked away from the computer, walked to the side, and casually grabbed a bottle of water. She had just unscrewed the cap when her phone lit up.","Qiao Nian caught a glimpse of the Class A group chat of First High School. She raised her head and took a sip of water. Then, she closed the cap of the mineral water bottle and reached for her phone.","It had been a long time since the group was so active.","All of them appeared today. They were very active.","[Shen Qingqing: Have you guys seen Sister Nian’s Weibo? She posted on Weibo.]","Shen Qingqing was admitted to University A, which was next to Qing University. The Media Department was also one of the ace majors in University A other than the Computing Faculty.","[Chen Yuan: I saw it.]","[Zhou Feiyang: I saw it.]"]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 Top Hot Search Topic","paragraphs":["1568 Top Hot Search Topic","[Jiang Tingting: Where is it? Weibo? Ah, Sister Nian posted on Weibo? I thought she had forgotten that she had a Weibo account. I’ll go take a look now. Everyone, wait for me to come back and discuss it~]","[Shen Qingqing: Σ|`O′| Σ Ow~~ I also want to be on Sister Nian’s following list.]","[Liang Bowen: +1]","[Shen Qingqing: ...]","[Jiang Tingting: +2]","[Pei Ying: +3]","There was a series of names at the bottom, all from the old Class A.","Qiao Nian saw that the group was flooded with messages. All sorts of +5, +6... +19, +28.","She pursed her lips and silently bubbled in the group.","[QN: Send your Weibo accounts here.]","In the Class A group chat of First High School, everyone was in a frenzy. Everyone was dumbfounded when Qiao Nian appeared.","No one in the group spoke for a full two minutes.","Liang Bowen was the first to react.","[Liang Bowen: Sister Nian, you’re here?]","His message was followed by a sweating emoticon.","Jiang Tingting had always been a straightforward person. Before Qiao Nian could reply, she posted her Weibo account in the group.","[Jiang Tingting: Sister Nian, this is my Weibo account.]","[Jiang Tingting: Remember to double click and follow me!]","With someone taking the lead, the people at the back had the cheek to post their Weibo accounts in the group chat as well.","Qiao Nian gave them a cursory glance. There were about 30 of them. She needed to find them one by one.","Qiao Nian couldn’t help but feel a headache coming on. She regretted sending that message.","If she’d known there would be so many people, she wouldn’t have said that.","Indeed, it was risky. She made a silent note to be more cautious in the future.","However, she always kept her word. Qiao Nian leaned against the desk patiently. According to the Weibo accounts that everyone in the group had posted, she followed them one by one.","Zhui Guang Following List +1.","Zhui Guang Following List +2.","...","In just 10 minutes, Qiao Nian’s following list, which originally only had two people, instantly increased to more than 30. Her fans even thought that they had accidentally followed the God’s fake account.","After the fans on Weibo confirmed that they had not made a mistake, the atmosphere was no less lively than the Class A group chat of First High School.","“Damn, what’s wrong with the big shot today? She’s so active that she doesn’t seem like herself.”","“I went to look at the accounts that the God followed just now. They seem to be all students from Class A of Rao City’s First High School. Boohoo, let’s not talk about it anymore. I’m impressed. I want to be in the same class as the big shot.”","“Am I the only one who’s been warmed up!”","“Hehehe, as long as my hand speed is fast enough, God Qiao’s classmates will be my classmates! Everyone, pay attention to them. I hope you can send more photos of my God. It’s best to send your WeChat as well. You can also send your phone number if you don’t have a WeChat account.”","Qiao Nian had always been popular.","She was the kind of special existence who was not in the entertainment industry but was definitely not inferior to any popular celebrity.","She didn’t usually operate like a celebrity.","Zhui Guang was the kind that did not come online for 10 days or half a month.","It was already very rare for her to say something in half a year.","Hence, many fans wanted to set off firecrackers to celebrate when Qiao Nian went online on Weibo this time.","Several trending topics related to her appeared on the trending list.","In particular, Wen Ruxia’s promotional video for the Winter Games’ forwarding reached the six digits. The number of shares and likes was still rising.","The topic of #Winter Games also jumped to the top of the trending searches.","Attention was high."]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 Nian Nian, Are You Going to the Independent Continent?","paragraphs":["1569 Nian Nian, Are You Going to the Independent Continent?","Qiao Nian didn’t read any of this. After she finished following everyone in Class A’s group chat, she quietly logged out of Weibo and didn’t read the rest.","Nie Mi called her at this time.","“Hello.”","Qiao Nian’s voice was rather hoarse, mainly because she hadn’t rested well in the past few days. She was very tired.","She might not have picked up the call if it was someone else calling.","“Nian Nian, were you asleep?” Nie Mi’s voice was as strong as ever, but it was very gentle. He was obviously concerned about her.","Qiao Nian casually closed her laptop and walked towards the bed, grabbing a book from the bookshelf.","She put the phone to her ear and slowly answered, “No. I was about to go to bed.”","“Oh.”","Qiao Nian placed the book on the bedside table, turned on the bedside lamp, and asked, “What’s the matter?”","“I do have something for you.”","Nie Mi knew that she had been busy recently, so he didn’t waste any time. He briefly explained why he was looking for her. Finally, he asked, “So, are you interested?”","Qiao Nian held her phone in one hand and stood rooted to the ground. She didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. Instead of answering him immediately, she asked in a low and hoarse voice, “You want me to go to the independent continent to participate in the annual exchange?”","She had never expected Nie Mi to look for her about this.","How should she put it?","It was quite unexpected.","Qiao Nian’s eyes rippled with mockery.","Jiang Xianrou tried her best to go to the independent continent and even tried to please Qi Yan. She wanted to use the Qi family’s power to obtain a spot in the Pharmacy Association... However, she didn’t know that the Pharmacy Association wasn’t the only one that had a spot in the independent continent. There were also spots in the country.","Moreover, the Pharmacy Association only had one slot.","But at least it had a reputation!","It wasn’t like what Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru thought. Only overseas countries had such opportunities.","“Are you going?”","Nie Mi was worried that she would miss this good opportunity, so he added, “Master Cheng, Principal Liang, and I have discussed this for a long time and decided to give this spot to you. You’re the best among the younger generation in the country. This trip to the independent continent is a good opportunity to show off. We have also thought about others, but I have decided that you are more suitable to represent the country.”","Liang Conglin and Nie Mi had actually considered Jiang Xianrou at the beginning.","Firstly, she was a few years older than Qiao Nian and had more experience.","Secondly, her brother, Jiang Yao, was from Tian Chen. Tian Chen was one of the top forces in the illegal district and was also quite famous in the independent continent.","Putting these two points together, although Jiang Xianrou’s character was not good, she was indeed a more suitable candidate.","Qiao Nian... was only a freshman!","Nie Mi was worried that she would attract too much attention and cause unnecessary trouble.","Only, plans fell short of change.","They didn’t expect Jiang Xianrou to successfully climb up the ranks and enter the Pharmacy Association. Now, she was relying on the Association to get a spot in the independent continent.","If they went to look for Jiang Xianrou at this time, it would seem like they couldn’t keep her in the country. They would be courting death!","There was another very important reason. Master Cheng didn’t think that Jiang Xianrou would go to the independent continent on the country’s behalf.","It was said that her personality was too ostentatious and she couldn’t keep her composure. She was too proud and complacent... Jiang Xianrou might cause trouble if she went to the independent continent."]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 Master Nie Accidentally Revealed the Truth","paragraphs":["1570 Master Nie Accidentally Revealed the Truth","They also needed to consider the opinion of the Master.","Therefore, Jiang Xianrou was eliminated in the end.","“Nian Nian, you don’t have to worry too much about the danger of going to the independent continent. This time, Master Cheng and I will be leading the team. Your father will be going, too. We will definitely protect you no matter what happens,” Nie Mi said seriously.","Unfortunately, he couldn’t see how calm the girl on the other end of the phone was. She even rubbed her temples helplessly and said in a casual tone, “Uh, I’m not worried about that.”","!!","“Are you going, then?”","Qiao Nian beat him to it. “I’m not sure yet. We’ll see. You’re not going immediately. I’ll tell you half a month in advance.”","“... Alright.”","“Yes, I’ll hang up now. I’m sleepy.”","Nie Mi smiled and said gently, “Sleep if you’re tired. I won’t disturb you anymore. Bye.”","...","In the office of the principal of Qing University.","The old man hung up and walked back.","“How is it?” Liang Conglin had been waiting for his results. Seeing that he had finished his call with Qiao Nian, he immediately went up to him and asked, “Master Nie, what did Qiao Nian say?”","Nie Mi was wearing a new suit and looked very energetic. He walked back with his phone and glanced at the impatient Liang Conglin, then said unhurriedly, “Nian Nian said that she can’t decide immediately. She still has to consider it.”","“I see.”","Liang Conglin was a little disappointed. He had mixed feelings. A spot to go to the independent continent with the top masters was so precious. Even if such a spot was placed in front of the top families in Beijing, no one would be able to consider it like Qiao Nian.","But...","Liang Conglin felt that it was normal for Qiao Nian to consider such a matter.","She seemed to have always been this calm and collected. However, she would definitely do her best as long as she agreed to something.","“Nian Nian has a lot of things to do and is usually quite busy. She probably wants to see if she has time, so let her consider it,” Nie Mi said.","He had wanted to tell the other party that Qiao Nian had agreed to tell him half a month in advance.","The words were on his lips, but Nie Mi suddenly realized that something was wrong. He frowned and suddenly looked at Liang Conglin with a burning gaze, then said in a deep voice, “No, how does she know when the independent continent will hold the exchange?”","Liang Conglin was confused. He touched the bridge of his nose and looked at him in confusion. “Master Nie, what are you talking about? How did who know...?”","Nie Mi stopped talking.","He was too shocked, but at the same time, he felt that it was unlikely that Qiao Nian would have anything to do with the independent continent.","He had indeed not mentioned the time to Qiao Nian.","However, Qiao Nian told him that she would tell him half a month in advance.","Nie Mi was at a loss for words.","Nian Nian wouldn’t know when the annual exchange meeting was held on the independent continent, right?","... Surely not?","...","A few days later, in the early evening.","At the Jiang family villa.","Qi Yan looked for Tang Wanru almost without invitation. The past few days of physical and mental torture had long worn down her sharpness. She barely spoke. After making her intentions clear, she placed the things Qiao Nian had given her on the coffee table in the Jiang family’s living room.","“President Jiang, Mrs. Jiang, take a look.”","It was rare for Jiang Zongnan to be at home. Upon hearing that Qi Yan was visiting, he even came out of the study to entertain her.","Hearing this, he frowned and looked at the stack of papers on the table. “What is this?” he asked, not understanding."]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 Trying to Help the Qi Family","paragraphs":["1571 Trying to Help the Qi Family","Qi Yan sat on the sofa and drank the black tea the servant poured for her. She put down the teacup and rubbed her eyebrows, then said to the man, “President Jiang, take a look at this first. I’ll wait for you to finish reading it.”","Jiang Zongnan was even more puzzled, but he still picked up the stack of papers on the table and looked at them.","Tang Wanru was beside him. She didn’t look at the documents and even chatted with Qi Yan with a smile. “Have you settled your family matters? You left in a hurry that day. I was too embarrassed to call you to ask about it...”","Qi Yan glanced at her casually and quickly hid the sarcasm in her eyes. Pretending to have a headache, she massaged her temples and sighed. “Not yet. It’s a long story.”","“What’s wrong?” Tang Wanru asked with concern. “Do you need our help...”","She had yet to finish speaking when Jiang Zongnan suddenly interrupted her. “What does the Qi family mean?”","His tone was grave and irrepressible. His tone was exceptionally rude.","“Hubby, what are you doing?” Tang Wanru was shocked and subconsciously turned her head. She even secretly elbowed the middle-aged man and threw him a look. “We’re all family. The Countess is Xianrou’s godmother. If you have anything to say, just say it properly.”","Jiang Zongnan ignored her. His refined face was filled with dark clouds. Unable to suppress his anger, he threw the document to her and said, “Take a look at it yourself.”","“What is it?” Curious, Tang Wanru grabbed the document and looked down.","Her face suddenly changed, and she couldn’t say a word.","“Well...”","Tang Wanru was stunned. She looked at the document in disbelief. The piece of paper she was holding happened to be the record of the Qi family’s driver transferring the money to Yao Yu.","In other words, the Qi family was related to Jiang Li’s ‘accident’!","Tang Wanru didn’t dare to continue reading. She was afraid that if she did, it would implicate more things... However, Xianrou had just entered the Pharmacy Association, and they still needed Qi Yan’s help.","Once this was exposed, would Xianrou’s trip to the independent continent still count?","Tang Wanru was thinking about Jiang Xianrou and didn’t even think about Jiang Li.","Her expression changed again and again. Her hold on the document tightened and she breathed heavily. She forced out a sentence to break the tense atmosphere in the living room. “This should be fake, right? How did the Qi family... get involved in Jiang Li’s accident? Who gave you this? Qiao Nian?”","At the thought of this, Tang Wanru frowned and relaxed. She heaved a sigh of relief, her chest still tight. “Qiao Nian is used to doing these things. You can’t take what she gives you seriously!”","Tang Wanru was defending the Qi family the entire time. She just wanted to pull the Qi family and Qi Yan out of Jiang Li’s ‘accident’ as soon as possible.","Qi Yan had no intention of cooperating with her. She looked right at Jiang Zongnan and said with sincerity, “President Jiang, I was wrong in this matter. I didn’t educate my child well enough to let Lanyin do such a thing. I’ll definitely teach her a lesson later. But I have something to ask of you. Can you tell Qiao Nian to release Lanyin first?”","Jiang Zongnan’s face was tense the entire time, and his expression was cold.","Hearing this, he was surprised and looked at Qi Yan. “What did you say? Nian Nian?”"]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 Qiao Nian Has the Ability","paragraphs":["1572 Qiao Nian Has the Ability","“Qiao Nian got someone to kidnap Lanyin.” Qi Yan had no choice but to explain the situation in the past few days anxiously. “I called her previously and apologized to her, but she insisted that the Qi family compensate her with one billion yuan. Otherwise, she will kill the hostage.”","One billion!","Not to mention Tang Wanru, even the knowledgeable Jiang Zongnan was shocked.","Nian Nian wanted Qi Yan to compensate one billion yuan?","“It’s true that we couldn’t come up with a billion. We pooled 300 million that day and wired it into the account she said. She didn’t answer when I called her a few days later, and there was no news from Lanyin... It’s been five days since the welcoming banquet.”","Qi Yan supported her forehead with her hand, looking like she had a headache. She looked up at Jiang Zongnan and said sincerely, “President Jiang, we’ve already given you the money. One billion is too much. We can’t take out that much money in a short period of time. I can’t find Qiao Nian. Can you please go and talk to her?”","Jiang Zongnan still felt that this matter was too fantastical.","It was even more mysterious than Jiang Li’s ‘accident’ being related to the Qi family.","He didn’t come back to his senses for a long time. It wasn’t until Qi Yan called him again that he barely pulled himself out of his stunned state.","However, his reaction was very real. Jiang Zongnan frowned and shook his head. “How can Nian Nian be so capable? You’re exaggerating. Qi Lanyin’s disappearance mustn’t have anything to do with Nian Nian. She’s in Beijing and hasn’t gone overseas for the past few days. How can she find someone to kidnap Qi Lanyin in Country M?”","Not even he could do that.","Qiao Nian...?","Nian Nian was only so old.","Jiang Zongnan instinctively denied Qi Yan’s accusation.","Qi Yan smiled as if she was laughing at their naivety. “President Jiang, don’t tell me you still don’t know?”","“...Know what?” Jiang Zongnan’s heart skipped a beat. He vaguely felt that she was about to reveal something big.","At this point, Qi Yan had nothing to hide. “Qiao Nian is Sun of the Red Alliance. Don’t tell me no one in your family knows about this!”","Her words were undoubtedly a bombshell in the living room. Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru were dumbfounded.","Jiang Xianrou happened to come back from outside at this moment and heard what Qi Yan said.","Qiao Nian was Sun from the Red Alliance?","It was like a bolt from the blue. All the color drained from her beautiful face. Even her lips were pale and weak. Something fell to the ground, and she forgot to pick it up.","Jiang Xianrou was a little flustered, but she felt as if a huge rock was pressing down on her heart, making it difficult for her to breathe.","She took a few deep breaths before pinching her palms and forcing herself to calm down. She walked over and greeted Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru generously, “Dad, Mom, I’m back.”","Then, she looked at Qi Yan, who was sitting on the sofa opposite her, and said respectfully, “Godmother.”","Qi Yan had no time to pay attention to her. She only nodded.","Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru didn’t even acknowledge her. They were still immersed in Qi Yan’s revelation.","“In addition, the founder of your country’s Cheng Feng Corporation, Yuan Yongqin, is also inextricably linked to her.” Qi Yan straightened her clothes and continued, “Cheng Feng Corporation has three partners. One of them is Yuan Yongqin, who everyone knows is on the table. The other is the young master of the Wei Family, Wei Lou. Have you thought about who the remaining person is?”"]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 Too Many of Sister Nian’s Identities Were Exposed","paragraphs":["1573 Too Many of Sister Nian’s Identities Were Exposed","Jiang Zongnan doubted his ears and stared at her with a burning gaze. “You mean... the remaining partner of Cheng Feng Corporation is Nian Nian?”","This was too... bizarre!","But on second thought, it all made sense.","Back when Qiao Nian had just arrived in Beijing, they had held a school promotion banquet for her. Xianrou had been unwilling to go and almost made a fool of herself.","That afternoon, many people came to attend the school promotion banquet. The first person to arrive was Yuan Yongqin, the CEO of Cheng Feng Corporation.","At that time, he wondered why she had come.","After that, more people came.","Jiang Zongnan carefully recalled the people who came that day and suddenly realized that all the top circles in Beijing had come!","And those people were only there to attend a school promotion banquet for an ordinary high school girl from Rao City.","He hadn’t given it much thought that time. He’d assumed that Ye Wangchuan had called them. Now that he thought about it, he could see that it wasn’t that at all.","The Yuan family had no dealings with the Ye family.","He had never heard that Yuan Yongqin knew Ye Wangchuan, either.","The two of them were not in the same generation and had almost no overlapping social circles.","In other words, Yuan Yongqin did not come because of Ye Wangchuan, but because of Nian Nian!","Jiang Zongnan took a deep breath but still couldn’t calm the complicated emotions surging in his chest. He simply gave up controlling his expression, and it indescribably transformed. He said, “It’s useless for you to tell me this. Do you think Nian Nian will listen to me? You can’t find her, and neither can I. She won’t listen to me or see me.”","He couldn’t even get through to Qiao Nian’s phone, let alone get her to listen to him.","Qi Yan had found the wrong person.","However, Qi Yan was very confident. “I know Qiao Nian. She’s not as cold as she looks. If you’re willing to look for her, she might listen to you.”","Tang Wanru immediately looked at him.","However, Jiang Zongnan didn’t even frown. He said indifferently, “Even if she’s willing to listen to me, I won’t look for her.”","Qi Yan frowned.","Jiang Zongnan’s voice was extremely cold. “Countess, Jiang Li is my son. He almost lost his life in an accident! Although the Jiang family doesn’t have as many connections as the Qi family, we’re not spineless. I’ll find a way to return the 300 million to you myself. As for the rest, I’ll find a lawyer and go through the legal procedures.”","300 million was not a small amount. No matter how big a company was, it might not have so much liquidity.","However, Jiang Zongnan’s attitude was neither servile nor overbearing. It was obvious that he was determined to return the money to her.","Qi Yan couldn’t smile anymore, and her expression faded. She leaned back on the sofa and changed her sincere attitude, as if she had become a different person. She said forcefully, “President Jiang, I’m only willing to discuss this with you because of Xianrou. It’s not impossible. You want to go through the legal process, right? Sure. Lanyin is involved in the crime of intentional assault. Is there no problem with Qiao Nian? Do you know how many years she will be sentenced to for kidnapping?”","Sure enough, Jiang Zongnan’s expression suddenly changed.","Only then did Qi Yan heave a sigh of relief.","She said coldly, “I don’t mind if you want to go through legal procedures. Our Qi family also knows a few internationally famous lawyers. At most, we’ll go to court. Lanyin is from Country M, so I can still apply for extradition. At that time, you’ll be the ones who suffer.”"]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 You Can Consult a Lawyer","paragraphs":["1574 You Can Consult a Lawyer","She had always had amazing skills. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been called the Iron Lady by Country M.","Qi Yan first showed her iron rod, then immediately changed to a gentle tone.","She said nicely, “President Jiang, Xianrou has just entered the Pharmacy Association and has a bright future ahead of her. The Pharmacy Association is also in Country M. In the future, our two families will have many opportunities to interact with each other. There’s no need for you to make things worse. The opportunity to go to the independent continent this time... I’ve mentioned it to Elder Zhong. Xianrou has a high chance of going, but as you know, there will still be variables as long as these things are not announced.","“This opportunity today is delicate. Who knows who will get it tomorrow.” Qi Yan played with her fingernails in a good mood. “After all, there are a few new members of the Pharmacy Association this year. Everyone is competing for this spot.”","!!","Jiang Xianrou bit her lip and looked at her father impatiently.","She didn’t want to care what Jiang Li and Qiao Nian did. Anything was fine as long as it didn’t affect her going to the independent continent! Besides, wasn’t Jiang Li fine?","However, Jiang Zongnan didn’t look in her direction and was not very convinced by Qi Yan’s words. He only said, “I need to think about it.”","Worried about Qi Lanyin’s safety, Qi Yan wanted to strike while the iron was hot and force him to relent.","Unexpectedly, Jiang Zongnan was even more domineering than she had imagined. Without giving her a chance to speak, he stood up and instructed, “That’s all. Send the guest out.","“Countess, I’m a little tired. Please leave.”","His attitude...","Qi Yan had never been rejected like this before. She stood up hatefully and picked up her bag. Before she left, she didn’t forget to remind him, “President Jiang, you can find a lawyer to consult about the crime of kidnapping and extortion. The Jiang family still has some face in Beijing. We’ll just lose face overseas if this matter blows up, but you guys will lose more face than us.”","After saying that, she swaggered away under Jiang Zongnan’s furious gaze.","...","“Dad.” Jiang Xianrou called out to him as soon as Qi Yan left.","Jiang Zongnan looked like he had a headache and a fever. He waved his hand at her and said, “Stop talking. I have to think about it. Your brother was almost killed by someone and is still lying in the hospital bed. Even if Nian Nian did those things, it was to vent your brother’s anger. She has always been on good terms with your brother, so it’s normal for her to be angry. I have to think about how this matter can be handled.”","Jiang Xianrou clenched her fists and took a deep breath. She really wanted to ask him if he had considered what to do if he fell out with the Qi family.","What about the spot in the independent continent?","However, Jiang Zongnan did not give her a chance. Thinking of something, he picked up his coat and said to Tang Wanru, “I’m going to the sanatorium. You guys can have dinner by yourselves. Don’t wait for me. I don’t know when I’ll be back.”","After giving his instructions, he left the house in a hurry.","Tang Wanru was relatively calm the entire time. Hearing Jiang Zongnan’s car drive away, she reached out and placed her hand on Jiang Xianrou’s shoulder comfortingly. Her expression was sinister as she said in a low voice, “Don’t be anxious. I’ll tell your brother. She listens to your brother the most. As long as your brother tells her not to interfere, she definitely won’t cause trouble again.”","Jiang Xianrou’s shoulders finally relaxed. She nodded and pinched her fingernails as she looked in the direction Qi Yan had left. There was still some regret in her eyes.","If the Qi family could deal with Qiao Nian this time... that would be great!"]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 Face Slap, Miss Qiao Won’t Let You Up","paragraphs":["1575 Face Slap, Miss Qiao Won’t Let You Up","Tang Wanru was worried that Qi Yan would change her mind at the last minute and not give Jiang Xianrou the spot to go to the independent continent. She went upstairs to change her clothes and called the chauffeur. Then, she told him to drive to the hospital.","She thought that she would be able to meet Jiang Li successfully and then follow her initial plan to restrain Qiao Nian through him.","Unexpectedly, Tang Wanru was stopped before she could enter the inpatient department.","“I’m sorry, Madam. You can’t go in.” A bodyguard in black with his arms crossed blocked her way, and his tall body blocked her path like an iron tower.","Tang Wanru’s expression changed. Tightening her grip on her handbag, she frowned and said coldly, “I’m going in to see my son. Why won’t you let me in?”","“Your son?” The bodyguard in black didn’t seem to know her. He looked her up and down and looked slightly hesitant.","Tang Wanru took a deep breath and said coldly, “Jiang Li is my son.”","The bodyguard looked at her outfit again.","Before Tang Wanru left, she especially changed her clothes and put on makeup.","She had taken good care of herself. With makeup on, she looked even younger and more energetic. She didn’t look like the kind of mother whose son was lying in the hospital bed.","This was because the bodyguard did not see any worry on her face.","It felt as if Jiang Li wasn’t her son but someone she knew. She was just here to visit him fashionably and elegantly.","Seeing that he didn’t say anything and kept sizing her up, Tang Wanru frowned again and asked patiently, “Are you guys from Jiang Li’s company? How could they arrange for security without telling me beforehand and keep me out?” She took her phone out of her handbag to call Jiang Li’s agent. “I’ll call your boss and tell him.”","The bodyguard had no intention of moving away upon seeing that Tang Wanru was about to make a call. Instead, he stood rooted to the ground and said coldly, “We’re not from his company. We’re people arranged by Miss Qiao. Miss Qiao said that other than her and the doctor, no one else can go in during this period of time. It’s useless for you to call the management company. If you want to go up, you have to get Miss Qiao’s permission!”","“Who... did you say?” Tang Wanru slowly put down her phone and looked at the bodyguard in black in shock. Her face darkened. “Qiao Nian? What right does she have?”","This was the first time she had heard that a mother needed an outsider’s permission to see her son.","Funny!","How ridiculous!","Tang Wanru was furious this time. She gritted her teeth and pushed the bodyguard’s hand away, wanting to barge in. “I’m Jiang Li’s biological mother. Why should I get her permission to see him? Get out of the way! It’s none of her business!”","“Madam, please show some respect!”","The bodyguard’s height and strength were obvious. How strong could a woman like Tang Wanru be? She tried to barge in several times but was stopped.","She gritted her teeth and glared. “I’m Jiang Li’s mother!”","“We don’t care about that. We only listen to orders.” The bodyguard still looked stubborn and did not give Tang Wanru any face at all. “Miss Qiao said that other than her and Young Master Jiang’s medical staff, I’m not to let anyone in for the next few days. Not even you.”"]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 Oh, She Even Called the Police?","paragraphs":["1576 Oh, She Even Called the Police?","Tang Wanru was so angry that she laughed. She gritted her teeth and her temples bulged, even her hand shook. “You won’t let me in, right? Alright, I’ll call the police and let them handle it.”","She immediately called the police. “Hello, 110? I’m in the in-patient section of the city hospital. The thing is...”","Tang Wanru called the police, but the black-clothed bodyguard completely ignored her actions and continued to block her way. It seemed that as long as Tang Wanru did not try to barge in, it did not matter how much she threw a tantrum.","The police took the call very seriously and immediately said that they would send someone over.","Tang Wanru’s face turned gloomy as she hung up the call. She stood to the side and said coldly, “Heh, I’ve already called the police. I want to see if you still have the ability to stop me after the police arrive.”","The bodyguard in black didn’t even look at her. He purely treated it as her making a scene.","*","At the police station.","The young police officer who received Tang Wanru’s call picked up his cap and prepared to set off to see what was going on.","He was just about to leave when someone asked, “Where are you going?”","“Ah, I received a report that someone was causing trouble at the city hospital. I’m going to take a look.” The young officer was still very young. Thus, he told the truth.","His unconcerned superior grunted and strode inside.","The young officer continued on his way out.","Unexpectedly, at this moment, the man who was about to enter suddenly stopped and turned to ask him, “Which hospital did you say it was?”","The young officer was already leaving the office when he was called.","He scratched his head in confusion. “The Beijing People’s Hospital. They said that someone caused trouble in the in-patient department and stopped a mother from seeing her child. What’s wrong?”","His superior’s expression turned serious. “Stay out of this,” he said immediately. “It’s not our business.”","The young officer looked confused. “?”","Wasn’t it just an ordinary disturbance? Why couldn’t they control it?","His superiors didn’t explain because it was too complicated to explain in one or two sentences. “Just leave it for now. I’ll take care of it. I’ll make a call.”","“... Yes.”","The young officer went back to his seat with his cap in hand, feeling more and more confused. But he didn’t have time to think about it, because a new police call was about to come in and he needed to deal with something else. In a flash, he had already forgotten about the incident.","...","Rhine Apartments.","“Master Wang, your coffee.” Gu San made a cup of coffee and placed it in front of the man respectfully.","Ye Wangchuan was on the phone.","Gu San didn’t know who he was talking to, but he saw the man’s lips curl into a disdainful smile. His eyes were filled with mockery. “Oh, she even called the police?”","Gu San pricked up his ears and immediately looked over with a puzzled expression.","Who was it? Who called the police?","Ye Wangchuan did not look at him. His tone was indifferent, even a little cold. “Don’t worry about her. Let her cause trouble if she wants to. She’s just a clown.”","There was some silence.","Gu San became even more curious and wanted to crawl into the phone to hear what the other party was saying. He tilted his head in the man’s direction and listened attentively.","However, Ye Wangchuan only spoke briefly before hanging up. Then, he threw the phone on the sofa at the side, picked up the still steaming coffee, and took a sip."]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 The Qi Family Is Destined to Be Finished!","paragraphs":["1577 The Qi Family Is Destined to Be Finished!","Gu San asked shamelessly upon seeing that he was silent, “Master Wang, who called just now?”","Seeing that Ye Wangchuan was ignoring him, he continued, “Is someone causing trouble?”","The man who had been drinking his coffee slowly finally put down his cup and raised his eyelids. His dark eyes glanced at him and said lazily, “Don’t worry about it. It was just a f*cking fool.”","Gu San was speechless.","What?","Master Wang actually cursed. It seemed that the other party was really... a fool!","Gu San decided not to ask further. After all, there were many fools in society. Although he was curious, he was not too interested.","He turned to look at the person on the sofa and whispered, “Master Wang, the Qi family...”","Qi Yan and Qi Rongguang had been very active in the country recently. Through their connections, they wanted to transfer some businesses to the country and even found someone to buy land.","Usually, such foreign investors could easily get land when they came to invest locally.","However, the Hengfeng Corporation did not go well. They hadn’t been able to get the land they wanted.","Not long ago, Qi Yan had found the Shen family and was about to get approval through Shen Jingyan.","Who knew this would happen?","“The Qi family is still using their connections to get the land as soon as possible.” Gu San paused and said the rest of the sentence, “Master Wang, do you want to...”","“They can’t get that piece of land.” Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what he was going to say. His slender fingers fiddled with the coffee spoon lazily. “Bo Jingxing has already gone to settle it. Qi Yan will receive the news soon.”","Gu San originally wanted to remind him, worried that Ye Wangchuan had forgotten about this matter. He didn’t expect Master Wang to be so fast and ruthless.","He immediately fell silent.","Because there was no need to say anything.","The Qi family was doomed this time!","“Miss Qiao...” Gu San looked up at the second floor and seemed to have thought of something. “Miss Qiao has been out since this morning. Is she not back yet?”","Ye Wangchuan also looked up at the second floor, but he didn’t say anything. He only said lazily, “She went to the sanatorium to see Old Master Jiang.”","“Oh.”","Gu San closed his mouth and did not ask further.","Qiao Nian had to make a trip to the sanatorium from time to time. It was quite normal for her to return at random times. He looked down and said thoughtfully, “...Then, I’ll send a message to ask if Miss Qiao needs me to pick her up later.”","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him disdainfully and calmly folded his hands. He said in a very good-tempered tone, “There’s no need.”","Gu San: “?”","Ye Wangchuan looked at him lazily and said in a soothing tone, “I’ll go pick her up.”","*","Qiao Nian went to the sanatorium to deliver the small pills to Old Master Jiang.","After she arrived at the sanatorium, she was not in a hurry to leave. She pushed Old Master Jiang’s wheelchair out for a walk and chatted with the old man.","When they returned to the ward, Qiao Nian waited for the doctor to come over and take Jiang Weishang’s blood pressure. After the routine checkup, she picked up her things and prepared to leave.","Before she left, the young nurse outside came in and said to Jiang Weishang happily, “Old Master Jiang, President Jiang is here to see you.”","Qiao Nian’s eyes were cold. Without delay, she said to the old man on the bed, “Grandpa, I’ll leave first. Take care of yourself.”","“Ah, Nian Nian, you’re leaving?” Old Master Jiang looked reluctant. He wanted to say that her uncle was coming, but when he thought of what his youngest son had been doing recently, he relaxed his brows and didn’t even mention Jiang Zongnan. He nodded and said gently to the girl, “Alright, go back and rest early. Don’t stay up late, understand?”"]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 The Older, The Wiser","paragraphs":["1578 The Older, The Wiser","“Yes.” The girl was always very patient when she spoke to him. She nodded, took her things, and left.","Jiang Weishang reluctantly watched her leave. When Jiang Zongnan rushed in, his gentle expression disappeared and his face turned cold.","“What now?”","His attitude was completely different from how he treated Qiao Nian.","Jiang Zongnan knew that he was still angry. He rubbed his temples helplessly and entered the ward awkwardly. He told Old Master Jiang everything.","Including Qi Yan’s visit today.","He tried to keep it simple so that Old Master Jiang wouldn’t be angry.","However, Old Master Jiang was still furious after hearing the entire story. His turbid but sharp eyes suddenly looked at him and asked, “Jiang Xianrou is your daughter and Jiang Yao is your son. What about Xiao Li? What is he in your heart?”","“Dad, that’s not what I meant.” Jiang Zongnan lowered his head awkwardly. “Jiang Li is also my son.”","“That’s enough.” Jiang Weishang didn’t listen to the rest of his words and interrupted him directly. “Since Jiang Li is your son and she’s already riding on your head to behave atrociously, don’t say that you’re from the Jiang family! Don’t hit her face. She’s about to smash your face. If you don’t have the ability to hit her back, don’t care how Nian Nian handles this matter.”","Jiang Zongnan blushed and knew that he had misunderstood him. He explained helplessly, “Dad, I don’t mean to reconcile. I’m just worried about Nian Nian. Qi Yan...”","“Heh.” Old Master Jiang seemed to have seen through everything. He wasn’t anxious at all. He looked at him and their eyes met. He said calmly, “You’re confused. If she can really control Nian Nian as she said, why would she come to you and tell you so much? Since she lowered herself to look for you, it means one thing—Nian Nian has suppressed her! Thus, she has no choice but to use you to control Nian Nian.”","Jiang Zongnan’s tense heart relaxed slightly, and his tightly furrowed brows relaxed. He sighed and said, “That’s good.”","Old Master Jiang looked at him. Seeing that he was not so biased that he didn’t even care about his son, he said, “In short, you still treat Xiao Li as your son. Don’t be too biased. Although the spot to go to the independent continent is precious, to be honest, what do you think she can do even if she goes?”","“I’m not strong enough. Even if I force my way in, I’ll only be a backdrop.” Old Master Jiang’s words were very impolite.","He did not name anyone, but Jiang Zongnan knew that he was talking about Jiang Xianrou. It was useless to say that she had squeezed into the Pharmacy Association.","In the past, Jiang Zongnan would definitely have argued, but this time, he was silent for a long time and finally did not refute Old Master Jiang’s words.","He also felt that it was useless even if Jiang Xianrou went to the independent continent.","The situation there was very complicated. It wasn’t a level that ordinary people could come into contact with. If Xianrou rashly came into contact with things that her strength should not come into contact with, she would easily suffer a backlash.","He had also mentioned this to his wife. Unfortunately, Tang Wanru was very determined and looked forward to Xianrou going there. In addition, Jiang Xianrou also wanted to go, so he couldn’t say too much.","Jiang Zongnan no longer insisted and changed the topic. “Then, Nian Nian...”","“You don’t have to worry about Nian Nian. She does things better than you.” Old Master Jiang was very straightforward and did not give him any face.","Jiang Zongnan was a little embarrassed, but he didn’t say anything."]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 Master Wang: We Don’t Need You to Cook","paragraphs":["1579 Master Wang: We Don’t Need You to Cook","Dressed in black, Qiao Nian slowly walked out of the sanatorium with one hand in her pocket.","Ye Wangchuan was leaning against the car on the side.","He didn’t fly his red-flagged car today. He switched to an SUV. The model was big and handsome. The car’s wild metal frame glowed silver under the lights.","It was quite eye-catching.","!!","But none of them were as eye-catching as the man leaning against the SUV.","Ye Wangchuan was wearing a black shirt today. The collar of the shirt was open, revealing a beautiful collarbone. It was as white as jade, and there was a seductive aura to it.","Qiao Nian stopped in her tracks and raised an eyebrow when she saw him. Her dark eyes looked in his direction.","However, she only took a deep look and quickly retracted her gaze. As if nothing had happened, she casually continued walking in his direction.","“Gu San didn’t come?”","Ye Wangchuan looked up and noticed that Qiao Nian had come out.","The girl was wearing a baseball cap. She was tall and uninhibited and smelled of disinfectant. It was obvious that she had stayed in the sanatorium with Old Master Jiang the entire day.","He opened the door, dropped the electronic cigarette back on the seat, and turned to open the door for the girl, his eyes relaxed. “Well, he’s got something to do. Get in first.”","“Oh.” Qiao Nian didn’t think too much about it. She nodded calmly, got into the front passenger seat, and put on her seatbelt.","Ye Wangchuan went around the car and got inside as well. After fastening his seatbelt, he adjusted the window for her to let in the fresh air. Then, he tilted his head and asked, “What do you want to eat tonight?”","“Erm...” Qiao Nian took out her phone hand and looked down at the message Nie Mi had sent her. Hearing this, she looked up again, her eyes dark and bright. She leaned against the window and propped her arm up. After thinking for a long time, she said casually, “I don’t know.”","“You don’t know?” Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but chuckle. He leaned back as well, as lazy as Qiao Nian. “Hot pot?”","The girl glanced his way. After a moment, she looked away, shook her head, and straightened. “I’m tired of eating hot pot.”","“Tsk.” Ye Wangchuan’s thin lips curled up. His deep eyes were like a cold lake as he looked at the person beside him. “I thought you would never get tired of eating hot pot.”","Qiao Nian pondered over his words and said in a rare serious tone, “No way. If I eat separately three times a week, I naturally won’t get tired of it. But I’ll get tired of it if I eat it every day.”","This explanation itself was quite a big shot.","But Ye Wangchuan didn’t say anything. He turned on the air conditioner and started the car, then said, “Then, we’ll eat at home. I’ll go to the supermarket and buy some groceries.”","Of course, Qiao Nian had no objections. She raised the corners of her eyes, looking rather attractive. “You’ll cook?”","Ye Wangchuan’s gaze fell from her flamboyant eyes to her moist red lips. He paused for a moment before looking away and replying lazily, “Why don’t you cook for me personally?”","Qiao Nian was very calm. She glanced at him indifferently, raised her hands, and said frankly, “If you don’t mind having tomato scrambled eggs.”","Ye Wangchuan smiled and rubbed the top of her head. It was itchy and tingly. He reluctantly withdrew his hand, gripped the steering wheel again, and floored the accelerator. “We don’t need you to cook at home.”","His voice was lazy but full of affection. “What do you want to eat? I’ll make it for you.”","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and glanced at him through the rearview mirror. After a while, she replied in a clear voice, “I’ll eat whatever you make.”","Thinking for a moment, she raised her eyebrows and added casually, “I’m not picky.”"]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 Two Visits in Three Days","paragraphs":["1580 Two Visits in Three Days","Ye Wangchuan glanced lazily over at her again. His lips were curled up, but he didn’t expose her.","Qiao Nian wasn’t picky?","Eh?","Sort of, but not really.","!!","She was quite indifferent when she went out to eat with the others.","She would always eat less if the table was filled with dishes she didn’t like, but she never complained.","But she preferred spicy food when she ordered.","Qiao Nian preferred Sichuan Cuisine, such as Boiled Fish and Spicy Chicken.","Qiao Nian would always order these dishes whenever she ordered.","She never got tired of these dishes.","Just like she liked hot pot. Basically, if you let her choose, nine times out of ten she’d choose hot pot.","The wheels rolled through the night.","Ye Wangchuan drove to a supermarket not far from the apartment to buy fish and vegetables. Then, he drove back to Rhine with Qiao Nian.","He made boiled fish for dinner.","Because he had bought fresh Sichuan peppercorns from the supermarket, Qiao Nian was able to eat a hearty meal of boiled fish. She even ate a little more than usual.","After dinner, Qiao Nian took the initiative to clean up the dishes. After taking a call, she returned to the second floor to take a shower.","*","The Qi family’s downfall was faster than expected.","Qi Yan came to visit again three days later.","It was still the Jiang family’s house and the original living room. Qi Yan sat on the sofa with a haggard expression, looking much older.","Jiang Zongnan, Tang Wanru, and Jiang Xianrou were all present today.","Jiang Yao was also at home.","With a guest visiting, Jiang Yao also walked out of the study with his father and accompanied him and his mother to receive Qi Yan.","“President Jiang, Mrs. Jiang.”","Qi Yan was obviously haggard this time. Her face was pale, and the greenish-brown color under her eyelids showed that she had not slept well for a long time.","Jiang Xianrou’s heart skipped a beat when she saw her haggard appearance.","Qi Yan wasn’t in the mood to pay attention to how others looked at her. She was already in a pinch. Seeing Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao coming down, she said impatiently, “I’ll get straight to the point. President Jiang, what do I have to do for you to help me?”","Jiang Yao had just returned from the illegal district and things were not going well. He didn’t even see Lu Zhi. Thus, he could only return, helpless.","He still didn’t know what was happening at home. He turned to his father and asked, “Dad, what happened? What favor?”","Jiang Zongnan didn’t know how to tell him about what happened to Jiang Li for a moment.","He shook his head and temporarily suppressed his urge to explain to him. He had to deal with Qi Yan first.","Jiang Zongnan was also very direct. “Countess, it’s not that I’m unwilling to help you, but I can’t help you. Jiang Li is my son. He’s still lying in the hospital bed. How can I help you?”","Qi Yan took a deep breath. She couldn’t care less. First, she laid out her conditions. She took out a piece of paper from her handbag and pushed it in front of the four of them, then said concisely, “This is the transfer of 10% of Hengfeng Corporation’s shares. I’m willing to transfer these shares to your son. In addition, doesn’t Xianrou want to take the spot to the independent continent? I’ll step in and help her get it. I only need President Jiang to help me tell Qiao Nian to be magnanimous and let the Qi family off. How about that?”","She pushed the share transfer agreement to Jiang Zongnan. Her attitude was humble and sincere.","It was as if she was not the same person who had threatened Jiang Zongnan three days ago to get a lawyer to ask how many years Qiao Nian would be sentenced to for kidnapping."]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 Offered a Condition That’s Hard to Reject","paragraphs":["1581 Offered a Condition That’s Hard to Reject","Qi Yan had been forced into a corner for the past few days. Seeing that Jiang Zongnan didn’t express himself immediately, she gritted her teeth and took a deep breath. She lowered her posture even more and said in a low voice, “President Jiang, this is the greatest sincerity I can show!”","Jiang Zongnan was stunned for a long time before he finally came back to his senses. He first looked at the anxious Qi Yan with a complicated expression, then looked at the share transfer letter. After a long while, he found his voice and said dryly, “I’ve said it before. It’s not that I’m unwilling. I can’t control Nian Nian, and she won’t listen to me.”","Qi Yan couldn’t care less anymore. She thought that Jiang Zongnan was still avoiding her, so she simply said, “President Jiang, let me tell you the truth. The Qi family’s situation has been very bad these few days. First, our land purchase plan was rejected, and then there was a problem with the company’s business. The Qi family can be said to be in a mess now.”","She looked up at Jiang Zongnan and said with a heavy heart, “Have you heard about a mysterious diamond big shot in the illegal district?”","“Is this matter related to the illegal district again?” Jiang Zongnan frowned.","“Yes.”","Qi Yan didn’t want to say this either, but the Qi family had suffered quite a blow in the past few days. The Qi family would be finished if Qiao Nian refused to stop.","“I told you that Qiao Nian is from the Red Alliance, and she’s the legendary number one hacker in the Alliance, Sun. I now suspect that the diamond big shot Q is also related to her. As for what their relationship is, I’m not sure either! During this period of time, the other party has been targeting the Qi family’s business. We were caught off guard by them, and several branches of the family have already encountered financial problems.”","She was a profit-oriented person. She also liked to convince people through profit.","“Although we are on the verge of collapse, President Jiang, don’t forget that I’m still a member of the Qi family. As long as I’m still in Country M and a member of the royal family, there are still many things I can do to help with my connections.” Qi Yan’s expression was gloomy, but she spoke quickly. “President Jiang, this is a sure-win deal. Even if our family did something wrong first, we’ve already shown our sincerity. There’s really no need for the two families to become mortal enemies, right?”","Qi Yan’s words were much more convincing than a few days ago. At the very least, she no longer spoke to others highly and mighty.","Qi Yan lowered her posture and looked at Jiang Zongnan. She said in a low voice, “President Jiang, please consider it.”","Jiang Zongnan did not agree to her offer. He only wavered slightly and remembered what Old Master Jiang had said. He still shook his head and said, “Countess, although Jiang Li is my son, I can’t forgive anyone on his behalf.”","Qi Yan’s eyes had been red for the past few days. Hearing his rejection, she panicked and almost stood up. She emphasized again, “President Jiang, I don’t need you to forgive the Qi family on Young Master Jiang’s behalf. I just want you to communicate with Qiao Nian about this...”","Jiang Zongnan waved his hand and interrupted her. He still had the same attitude and insisted on his bottom line. “I can’t interfere in this matter.”","Jiang Xianrou saw Qi Yan sit back on the sofa in disappointment and thought of the opportunity to go to the Independent Continent. She bit her lip, her heart beating very fast. She wished she could agree to Qi Yan’s conditions on her father’s behalf.","Unfortunately, it wasn’t her turn to speak in this situation. She knew that if Jiang Zongnan couldn’t call Qiao Nian out, she wouldn’t be able to make Qiao Nian listen to her.","She thought for a moment, and a haze appeared in her eyes. She clenched her fists quietly, walked to Jiang Yao’s side, and whispered to him, “Brother, I’m not feeling well. I’ll go back to my room first.”"]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 Don’t Tell Qiao Nian That I Said It","paragraphs":["1582 Don’t Tell Qiao Nian That I Said It","Jiang Yao had yet to figure out what Qi Yan was doing here. Why was Jiang Li’s matter related to the Qi family? Why did Qi Yan come knocking on his door and ask his family to convince Qiao Nian? Therefore, when Jiang Xianrou told him that she was feeling unwell and wanted to go upstairs to rest, he didn’t ask further and let her go upstairs.","Jiang Xianrou took a few glances at the living room, pursed her lips, and turned around to go upstairs.","She closed the door after returning to her room. She didn’t rest like she told Jiang Yao. Instead, she found her phone that was charging at the bedside and found Jiang Li’s number.","Jiang Xianrou hesitated for a few seconds, but her ambition exceeded all her thoughts at this moment. She gritted her teeth and called him.","*","At the hospital.","Jiang Li had been lying in bed for ten days and was finally able to sit up with the help of the nurse. The nurse helped him turn the bed up and then handed him the remote control of the television. She said with a smile, “Young Master Jiang, watch the television before Mr. Huang comes over to change your dressing.”","Mr. Huang rushed over the day after Jiang Li was hospitalized. The rest of his reconstruction was taken over by him.","Mr. Huang was highly respected in the medical world. He was willing to personally treat the patient. The doctors and nurses in the hospital were all excited.","Recently, Jiang Li’s ward was the favorite place for doctors and nurses to clock in. Everyone wanted to have the honor of meeting the top figure in their industry.","This kind of pure admiration and pursuit of academia was not the same as chasing stars.","Jiang Li was used to being chased by fans. This time, he was being watched like a gorilla in a zoo experiment. He was quite calm.","He ate and drank and didn’t think much every day.","Only then did the nurse push the cart out.","He was idly changing the channels when his phone rang.","Jiang Li picked it up and looked down.","He saw Jiang Xianrou’s caller ID.","He wasn’t thinking much. It wasn’t convenient to connect his injured hand, so he turned on the speaker and said in a relaxed tone, “Hello.”","“Do you know that Qiao Nian kidnapped Qi Lanyin because of you?” As soon as the call went through, Jiang Xianrou’s cold voice sounded from the other end.","Jiang Li’s expression changed. The color drained from his face. He tried to sit up, but it involved his injury. He fell back down in pain, but his voice was anxious. “What did you say? What do you mean?”","Jiang Xianrou said to him coldly, “Qiao Nian kidnapped Qi Lanyin because of you. The Qi family came to Dad and said that they wanted to go through legal procedures. Jiang Li, do you know how many years she’ll be sentenced to for kidnapping?”","Jiang Li was speechless. His pupils trembled violently.","He had never expected Qiao Nian to challenge the Qi family just to avenge him.","Jiang Xianrou’s angry voice came from the other end of the phone again. Although she tried her best to make her voice sound calm, it was actually filled with resentment. “... I advise you to tell Qiao Nian to let her go as soon as possible. Don’t blow this matter up. If the Qi family really wants to go through the legal process with her, she’ll be the only one to suffer!","“I told her it was useless for Mom and Dad to talk to her. She won’t listen to us. She’ll only listen if you talk to her.”","After Jiang Xianrou finished speaking, she lowered her voice and emphasized, “Remember, don’t say that I told you. I don’t want to provoke a lunatic like her.”"]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 Sister Nian Saw Through Everything!","paragraphs":["1583 Sister Nian Saw Through Everything!","Half an hour later.","Rhine Apartments.","Qiao Nian had just woken up, her eyes still filled with anger. She had been woken up by Jiang Li’s call. She hadn’t slept well last night, so she felt a sharp pain in the back of her head upon being woken up in the morning.","“Hello.” Qiao Nian pulled out the chair beside the desk and sat down. As it was a call from Jiang Li, her attitude was quite good. At least she didn’t blame him for waking her.","“Nian Nian...” Jiang Li found it difficult to speak.","Qiao Nian sat there patiently with her arm propped up on her elbow. Seeing the water bottle from the corner of her eye, she clutched the phone to her ear, reached for the bottle, and unscrewed the cap. She tilted her head back and gulped down a mouthful of water, finally moistening her dry throat. “You wanted to see me?”","The girl’s voice sounded much brighter. At least, it did not sound dry and hoarse.","Jiang Li had mixed feelings when he heard her voice. After a long time, he took a deep breath and asked her, “I-I heard that you kidnapped Qi Lanyin. Is that true?”","Qiao Nian had been playing with the bottle cap with one hand. Hearing this, her eyes turned cold. Instead of answering his question, she asked him, “Who told you that?”","Jiang Li became more worried. “Never mind who told me. Just tell me if it’s true.”","Qiao Nian remained silent.","Jiang Li was extremely anxious in the hospital. He tried to get up from the bed again but failed. He hated himself for his incompetence. He gritted his teeth and said anxiously, “Nian Nian, listen to me. Don’t provoke the Qi family. They are very dangerous. That Qi Yan is not someone to be trifled with. Regardless of whether my matter has anything to do with the Qi family, don’t be rash. Wait for me to recover first. I’ll handle it. Be obedient, Nian Nian.”","Qiao Nian could hear the anxiety and worry in his voice, and her heart warmed. Her hostility was mostly suppressed. She still didn’t agree to Jiang Li’s request directly. Her slender and fair fingers tapped on the desk, and she asked impatiently, “Did Jiang Xianrou tell you that?”","Jiang Li immediately stammered as if someone had hit his pressure points. “She...”","Realizing that he was being led by the nose by Qiao Nian, he panicked. “Nian Nian, that’s not the main point. I’m worried that you’ll be alone...”","“What did Jiang Xianrou tell you?” Qiao Nian was quite insistent on this question. She asked casually, “Didn’t I get someone to guard the in-patient department? No one is allowed to visit you these few days.”","Jiang Li didn’t know why he had called. He couldn’t answer for a long time, and his aura was completely suppressed by Qiao Nian.","However, on second thought, Qiao Nian figured out how Jiang Xianrou had contacted Jiang Li. The corners of her lips curled up into a smile, but the smile didn’t reach her eyes. Her eyes were extremely dry. She threw the bottle cap on the table and leaned back. Her sitting posture was arrogant and lazy as she lowered her voice and said, “Let me guess. What did she tell you on the phone? She said that I provoked the Qi family. If I don’t kneel down and beg for mercy, the Qi family will deal with me. She asked you to persuade me to stop early so that I won’t be dealt with by the Qi family?”","Jiang Li was speechless.","Qiao Nian paused for a second. Seeing that he didn’t say anything, she knew that she had guessed correctly. She smiled again, her eyes wild and arrogant. “If I guess again, she also told you that I won’t listen to them. I’ll only listen to you, right?”"]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 Going to Settle Scores with Jiang Xianrou","paragraphs":["1584 Going to Settle Scores with Jiang Xianrou","Jiang Li could almost see the ruthlessness in the girl’s eyes through the phone. He knew that Jiang Xianrou had angered her again.","He immediately cowered and said vaguely, “Nian Nian, don’t care what she says. I’m not calling you because she said so. Don’t provoke the Qi family because of me. They are not to be trifled with. That Qi Yan is unyielding. You’ll suffer if you provoke her. Also, is Qi Lanyin with you? Ask your friend to let her go. What if she goes through the legal procedures...”","Qiao Nian smiled, her eyes relaxed and casual. “What if she goes through legal procedures?”","“What if she goes through the legal process and you...” Jiang Li didn’t know what to say.","Qiao Nian spoke up for him. “Jiang Xianrou also told you that Qi Yan was prepared to go through legal procedures with me? Did she tell you how many years they were prepared to sentence me to? 10 years? 20 years? Or were they planning to imprison me for life...”","“She didn’t say that.”","Jiang Li shook his head and realized that he was being stupid again. He was on the phone and Qiao Nian wasn’t in the hospital, so how could she see his expression and actions? He added impatiently, “She just said that the Qi family is preparing to go through the legal procedures with you. I’m worried that you’ll suffer.”","Qiao Nian roughly understood what Jiang Xianrou had said to him. She replied lazily, “Brother, don’t worry about it. I’ll handle this matter.”","“Nian Nian, you...” Jiang Li was still worried about her.","However, Qiao Nian interrupted him rather valiantly. “I’ve never taken the Qi family seriously! If they want to go through the legal procedures, I welcome them at any time. I just don’t know if I’ll be the one going in for 10 or 20 years or if it’ll be one of them.”","Jiang Li couldn’t win against her at all, and his aura couldn’t suppress her.","Qiao Nian comforted him again, promising that she wouldn’t be rash. If anything happened in the future, she would tell him in advance.","Jiang Li hung up reluctantly.","Qiao Nian waited patiently for him to hang up before putting down her phone. She lowered her delicate eyebrows and stared at her phone for a moment.","She opened her laptop and her fingers started flying over the keyboard...","Ten minutes later.","Qiao Nian sent an audio file to her phone, then got up and went to the bathroom to wash up.","She grabbed her things as soon as she’d changed, slung them over her shoulder, and headed downstairs.","Downstairs.","Gu San was talking to the young man on the sofa. The man was holding a newspaper and seemed to be reading it leisurely.","Seeing the girl come down from the corner of his eye, Ye Wangchuan put down the newspaper and looked up with a gentle gaze. “You’re up?”","“Yeah,” Qiao Nian replied as she walked down the stairs. “I’m going out for a while.”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and stood up to pick up his car keys. He walked to her side and asked quite naturally, “Where are you going? I’ll drive you.”","Qiao Nian wanted to say, “No need.”","Seeing that he already had the car keys in his hand, she moved her mouth but couldn’t refuse. She could only say, “The Jiang family.”","Gu San subconsciously looked at her with a surprised expression when he heard the words “Jiang family”, as if he was confused. He didn’t know why Qiao Nian was going there at this time.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t even look up or ask the girl for a reason. He just walked in front and said, “Let’s go.”","Feeling a little irritated, Qiao Nian touched the bridge of her nose and followed the man.","*","Jiang Residence.","Jiang Zongnan had just sent Qi Yan off before going back inside.","The atmosphere in the house was heavy. Everyone seemed to have something on their minds and no one spoke.","Jiang Zongnan didn’t know what to say. He instructed the servant to make him a cup of tea. “Aunt Wang, make me a cup of bitter tea.”"]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 I’m Looking For Jiang Xianrou Today","paragraphs":["1585 I’m Looking For Jiang Xianrou Today","The servants at home had deliberately avoided talking to the guests earlier, but they had more or less felt the different atmosphere in the house recently.","Aunt Wang answered numbly and walked into the kitchen to look for tea bags.","Jiang Zongnan had just sat down when he heard the sound of a car stopping outside.","He took a sip of the bitter tea Aunt Wang had just brewed and frowned, then asked unhappily, “Why is there the sound of a car outside? Who’s here?”","Jiang Yao and Tang Wanru were sitting on the sofa on the other side. Both of them were preoccupied and no one answered him.","Jiang Zongnan frowned and rubbed his temples, about to order the servants to go out and take a look.","Turning around, he saw Qiao Nian walking in from the corner of his eye.","“N-Nian Nian?”","Jiang Zongnan put down the cup in surprise and stood up. He looked at the girl who had walked in, unable to believe his eyes.","Tang Wanru and Jiang Yao raised their heads and looked in the door’s direction.","The girl swaggered in with a strong aura. Her collar was slightly open, and she walked to the living room under the gazes of the three Jiang family members.","She didn’t waste her breath. After standing still, she raised her eyelids expressionlessly and said concisely, “Where’s Jiang Xianrou? I’m looking for her.”","How f*cking arrogant!","The three members of the Jiang family were actually stunned by her and couldn’t react for a moment.","Jiang Yao, on the other hand, was the fastest to react. He immediately frowned and observed Qiao Nian’s expression. He felt inexplicably uneasy and asked gently, “Qiao Nian, why did you suddenly come here to look for Xianrou? Why are you looking for her?”","Jiang Zongnan also reacted. He came back to his senses and looked at the girl. He asked gently, “That’s right, Nian Nian, why are you looking for Xianrou?”","Qiao Nian didn’t sit on the sofa with them. She casually dragged a chair over and sat down. Her aura was so strong that it was hard to breathe. Ignoring the Jiang father and son, she raised her eyes and looked over with her dark pupils, then said coldly, “I’m looking for Jiang Xianrou today. As for why I’m looking for her, we’ll talk about it when she comes out.”","Tang Wanru was so angry that her face turned green. She was about to flare up.","Jiang Zongnan first gave Jiang Yao a helpless look, asking him to call Jiang Xianrou out.","Jiang Yao thought so, too. Without further ado, he went to the second floor to look for her.","*","Tang Wanru’s head was so tense that it hurt.","She felt uncomfortable. Especially when she looked at the girl sitting in her living room. Then, she remembered Qi Yan.","Her eyes flashed. She tidied her hair and suddenly said, “Qiao Nian, did you kidnap Qi Lanyin because of Jiang Li?”","It would have been fine if she hadn’t mentioned this, but bringing it up was undoubtedly looking for trouble.","Jiang Zongnan immediately glared at her, signaling her not to speak.","How could Tang Wanru listen to him? Her eyes narrowed as she warned in a low voice, “Qi Yan has already come to our house twice. They already know that it was you. Enough, don’t make a big deal out of this.”","Seeing that she was not listening to him and was still talking, Jiang Zongnan quickly interrupted her, “Alright! Why are you talking about this? Didn’t I already say not to mention this!”","“What do you mean? I didn’t agree.” Tang Wanru was furious. “Xianrou is your daughter. Do you think an outsider is more important than your own daughter? What are you thinking?”"]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 Sister Nian: You’re Not Worthy of Being a Mother","paragraphs":["1586 Sister Nian: You’re Not Worthy of Being a Mother","She turned to look at Qiao Nian. This time, she couldn’t even be bothered to save face and directly asked the girl, “Did you arrange for the bodyguards at the hospital?”","Jiang Zongnan asked a servant to make tea for Qiao Nian. Just then, it was delivered.","Qiao Nian didn’t drink the Jiang family’s tea. While waiting for Jiang Xianrou to come downstairs, she kept her cap on and played with her phone.","Jiang Zongnan saw that she was typing a message.","Hearing Tang Wanru’s words, the girl who had been playing with her phone with her head lowered looked up and put her phone down. Her eyes were cold and dry as she glanced at her and said fearlessly, “Oh, it was me.”","Angered by her attitude, Tang Wanru’s face turned red. “You! What right do you have...”","Jiang Yao led Jiang Xianrou down the stairs before she could finish speaking.","Qiao Nian glanced at the person coming down from the second floor and smiled. Her smile was filled with mockery. She then glanced at the angry Tang Wanru and slowly replied, “You’re not worthy.”","Tang Wanru was silent.","Initially, she didn’t understand what Qiao Nian meant. However, she wasn’t stupid. After some thought, she understood what the girl meant.","... Qiao Nian was saying that she wasn’t worthy of being a mother!","Her well-maintained face instantly turned the color of pig liver. Her fingernails were about to break. She stood up abruptly, looking like she was about to argue with Qiao Nian.","“Alright, alright.” Jiang Zongnan hurriedly pulled her back. He played the role of a peacemaker, not allowing her to argue with Qiao Nian.","Tang Wanru knew that his attitude clearly showed that he wanted to protect Qiao Nian.","She was so angry that she almost fainted.","She couldn’t understand it. Qiao Nian was just an outsider. Why were all the men at home siding with her?","Who was the family member!","Therefore, she didn’t want to go to the hospital to see Jiang Li this time. None of them made her worry.","Seeing this scene, Jiang Xianrou came down from the second floor and pretended not to see that there was another person in the house. She walked straight to Jiang Zongnan and Tang Wanru and shouted, “Dad, Mom. Why are you looking for me?”","Tang Wanru couldn’t be bothered to say anything.","Jiang Zongnan said awkwardly, “It’s not us, it’s Nian Nian. She came to the house to look for you. She seems to have something to tell you.”","As if she had just noticed Qiao Nian, Jiang Xianrou glanced in the girl’s direction and said coldly, “Why are you looking for me?”","Qiao Nian was quite impressed by her ability to show off. She looked up and asked in a low voice, “Did you call Jiang Li?”","Jiang Xianrou suddenly looked at her, pursed her lips, and kept quiet.","Beside her, Jiang Yao asked her in confusion, “You called Jiang Li? When?”","“Could it be...” Realizing when Jiang Xianrou made that call, he was not calm anymore.","Jiang Xianrou interrupted him irritably, “Brother, do you believe her or me?”","Jiang Yao was silent for a moment and did not answer her immediately.","Jiang Xianrou’s frustration deepened. She pursed her lips and said very coldly, “I haven’t called him.”","After saying that, she still felt that it wasn’t enough. She turned her head and looked at the girl face to face. Her eyes were sharp and fierce as she emphasized again, “If you came here to question me, then let me tell you that I haven’t called him. If you don’t believe me, you can call Jiang Li immediately and ask him. Turn on the loudspeaker and let everyone hear what he has to say.”","She wasn’t afraid that Qiao Nian would ask Jiang Li for confirmation on the spot. Jiang Li was stubborn but soft-hearted. He had promised her that he wouldn’t betray her. If Qiao Nian came to settle scores with her, she would only take the blame."]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 Evidence in Front of Her","paragraphs":["1587 Evidence in Front of Her","Jiang Xianrou’s attitude was neither servile nor overbearing. She was very confident.","Even Jiang Zongnan frowned and looked at Qiao Nian. After a moment of hesitation, he said, “Nian Nian, are you mistaken? I don’t think Xianrou called Xiao Li.”","“Heh, do you think I need to ask Jiang Li for proof?”","Qiao Nian stared at Jiang Xianrou’s face with her exquisite eyes. The corners of her lips curled up mockingly. She smiled and took out her phone. In front of the four members of the Jiang family, she found the recording and threw the phone on the table.","Jiang Xianrou’s voice came clearly from the phone.","“Do you know that Qiao Nian kidnapped Qi Lanyin because of you?","“Because Qiao Nian kidnapped Qi Lanyin, the Qi family came to tell Dad that they wanted to go through legal procedures. Jiang Li, do you know how many years she’ll be sentenced to for kidnapping?","“...If the Qi family really wants to go through the legal process with her, the only one who will be unlucky is her!","“Remember, don’t say I told you. I don’t want to get on the wrong side of her crazy ass.”","The recording of the phone call was like a loud slap to Jiang Xianrou’s face. She paled, and her lips lost their color.","After the recording was over, Qiao Nian bent down and picked up the phone on the table. Her sharp gaze swept across the faces of the Jiang family members, past Jiang Zongnan and the others. Her gaze landed on Jiang Xianrou, whose fingers were trembling. She pulled down the brim of her cap, and her dark eyes were cold. With a faint smile, she asked, “Jiang Xianrou, the Qi family wants to go through the legal procedures with me?”","“...” Jiang Xianrou pinched her palms and said nothing.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were fierce and arrogant, yet casual. “If I don’t stop now, the Qi family will follow legal procedures. I’ll be the only one to suffer?","“I want to know how the Qi family and you plan to make me suffer.”","Every word Qiao Nian said now was like a resounding slap to Jiang Xianrou’s face. Her fair face gradually turned red as she glared fiercely at the girl who didn’t give her any face at all.","However, Qiao Nian didn’t care about her fierce gaze at all. Instead, she raised her perfect chin slightly and looked at her coldly and impatiently. Her voice was low and frivolous. “Jiang Xianrou, how many years do you want to sentence me to?”","Jiang Xianrou almost bit her lip to death.","It was the first time in 20 years that someone had humiliated her so directly.","All the blood in her body rushed to her head, and her face turned pale. Her cheeks were so hot that they were about to burn. However, Qiao Nian had thrown out the recording of her call with Jiang Li.","She pinched the palm of her hand until her nails threatened to break. She couldn’t find a chance to argue.","She was beginning to understand.","Qiao Nian was deliberately using the evidence to slap her in the face!","Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao had long been shocked speechless by what Jiang Xianrou had said on the phone.","Only Tang Wanru heard Qiao Nian’s words of humiliation towards Jiang Xianrou. The veins on her neck popped out, and she interrupted in a low voice, “Even if-even if Xianrou called her brother, so what? Do we need to give you an explanation just because our family made a call? Qiao Nian, do you know that your actions have already involved violating other people’s privacy? What right do you have to record their phone calls? What you’re doing is illegal. I can call the police!”","“Didn’t you just call the police?” Qiao Nian finally ignored her for the first time. Her dark eyes were fierce and arrogant as she asked, “...Do you want me to call 110 for you?”"]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 I Heard You Really Want to Go to the Independent Continent?","paragraphs":["1588 I Heard You Really Want to Go to the Independent Continent?","“You—” Tang Wanru was stunned. Her face was green with anger when she came back to her senses.","But at the same time, she knew very well that Qiao Nian was not afraid of her calling the police!","She had done this at the hospital a few days ago. However, no one came to deal with her even after she stood there for a long time.","“Jiang Xianrou, I have heard you really want to go to the Independent Continent?” Qiao Nian ignored her and turned her head to look at Jiang Xianrou with cold eyes.","Her bloody aura seemed to have retracted a little, but only a little. The aura on the big shot was still very strong.","“What are you trying to do?!” Jiang Xianrou’s reaction was huge. At least, it was much bigger than when Qiao Nian had told her that she had called Jiang Li.","It could be seen how important the spot to the Independent Continent was to her.","“I got it.” Qiao Nian understood. She smiled and made a call in front of her and turned on the speaker.","Every dial tone was like a small hammer hitting the hearts of the Jiang family members.","Jiang Xianrou’s heart sank. She was extremely uneasy, and her heart beat faster. Her lips and voice were nervous. “Qiao Nian, don’t go crazy here. I—”","She had yet to finish speaking when the call went through.","An old man’s voice came from the other end of the phone. “Hello. Why do you have time to call me? Did the sun rise from the west today?”","The old man’s voice was cheerful. It was obvious that he had a good relationship with Qiao Nian, so good that he could joke with her.","“Ah, I’m looking for you.” Qiao Nian spoke to the other party calmly.","However, Jiang Xianrou paled. She suddenly looked over, her beautiful eyes flashing with panic and uneasiness. Her heart was racing and was about to rush out of her throat.","She recognized the voice of the person on the other end of the line.","Zhong Yiliu.","The head of the Pharmacy Association.","The famous master pharmacist.","Why did Qiao Nian call Dean Zhong?","A thought appeared in Jiang Xianrou’s mind. As soon as this thought crawled out, her heart was about to stop, and her expression turned even uglier.","“Uh... what’s the matter?” Zhong Yiliu didn’t know that there was someone else with Qiao Nian. He thought that it was just a private call. As he called Qiao Nian, he was still looking at the experimental data of the new medicine he had made on his computer.","Qiao Nian said concisely, “Is there a spot for the Pharmacist Association to go to the Independent Continent this year?”","Zhong Yiliu was talking to Qiao Nian on his cell phone with one hand, while his other hand was on the mouse, dragging down the data form.","Hearing this, he let go of the mouse and replied in confusion, “Ah, there seems to be a spot. Don’t we have a spot like this every year? Why are you suddenly concerned about this? What’s wrong?”","From the corner of her eye, Qiao Nian glanced at Jiang Xianrou and asked casually, “Has the candidate for this year been decided?”","“This year?” Zhong Yiliu didn’t understand why she suddenly asked this. He said, “Wait for me. I’ll check.”","He turned off the experimental data and rummaged through the old-fashioned computer in the laboratory. After a while, Zhong Yiliu found the information folder that Robert had transferred to him from the desktop folder. He clicked on it and found the documents for this year.","As he read, he spoke to the girl on the other end of the phone.","“The person for this year has been selected.”","*","The Jiang family.","Jiang Xianrou’s heart rose to her throat when she heard the old man’s voice.","In spite of herself, she tensed. She clenched her fists and waited nervously for the results."]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 One Second in Heaven, The Next Second in Hell","paragraphs":["1589 One Second in Heaven, The Next Second in Hell","Qiao Nian smiled upon seeing her nervous expression, but the smile didn’t reach her eyes. Her voice was emotionless as she asked lazily, “Who is it?”","“The quality of the new members of the Pharmacy Association this year isn’t very good. It used to be better in the past. We just got the most decent one among them. You’ve heard the name before, it’s the one that I mentioned to you before—that the newcomer who asked if you had the time to bring her along, Jiang Xianrou.”","Zhong Yiliu had always been straightforward with her. He didn’t have any scruples and only said a few more words.","“She’s the one chosen this year.","“Speaking of which, she also came from Qing University, just like you. I thought about that too. I wanted to nurture a few more talents for your country. I only gave her this spot when Robert mentioned it to me.","“Jiang Xianrou is a newcomer with a certain level of ambition. It’s a pity that she didn’t spend all her time on academics. Her talent is only so-so. She definitely can’t compare to you.”","Zhong Yiliu spoke intuitively.","There was nothing tactful about it.","After all, Jiang Xianrou was just an ordinary member of the Pharmacy Association. As the president, there was no need for him to be tactful when commenting on a new member.","It was Jiang Xianrou’s honor that he could remember her as one of the new members this year!","At this moment, this honor did not make Jiang Xianrou happy.","Because what Zhong Yiliu said to Qiao Nian after that was too harsh, she felt a little embarrassed.","Even so, Jiang Xianrou couldn’t suppress her joy when she heard with her own ears that the Pharmacist Association was going to give her a spot to go to the Independent Continent this year.","However, in the next second, Qiao Nian made her fall from heaven to hell.","“Change it to someone else.”","Zhong Yiliu was confused. “Who? Are you going?”","Jiang Xianrou immediately stared fixedly at the girl.","Zhong Yiliu was still talking. “Of course, it’s best if you go, but I believe you won’t.”","Qiao Nian smiled as well. She said lazily, “I’m not going, but anyone can go. As long as it isn’t Jiang Xianrou, anyone will do.”","“Did she offend you?” Zhong Yiliu asked curiously.","Qiao Nian admitted frankly, “Yes, she did. She offended me quite badly.”","“Oh, I see.”","Zhong Yiliu was only asking out of curiosity. After all, he knew Qiao Nian’s personality well. She wasn’t easy to offend.","He was just wondering how this new member of his association had the ability to offend Qiao Nian.","However, he wasn’t particularly interested in anything other than drug research. After a simple question and hearing the answer, he let it go. “Alright, I’ll change to someone else.","“...I originally wanted to give her a chance on your account. Since she offended you, forget it. Anyway, there’s still some time before we go to the Independent Continent. I’ll get my subordinates to choose another one.”","Qiao Nian thanked him and hung up.","The Jiang family was silent.","No one spoke.","Tang Wanru’s face turned green.","Jiang Xianrou’s expression was no longer just ugly. It was as if she had fallen into the water. Her face and lips were pale. Her entire body was trembling, and she looked at Qiao Nian as if she could eat her.","“Qiao Nian, what are you doing!”","Jiang Xianrou’s voice trembled as she tried her best to calm herself down. However, under such circumstances, she even wanted to scream hysterically.","She might have felt better if she hadn’t known at the beginning that she was the one who was supposed to be the representative of the Pharmacy Association.","However, when she heard that she had been chosen and had just watched helplessly as the opportunity slipped away... This kind of extreme psychological blow almost crushed Jiang Xianrou."]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 Sister Nian: Move Out of My House","paragraphs":["1590 Sister Nian: Move Out of My House","“Do you have any idea what you’ve done!” She found her voice a little and raised it sharply.","However, Qiao Nian slowly put away her cell phone and looked at her with a cold expression. She said indifferently, “I know. You can’t go to the Independent Continent now.”","“If you knew, why did you still do this...” Jiang Xianrou felt her blood rush to her head. Her face suddenly turned red and she was about to go crazy.","Qiao Nian, on the other hand, was enjoying the look on her face. She stared at her casually and asked, “Are you angry?”","Then, she smiled wickedly. “Jiang Xianrou, are you so angry that you’re about to go crazy?”","Jiang Xianrou’s eyes flickered, and her throat seemed to be filled with cotton. She really wanted to say, “A lunatic really is a lunatic,” but she didn’t dare.","She actually did not dare.","This was because the girl’s bad temper had surfaced again. She actually didn’t dare to provoke Qiao Nian, afraid that the other party would do something even more ridiculous.","“Remember this feeling of being on the verge of going crazy.”","Qiao Nian was rather impatient to waste time with her. However, Jiang Xianrou was very good at courting death. Every time, she would accurately cross her bottom line. Otherwise, she really wouldn’t be bothered to argue with Jiang Xianrou. Because they were of different levels, there was no need for that.","“You don’t have to think about going to the Independent Continent anymore. As long as I don’t agree, you won’t be qualified to win a spot even if you stay in the Pharmacy Association for 10 or 20 years.”","Jiang Xianrou’s face turned green. She was so angry that she couldn’t breathe. A bloody taste welled up in her throat. She was really about to die from anger.","“I advise you to behave yourself. Don’t play tricks. It’s fine if you play around at home, but you’ll only embarrass yourself outside... This time, I still have the patience to warn you. Next time, my patience might even run out. If it comes to that, I don’t know what I’ll do to you.”","That was harsh.","At the very least, Jiang Xianrou’s face flushed red.","Qiao Nian had no intention of responding to her. She gave her a cold look, picked up her things, and was about to leave. “Since you’re unwilling to stand up for my brother, as a family, you can at least not be a burden, right?”","Jiang Zongnan and Jiang Yao lowered their heads at the same time, feeling a little embarrassed.","“If you can’t even do this and still want to use him in exchange for benefits... Sure. Come at me, I’ll play along with you anytime!”","Qiao Nian’s eyes turned cold, and her aura pressured them again. “But if you call him again and make him feel uneasy while recuperating, don’t blame me for not showing you any mercy.","“A person’s face is earned by themselves, not given by others. I’ll say what I’ve said today once. Next time, I’ll be serious.”","What she meant was that Jiang Xianrou throwing away the spot to go to the Independent Continent that she had been looking forward to for a long time was just a small warning. She had yet to get serious.","Jiang Yao couldn’t imagine what Qiao Nian would do if she was really serious.","Would their family be like the Qi family?","Qi Yan, who was very capable, had come to their house twice in just a few days. She was getting milder and more timid each time.","Their family was inferior to the Qi family.","Before Qiao Nian left, she stopped again. This time, she didn’t look back and simply said, “I remember that this house is mine?”","She remembered that when they split up, Old Master Jiang had left this house to her.","Qiao Nian said impatiently, “I want this house back. Move out as soon as possible.”","She left without a backward glance, leaving them with a cool and sassy back view."]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 Sister Nian: I Think You’re Quite Free","paragraphs":["1591 Sister Nian: I Think You’re Quite Free","Outside.","A black car was parked quietly under the old banyan tree. The shadow of the treetops happened to cover the strong model.","Seeing the girl walking out of the villa, Ye Wangchuan stubbed out his cigarette and smiled brightly. He reached out to press the air conditioner in the car and opened the door so that the air could circulate in and disperse the remaining smoke in the car.","Qiao Nian happened to come over at this moment. She opened the door of the front passenger seat, got into the car nimbly, and closed the door. “Sorry for the wait.”","!!","Ye Wangchuan saw her cold expression and raised his eyebrows. He picked up a bottle of water and unscrewed the cap before handing it to her, then asked, “How did things go?”","Qiao Nian reached out and took it naturally. Her fair fingers held the bottle of mineral water. She seemed to be in a very ordinary mood as she said irritably, “Just like that.”","She paused again, a frustrated look on her face. She lowered her head and took a sip of water. Then, she casually screwed the cap back on and placed the bottle by her side. She propped her arm on the side of the car window and sat in a rather unruly manner. “They’re from the Jiang family, after all. I can’t do much to them.”","One had to look at the owner before they hit the dog.","Jiang Xianrou was quite annoying, but she was Jiang Li’s biological sister, her father’s niece, and Old Master Jiang’s granddaughter.","With this blood connection involved, it was impossible for her to do things without any scruples.","Qiao Nian paused for a second, just for a second. Then, she raised her cold eyes filled with a hazy ruthlessness and said slowly, “However, I reckon she has learned her lesson this time. In the future, she will remember what she’s worth before she does anything evil!”","The girl’s arrogance was fully unleashed.","It was very attractive!","Ye Wangchuan’s dark and deep eyes were half-closed. He carefully fastened her seatbelt and sat back in his seat, then curled his lips and said, “Where are we going next?”","The man’s faint scent of cologne approached and left.","Qiao Nian’s calm heart rippled. She felt a little frustrated by his teasing. Hence, she calmly adjusted the temperature of the air conditioner in the car. “Captain Bo just called me to say that he’s back in Beijing. I need to go back to Rhine Apartments to get my things first, then go to his house.”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened. He knew what she was going back to get.","Qiao Nian wanted to go back and get the black box that Ji Qing had crashed in.","He turned the key in the ignition and started the car. “I’ll drive you there,” he said naturally.","Qiao Nian turned her head and glanced at him.","Ye Wangchuan looked down and seemed quite calm. His eyes met hers and he asked ambiguously, “What’s wrong?”","“Nothing.”","Qiao Nian looked away.","But in the next second, she looked over at him again and studied him deeply. “You haven’t been working recently?”","She saw that he was quite free!","Ye Wangchuan was stunned for a moment before he realized what she meant. Chuckling, he replied lazily, “I have a job. I’m quite busy.”","Qiao Nian was even more confused. She restrained her curiosity and said slowly, “...Is that so? Forgive me for not being able to tell.”","Ye Wangchuan suddenly stopped the car by the side of the road and looked over. His gaze was hot as he stared at her, and his lips curled up slightly. He looked lazy and noble, but in fact, his slightly open shirt collar was as seductive as a disaster. “What can I do? I’m busy. My girlfriend is even busier than me. If I don’t take the initiative, I won’t even be able to see my girlfriend all day.”"]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 Master Wang: I’ll Get What I Want","paragraphs":["1592 Master Wang: I’ll Get What I Want","Qiao Nian was speechless.","She wanted to slap herself.","Tsk, this stinky mouth of hers knew that nothing good would happen every time she provoked him, but she still touched his sore spot anyway.","Their car was parked on the side of the road. From time to time, curious passers-by would look into the car.","Qiao Nian was silent for a moment before looking over.","The man seemed to be waiting for her to explain. He had one arm on the steering wheel and his posture was lazy. His thin lips were raised in a faint smile as if he was waiting for her to explain.","Qiao Nian, who was mentally prepared, was speechless.","—She didn’t want to speak!","Qiao Nian fell silent.","The main thing was that she didn’t know how to handle this situation. It was fine for her to fight, but to coax her boyfriend... She felt that she might as well fight.","Qiao Nian’s nerves were tense, her temples throbbing. She frowned. “I...”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t help her out this time. His calm appearance was especially annoying.","Qiao Nian took a deep breath and gradually calmed down. She pursed her lips and said, “Let me buy you a gift.”","Her straightforward words caught Ye Wangchuan off guard.","Buy a gift?","It was... her solution.","Qiao Nian seemed to have found her backbone. She looked at him calmly again. Her eyes were clear and bright, and her speech was much smoother. “What kind of gift do you want? I’ll buy it for you another day.”","There was some silence.","Even the experienced and knowledgeable Young Master Ye of Beijing was a little stunned by Qiao Nian’s reaction. He stared at her with a burning gaze and asked with a dry throat, “What do you want to buy me?”","“I haven’t thought about it.” The girl admitted it very frankly, making it clear that she was trying to patronize him.","Then, she propped up her chin and pondered for a moment. She turned around and said to him excitedly, “Why don’t I transfer a red packet to your WeChat? You can buy it yourself.”","Qiao Nian felt that this was a good idea.","He might not like what she bought, but he would definitely be able to buy what he wanted if she sent him a red packet.","Ye Wangchuan was amused by this feeling of being kept by a rich woman. He chuckled and asked her lazily, “How much do you plan to transfer to me?”","Qiao Nian thought about his usual spending standards and took out her cell phone, planning to transfer tens of thousands of yuan to him first, but someone suddenly grabbed her cell phone before she could turn around.","“No need.” The man’s voice was low and husky, his handsome face magnified as he leaned closer. “I’ll get what I want myself!”","The kiss ended it all.","A certain someone even carefully helped her adjust her seatbelt before sitting back in satisfaction. He started the car again and said with a smile, “Let’s go back to Rhine Apartments first. I’ll accompany you to get your things before sending you to Uncle Bo.”","Qiao Nian wiped the corner of her lips. The area where her fingertips touched was slightly painful. Without looking, she already knew it was definitely red.","Speechless, she pulled down her baseball cap and collapsed in the passenger seat. She didn’t even want to speak anymore. “... Mm.”","When Ye Wangchuan saw that the girl did not want to talk to him, he could not help but raise his thin lips again. He was in a good mood and said to her in a low voice, “If you encounter the Jiang family’s second branch next time, don’t step forward if it’s uncomfortable for you. Tell me and I’ll help you deal with it.”","Qiao Nian’s attention was pulled back. She tilted her head to look at him, then slowly retracted her gaze. Warmth flowed through her heart, and she nodded. “Okay.”","Then, she pressed the window back up and said slowly, “Got it.”"]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 Just Give Up the Idea of Going to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1593 Just Give Up the Idea of Going to the Independent Continent","“Let’s go back.”","Ye Wangchuan smiled and placed his hand on the steering wheel again, revealing a pale and powerful wrist. The prayer beads on his wrist were especially striking. He looked ascetic and sexy when he wore them.","He hit the gas and the car shot away like an arrow.","*","The Jiang family.","Qiao Nian had been gone for half an hour.","The villa was still silent except for Tang Wanru’s soft sobs.","Jiang Zongnan sat on the couch for a long time, unable to calm down. At this moment, he slowly accepted reality. He rubbed his temples and stood up, then said gently to the woman who was still sitting on the couch sobbing softly, “Alright, don’t cry anymore. It’s already happened, so crying is useless. Let’s pack up and prepare to move.”","Tang Wanru raised her head and stared at him fiercely. She said indignantly, “Look at her attitude! Didn’t Xianrou just call her brother? She kicked such a fuss over it. She directly called Dean Zhong of the Pharmacy Association and canceled Xianrou’s spot in the Independent Continent! She... How could she do that!”","“Is there any point in saying this now? Things have already come to this. We can only accept reality.”","Jiang Zongnan was calmer than her. He looked at his daughter, whose eyes were red, but not crying.","Sighing, he walked over and placed his hand on Jiang Xianrou’s shoulder, silently comforting her. “Since things have already come to this, no one expected Nian Nian to know someone from the Pharmacy Association. She has already called the dean... You, just let go of the idea of going to the Independent Continent.”","Jiang Xianrou’s emotions finally found a breakthrough when she heard this. She looked up with red eyes and clenched her fists. “Dad, do you also think she’s right?”","“I didn’t say that,” Jiang Zongnan said subconsciously.","Jiang Xianrou really wanted to go to the Independent Continent.","Everyone in their family knew this.","In order to get a spot to go to the Independent Continent, Jiang Xianrou had been working very hard recently. She had been trying her best to get the Pharmacist Association to notice her.","Everything had been going well. She was just one step away.","But Nian Nian knew Zhong Yiliu.","“Ay!” Jiang Zongnan sighed. He didn’t know how to comfort her. “Take it easy. You lost your chance this time, but there are other opportunities. You don’t have to go to the Independent Continent to prove yourself.","“Dad knows you’re outstanding, but this... you’re not doing it right either.”","Jiang Zongnan had always valued the education of his children.","It was true that Jiang Xianrou was his favorite daughter, but he didn’t dote on her unconditionally.","“You shouldn’t have called your second brother and said that. He’s just finished his surgery and is still recuperating in the hospital. The doctor has said many times that he needs to rest and not worry too much. You know he’s on good terms with Nian Nian, but you still provoked him. He must be anxious. This won’t be good for his recovery.”","Jiang Zongnan placed his hand on her shoulder and said softly, “So don’t blame your sister. It’s normal for her to be angry. She... only has a good relationship with Jiang Li in this family. You just had to provoke your brother and happen to overstep her bottom line. It would be strange if she didn’t find trouble with you.”","Jiang Xianrou bit her lip and her eyes flickered. She felt that what he said was ridiculous.","She provoked Jiang Li?","When had she provoked him?","All she wanted was for Jiang Li to stop that lunatic Qiao Nian from making things difficult for the Qi family. Was it wrong to look out for herself?"]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 Sister Nian Smashed Her Face","paragraphs":["1594 Sister Nian Smashed Her Face","If she didn’t plan for herself, which of them would?","Jiang Li, Old Master.","Everyone in the family stood on Qiao Nian’s side and went against her in every way. If she hadn’t been forced into a corner, would she have needed an outsider as her backer?","It wasn’t easy for her to get into the Pharmacy Association. It was bad enough that they weren’t happy for her, but they were even dragging her down.","!!","This time, her father even said that Qiao Nian was not in the wrong.","If Qiao Nian was not, then she was the one at fault?","Jiang Xianrou felt like her anger and grievances were about to rush out of her throat. She wished she could throw a tantrum hysterically, but rationality did not allow her to do so. She also didn’t want others to see her fall apart under Qiao Nian’s feet.","“I understand.” She pushed Jiang Zongnan’s hand away expressionlessly and said coldly, “Dad, Mom, I’m going back to my room to pack.”","Jiang Zongnan looked at her dejected back view and frowned.","Of course, he knew that Qiao Nian had done nothing wrong.","However, who wouldn’t feel sorry for their child? He felt terrible upon seeing Jiang Xianrou’s pale face and how disappointed she was.","Jiang Zongnan rubbed his temples, turned around, and said to the others in the living room, “You guys clean up too.”","Tang Wanru’s expression was extremely ugly. She sat still and did not say a word.","Jiang Yao replied in a low voice. He frowned and looked at him. Finally, he couldn’t hold it in anymore and said in a low voice, “Dad, Nian Nian knows someone from the Pharmacy Association?”","Jiang Zongnan was about to go up when he heard that. He stopped and turned around, looked at him thoughtfully, and said, “I’m not sure.”","Jiang Yao hesitated.","He really couldn’t figure out what was going on with Qiao Nian.","He had checked her background. It was very clean.","Before Qiao Nian came to Beijing, she had always stayed in Rao City and had never left.","Despite her background, Qiao Nian was surrounded by a large group of people with mysterious backgrounds.","She even had an extraordinary relationship with Zhong Yiliu from the Pharmacy Association in the faraway Continent O.","Everyone knew that the people from the Pharmacy Association were proud and aloof. Even if they begged them, they might not help.","However, Qiao Nian did not even give a reason, and Dean Zhong of the Pharmacy Association immediately canceled Xianrou’s spot.","Jiang Yao said in a low voice, “I keep feeling that everything around Qiao Nian is a mystery.”","Jiang Zongnan also felt the same way. It was just that as an elder, he could not restrain his children well, causing the family to be in such a state. He was too embarrassed to ask her.","“Dad, the Qi family...”","Jiang Zongnan looked at him with a smile. “Do you still think we still have the bandwidth to care about the Qi family?”","Jiang Yao fell silent.","Because he suddenly realized that if Qiao Nian did not take them seriously, they would be nothing.","The Qi family... was not something they could interfere with just because they wanted to!","“I didn’t say I wanted to care about them, but I just...” Jiang Yao could not explain it clearly. He was just frustrated and very confused.","“No buts.” Jiang Zongnan was much calmer than him. He had never thought of using Jiang Li’s accident to exchange for benefits, nor had he thought of using his status as an elder to suppress Qiao Nian.","However, things had developed to this point.","He was open and honest, so there was nothing to be ashamed of. The only thing he should be ashamed of was not disciplining his daughter well.","“Your brother is still lying in the hospital. Do you really want to go and plead for the Qi family?”","Jiang Yao was not so shameless. He fell silent again.","Jiang Zongnan waved his hand, extremely tired at this point. “This matter ends here!”","With that, Jiang Zongnan turned around and went upstairs to pack his things.","After all, he had lived here for twenty years. Many of the things he wanted to take away were very cumbersome. There were confidential company documents and some miscellaneous personal items."]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 Isn’t She Too Young?","paragraphs":["1595 Isn’t She Too Young?","Qiao Nian returned to Rhine to retrieve the black box from the plane crash and went to Bo Zheng’s house.","“Come in.”","Bo Zheng had a private house with a quiet environment in Beijing. The simple and unadorned house was located on the side of Chang’an Street. There were basically courtyard houses of all sizes around. They were made of green bricks and tiles and had the aura of time.","Homes in this area couldn’t be considered expensive, but ordinary people definitely couldn’t live in them.","On the other hand, Qiao Nian’s expression was calm. She had her hands in her pockets and her eyebrows didn’t even twitch. Her eyelashes were slightly lowered, as if she wasn’t surprised by Bo Zheng’s residence. She followed him in calmly.","Her calm and composed attitude attracted the attention of the butler instead. He glanced at Qiao Nian in surprise, then looked away obediently and followed the two of them.","In the living room, Bo Zheng led Qiao Nian to a seat and instructed the butler, “Make two cups of tea.”","“Of course, young master.” The butler bowed his head respectfully and prepared to make tea.","Only then did Bo Zheng seem to remember. He turned his head again, his attitude clearly gentle and respectful. “Miss Qiao, do you want tea or coffee?”","The butler stopped and couldn’t help but glance in the girl’s direction again. He was even more surprised.","This girl didn’t look old. He estimated that she was 18 or 19 years old and should still be studying. The girl was quite good-looking, one of the best in the entertainment industry, but she was too young!","He retracted his gaze and secretly looked at Bo Zheng. His expression became complicated.","Young Master was already in his 30s, but he had yet to find a partner.","Everyone in the family was urging him. After so many years of urging, the old lady was already anxious. She had even spread the word that as long as the young master was willing to bring someone back, their family would not care about matchmaking. She could live as long as it was a woman.","But... the old lady had never said anything about someone this young!","The old butler’s heart raced as he stole a few more glances at Qiao Nian. The more he looked at her, the better he felt.","Good-looking was one thing.","He still felt that the old lady would probably lose her mind if the Young Master brought this little girl home!","Qiao Nian sensed that the butler had been peeping at her. She reached out and pulled down the brim of her cap, then said casually, “I’m fine with anything.”","Bo Zheng’s eyebrows moved. He wanted to say something.","Qiao Nian said casually, “I want tea. There’s no need to change.”","Bo Zheng nodded and turned to the butler. “Then, two cups of tea. I remember that there’s black tea at home. Make a cup of black tea for Nian Nian.”","He turned back to Qiao Nian and said, “Green tea is cold in nature. Girls should drink less.”","The old butler’s expression instantly became complicated. He looked up at Bo Zheng with a conflicted expression, as if he wanted to say something but hesitated. He lowered his head again. “...Alright, I’ll go brew it immediately.”","“Okay, go ahead.” Bo Zheng didn’t notice his conflicting emotions and waved him off.","He didn’t waste any time when the old butler walked away. He went straight to the point and said to the girl, “Jingxing told me everything. You’re looking for a broadcasting device for a plane’s black box that has been discontinued?”","“Yes, a Boeing 737-300. Does Captain Bo have any broadcasting equipment for this model?” The girl’s eyes were quite delicate, and her dark eyes were transparent as she looked at him.","Bo Zheng was stunned by her gaze. He frowned and fell into deep thought. “A Boeing? An old 737-300? Let me think.”","Qiao Nian waited for him to think slowly."]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 Found the Device to Play the Black Box","paragraphs":["1596 Found the Device to Play the Black Box","Bo Zheng indeed liked mechanical collections very much. However, after thinking for a short moment, he looked up and said to her openly, “I remember there’s one at home. It’s in the storeroom. Do you want to come up with me to take a look?”","*","Bo Zheng’s house was very big. It was the kind of big with Chinese pavilions. The flowers and plants in the courtyard were obviously taken care of every day. They were built neatly and beautifully.","The storage room was filled with all kinds of airplane models and airplane equipment. He was just short of moving a plane and placing it at home.","It could be seen that Bo Jingxing was not joking when he said that his uncle had almost become an excellent pilot.","Bo Zheng rummaged inside.","Half an hour later, he brought out a dark device that looked like an old-fashioned gramophone. A smile appeared on his scholarly face as he said to the girl, “I found it.”","Bo Zheng took the player out and placed it on a stool. He found a plug and plugged it in.","Then, he said to Qiao Nian, “Did you bring the black box?”","“Yes, I brought it.” Qiao Nian unzipped her shoulder bag and took out the black box.","Bo Zheng took it and smiled. “Wait a moment. I’ll help you see if it works.”","“Alright.” Qiao Nian agreed quickly.","A few minutes later.","Bo Zheng adjusted the old-fashioned broadcasting equipment again and finally finished it. He stood up and said to the girl gentlemanly, “Miss Qiao, listen to it. I’ll wait for you outside.”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and thanked him. Then, she walked over and put down her shoulder bag.","“Take your time. There’s no hurry.” Bo Zheng nodded and smiled. Then, he went out and closed the storeroom door.","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened as she took out her phone, played the recording, and pressed it. Then, she placed the phone beside the playback device and pressed the play button.","The old-fashioned equipment had a poor sound effect.","Fortunately, the black box was well-preserved. A voice was finally released after two minutes of white space.","The front was filled with useless chatter.","Qiao Nian rested her chin on her hand, her face expressionless. However, she listened patiently, not pressing fast forward just because the first 10 minutes were boring.","Until a few minutes before the black box was about to finish playing.","The plane had encountered an accident, and the entire plane began to shake. The recording that had been very boring earlier began to add all kinds of noises.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes, her gaze turning sharp. Her relaxed expression faded, and she gradually became serious.","She waited in silence...","Amidst the commotion, Qiao Nian heard someone speaking.","“Are you sure she has the item?”","“Positive. Wei Ying said she saw it with her own eyes.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. Her fingers curled up on her lap, and her expression turned thoughtful.","Wei Ying?","The Wei family?","Then, amidst the noise, the two of them were still talking in low voices.","“But we checked that box carefully when we went through security. There was no such thing inside.”","This was the second time either of them had mentioned “that thing.”","Qiao Nian couldn’t help but notice this.","What were they looking for?","“Just because it wasn’t in the box doesn’t mean she didn’t have it with her. Don’t forget who Ji Qing is. She could’ve dodged security with the lift of a hand.”","“You’re right.”","“Our orders from above are to find something. If we can’t find it, we’ll destroy it along with everyone else!”"]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 She Might Have to Return to Rao City","paragraphs":["1597 She Might Have to Return to Rao City","“But what if—”","The man with the gruff voice interrupted, “Stop bleeping and carry out your mission. The plane is one minute and twenty seconds from crashing. Get ready. We’re going to jump.”","“Yeah.”","Qiao Nian heard the sound of static again. After that, she didn’t hear anything else.","She was propping up her chin, ready to pull out the black box and listen to it again.","Just then, at the last minute.","She heard a clear stream of Morse code.","Qiao Nian paused and narrowed her eyes. She immediately found a pen and paper to write down what she had heard.","The water-based pen wrote a series of letter codes on white paper.","The black box finished broadcasting the last second of seeds.","Qiao Nian had just finished writing down the last letter. Then, she picked up the paper.","The letters of the Morse cipher required a specific decryption equation.","Unfortunately, she was good at playing with these numerical equations.","Especially about the arrangement of numbers, letters.","Qiao Nian knew it by heart.","She didn’t need to go online to find out what the Morse code represented. She finished reading it and had already translated it.","—”I put the stuff in the library in Rao City’s Luohe County, cabinet 2203, password 0806.”","She was almost certain that her mother had left the code behind after Qiao Nian read the string of Morse codes.","The two people from before were quite stupid. From their voices, it was obvious that they were not very intelligent.","They would never know such a difficult Morse code, let alone think of a way to leave a message in Morse code.","Luohe County Library, Cabinet 2203?","Qiao Nian pondered for a moment before turning off the playback device. Then, she took out the black box and placed it back into her shoulder bag.","Then, she picked up her phone and scrolled through the recording she’d made, saving it.","Next, Qiao Nian threw the paper she had used to record the Morse code into the trash can. Then, she zipped up her shoulder bag, picked up her phone, and left the storage room.","Outside.","The old butler had already made tea. He brought it out and placed it on the coffee table in the living room.","Seeing her come out, Bo Zheng raised his eyebrows and asked gently, “How is Miss Qiao? Is that equipment working?”","Qiao Nian walked over, her voice clear and hoarse. “It works.”","“It’s good that it can be used.” Bo Zheng’s eyes relaxed and waved at her. He invited her gently, “Your tea is ready. Stay for lunch. Is there anything you want to eat? I’ll get the butler to buy it.”","When he said that, the old butler of the Bo family raised his head and revealed that painful and complicated expression again. He was speechless.","It was a good thing that the Young Master could find someone he liked, but... this age was really a little... he still felt that it was not appropriate.","But he dared not say so.","Qiao Nian noticed the butler’s complicated and conflicted reaction. With one hand in her pocket, she declined politely. “No, my friend is still waiting for me outside.”","She paused, looked up again, and said politely, “Captain Bo, let me treat you to a meal sometime.”","“Your friend?” Bo Zheng was stunned. He reacted and smiled. “I think it’s your boyfriend? Is Young Master Ye outside?”","Qiao Nian didn’t say anything. Frustrated, she tugged at her cap and coughed. “Ah. Um.”","Bo Zheng had already seen through her. Seeing that she admitted it readily and didn’t beat around the bush with him, he smiled and let her go. “Alright, you go ahead. However, we’ve agreed that this will be even. You helped me investigate Eagle Eye last time. I haven’t thanked you for what happened in Shuangjiang City. Luo Ming and I will treat you to a meal when you have time another day.”"]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 If Qiao Nian Is Not a Genius, There Probably Are No More Geniuses","paragraphs":["1598 If Qiao Nian Is Not a Genius, There Probably Are No More Geniuses","Qiao Nian opened her mouth to refuse, but Bo Zheng was especially insistent on treating her. “Don’t stand on ceremony with me. Otherwise, you’re not treating me as a friend. Let’s talk about this then. I’ll ask you out in advance when you’re free.”","What else could Qiao Nian say? She would seem impolite if she continued to refuse!","Qiao Nian wasn’t a petty person. She nodded and looked at him with her bright eyes.","“Okay. I’m free this month. I’ll tell you the exact time in advance.” Qiao Nian thought for a moment.","She still wasn’t sure if she should agree to Nie Mi’s request for her to go to the Independent Continent.","However, there was still a month left even if she agreed. She had nothing else to do for the next month.","Now, there was one more thing.","She might need time to make a trip back to Rao City.","Bo Zheng thought about it seriously and said, “Next week. Luo Ming went back to his hometown. The old man in his family is celebrating his birthday. He took a week off from me.”","Qiao Nian nodded and looked at the time. Then, she bade him farewell and left.","The girl’s back was straight, cool, and impressive.","After Qiao Nian left, the old butler couldn’t help but ask Bo Zheng, “Young Master, is this Miss Qiao Young Master Ye’s girlfriend? Could the Young Master Ye you mentioned be the one from the Ye family...”","The news surprised him more than the circumstances of his earlier misunderstanding.","“This girl looks quite ordinary. The Ye family’s status is even higher than ours. She... I’m afraid she won’t catch Old Master Ye’s eye!”","There were only a few families at the top of the pyramid in Beijing, but they were not completely on the same level.","The Ye family was stronger than the Bo family.","Just now, he thought about how young and good-looking the young lady was. After all, his young master was still young... At least he had some points.","However, many ladies in Beijing couldn’t find a chance to get close to that person from the Ye family. That person’s age, ability, skills, and appearance were all much better than their young master’s. He could definitely praise him for being young and promising!","He thought that Young Master Ye would at least be matched with a socialite. At the very least, she would be like Jiang Xianrou.","Unexpectedly, he found an ordinary girlfriend.","Bo Zheng glanced at him and seemed to know what he was thinking. He chuckled and interrupted the old butler’s thoughts. He said meaningfully, “Who else in the Ye family other than him? I’m talking about Ye Wangchuan.”","“Is she really Young Master Ye’s girlfriend?” The old butler looked even more shocked, unable to take it in for a moment.","Bo Zheng looked at his shocked expression and said indifferently, “When did you learn to judge a book by its cover? Just because you think she’s ordinary doesn’t mean that she’s really ordinary. You won’t understand even if I tell you more. Just go to Baidu and search for ‘Qiao Nian’.”","The top scorer of this year’s college entrance examination, the World Software Competition’s winner, the genius student accepted by Qing University, Mr. Huang and Master Nie’s last disciple, the genius musician Zhui Guang...","A casual search on Baidu revealed the halo of the genius behind every honor.","And an identity not available on the Internet—Sun of the Red Alliance.","If Qiao Nian was still considered an ordinary person, there were probably no geniuses in this world."]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 What a Coincidence!","paragraphs":["1599 What a Coincidence!","Outside, Qiao Nian was still unaware that she had been labeled as an ordinary person as she walked out with her things.","Ye Wangchuan was waiting for her outside.","Seeing the girl from the corner of his eye, he retracted his long legs and turned to open the door.","Qiao Nian had already seen him and was walking towards the black SUV.","Just then the phone in her pocket vibrated.","Qiao Nian took it out and looked down.","It was Wen Ruxia.","Her eyes narrowed. With one hand in her pocket and the other holding her phone, she picked up the call and continued walking in Ye Wangchuan’s direction.","“Hello,” she said in a low, husky voice that was flat and slow.","Wen Ruxia was stunned for a moment. Taking a deep breath and coming back to her senses, she said to the girl on the other end of the line, “Qiao Nian, do you have time? If it’s convenient for you, can we meet?”","“Now?”","Qiao Nian looked at the tall man in front of her. Seeing that she was on the phone, Ye Wangchuan reached out to help her with her bag.","Qiao Nian wasn’t used to the feeling of handing her things over to others. She pursed her lips and looked at the man’s overly attractive face with her dark and bright eyes, then silently handed him her shoulder bag.","Then, she spoke to him in a low voice. “A call from Chief Wen.”","Qiao Nian’s voice was like a breeze. It wasn’t obvious. In fact, it sounded a little muffled and unnatural.","However, Ye Wangchuan heard her clearly. His lips curled up as he opened the door and put her bag into the car. Then, he closed the door and opened the passenger door for her. He lowered his voice and said, “Get in first?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him again. Then, she bent her legs and got into the car.","One hand was still steady on the phone as she spoke to Wen Ruxia. “I can’t talk right now. What’s up?”","“Uh...” Wen Ruxia was clearly hesitant, as if she was wondering if she should say it over the phone.","Qiao Nian didn’t rush her. She reached out and closed the car door. Her sitting posture was very lazy, and her voice was indifferent. “Why don’t we talk about it another day?”","Another day would be too late.","Wen Ruxia stopped hesitating and briefly told her the matter.","It turned out that the television station had created a variety show. However, this variety show was not a popular element nowadays. Instead, it was a science and education variety show that introduced national treasures.","Such variety shows were not popular. They didn’t bring much attention and couldn’t invite famous celebrities.","As the director of this program had a good relationship with Wen Ruxia in private, and the director had advanced this project for several years, the director told her about the current difficulties. She thought of Qiao Nian when she heard that the first episode was about a Han dynasty clock.","She wanted to ask Qiao Nian if she had time to be a guest on this variety show.","Qiao Nian listened quietly until Wen Ruxia finished speaking. Then, she said politely, “I’m sorry, I might not have time.”","“You don’t have time...” Wen Ruxia couldn’t hide her disappointment, but she forced herself to stay awake and immediately said, “It’s fine. If you don’t have time, forget it. I was also thinking that the bells are a kind of traditional instrument. His variety show is in the form of an online live broadcast. It’s about an hour. It doesn’t take much time to film. That’s why I thought to ask you.”","To promote traditional musical instruments?","Qiao Nian’s slender fingers tapped on her phone, and her eyelashes fluttered slightly. After a moment of thought, she pursed her lips and asked, “Where is the variety show being filmed?”","Wen Ruxia’s hopes were rekindled. “Rao City.”"]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 Sister Nian: Too Many Fans, Phone Stuck","paragraphs":["1600 Sister Nian: Too Many Fans, Phone Stuck","“It’s in a township below Rao City, Luohe County. I don’t know if you’ve heard of the place.”","Luohe County.","What a coincidence!","Initially, Qiao Nian probably didn’t have the time to attend. However, after Wen Ruxia mentioned the location, she thought for a moment and didn’t reject it directly. “Send me the filming schedule and procedures later. I’ll go if I have time.”","!!","Wen Ruxia was naturally overjoyed and agreed repeatedly.","After Qiao Nian hung up, she put down her phone and fastened her seatbelt. Without anyone asking, she said, “Wen Ruxia called and said that she wants me to participate in a variety show.”","Ye Wangchuan was surprised. “You’re going?”","“Just one episode.” Qiao Nian frowned in frustration. Instead of answering immediately, she pushed up her cap and said casually, “Not necessarily. She said that the variety show is promoting traditional culture. Their first episode is going to recommend an ancient clock that happened to be excavated in Rao City. I’m from Rao City’s First High School, so she asked me to be a temporary guest. In addition, they’ll ask some celebrities to come.”","Ye Wangchuan handed her a glass of water. His eyes were calm and reserved as he patiently unscrewed the lid for her. “Did the MV you filmed previously air?”","“Which MV?” Qiao Nian took the cup from him and took a sip from the straw. She frowned, then relaxed. Remembering, she supported her chin with her hand and said lazily, “You’re talking about that.”","Ye Wangchuan saw her biting down on her lip and couldn’t help but glance at her moist lips. However, he looked away with great restraint and rolled down the window to let in the natural wind.","After the temperature in the car dropped and there was no longer the heat from before, Ye Wangchuan said unhurriedly, “I remember that the MV you filmed is about to be released. It should be in the next few days.”","Qiao Nian had a good memory, but she didn’t care so much about small matters. The moment he mentioned it, she immediately remembered. “I think it was released yesterday.”","She put the glass of water down and reached for her phone. “Let me see.”","Qiao Nian took her phone and logged on to Weibo. As soon as she logged on, her phone was stuck with an enormous number of messages.","It was overwhelming.","To be able to jam her phone to death, there had to be at least tens of thousands of messages.","Qiao Nian was speechless.","“Go back first? Or do you have somewhere to be?” Ye Wangchuan started the car and put his hand on the steering wheel. He turned the car smoothly.","Just as he turned his head to speak to her, he saw the girl holding her phone and frowning, not moving for a long time.","He tilted his head lazily, his black shirt giving off a shallow chill. “What’s wrong?”","Qiao Nian’s expression froze for a second. It was only a second. Then, she blinked and turned her head away. Resting her face in her hands, she said, “Ah, nothing.”","“Hmm?” Ye Wangchuan raised an eyebrow.","Qiao Nian was seriously frustrated. “I have too many fans. My phone is lagging.”","It was too much!","Ye Wangchuan was silent for a few seconds. He reached out and adjusted her cap before sitting back down. “Then, you can take care of it first. Tell me when you’re done.”","Qiao Nian’s phone had all been modified by her. It was just that there were too many posts about her on Weibo. It was jammed all of a sudden.","But it didn’t stick for long.","Qiao Nian operated the phone interface with one hand. Soon, the phone was back in use."]}]);
